<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malobhi Manyahi ngati moghalembakike na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malobhi Manyahi ngati moghalembakike na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Malobhi Manyahi ngati moghalembakike na Luka nde chimu chaki cha itabu nchechi ya Lulaghilu Lwahenu yeilongale matamu ghaka Yesu Kristo. Kila chimu chaki kilowakeka, “Injili.” Lilobhi lelibhi na ndandi ja, “Malobhi Manyahi.” Ayeye nde itabu yeyalembakiki baada ja kupotela Yesu, najombi nde Matayo, Mako, Luka, na Yohana. Luka ngachealembika mambu ghaghundongale Yesu pela, nambu akalembiki kabheti mambu ghabhaghahengiki bhabhulwa bhaka Yesu paakapotili na kuyoka kwaki. Chitabu hechi kilokeka Matendu gha Mitumi. Njeta joamanyi kwa uchakaka talehe ja kulembakeka kwa Injili jaka Luka, wala pandu pachalembakiki. Bhasomi bhamaheli bhajetangane kubha chakalembakiki mu hyaka ya 70 kutumbu paakabhelakiki Yesu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlemba wa chitabu acheche nde Luka, joakabhi sing'anga. Unyahi wa kulemba kwaki na kutumi kwa lugha ilangi kubha akabhi mundu joakabhi na malangu. Luka akapaliki kulemba mambu gha chakaka panani ja matamu ghaka Yesu kwa kulongela ngati bhela moghapitalile nahuli bhangi bhapata nyonjeka pabhaghasoma, Luka 1:1-3. Luka ngacheakabhi Myahude (Bhakolosai 4:10-14), na akalembiki kwa ntundu ambau bhala bhange bhangakubha Bhayahude bhaghamanyaje. Lijambu leniheli limanyikana wichu paajilongale mitetu ja Bhayahude, Luka 1:8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malobhi Manyahi ngati moghalembakake na Luka nde chitabu chekilengana na itabu ya Matayo na Mako, kwa ndandi itabu yeniheyi ilongale mambu ghalaghala kwa indela jejilengana. Mu itabu itatu ayeyi, chitabu chaka Luka nde chechilongale wichu mambu gha kubhelakeka kwaka Yohana Mbatizaji kwa chunkati nakanopi. Luka alandila nakanopi kwa mambu gha kulekakeka mahoku, Luka 3:3; 11:4; 17:3-4; 23:34; 24:47; na kundoba Chapanga kabhete, 3:21; 5:16; 6:12; 11:1-12; 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Luka abhoha ulongulelo wa Malobhi Manyahi na kulanda ndandi ja kulemba, (Sula 1:1-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete alongale kubhelekeka kwaka Yesu na ntundu moakabhekakaki wichu kwa ndandi ja lihengu, (Sula 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Pandu pakolongwa pa Malobhi Manyahi papahighalila, (Sula 4:14-21:38), Luka alongale mahengu ghaakahengiki Yesu, hasa ngangachu yeakahengiki na mambu ghaakabholike.</para>
  <para style="io">Kujomulela sula ibheli ya kujomukela, (Sula ja 22-24), Luka alongale ntundu Yesu moakapotalili, na moakataghakiki na moakahyoki kuhuma kwa bhabhawile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Unkolongwa Teofile:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Bhandu bhamaheli bhakatumbwi kulemba ngati mobhawezi panani ja mambu ghaghatendakiki pa chilanda jitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Bhakalembiki ngati ghabhakatupwaghili na bhandu bhabhakaghaweni mambu ghanighala kutumbu pakutumbula na bhandu bhalabhala bhabhatangizi ubholu ghonighola. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Wenga Unkolongwa, nenga nanatu panakalingalaki wichu kutumbu paghatumbulaje, nakaamwi kukulembela malobhi ghanihagha kwa kulongana. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Nihenga bhenibhela nahuli na wehapa uweza kumanya uchakaka wokapi wa mambu ghabhakakubholiki.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Yohana Mbatizaji kulotakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Chikahi Helode paakabhi nkolongwa wa ku Yudea, kukabhi na mpenganyambiku jumu lihina laki Zakalia, akahumi mu lukolu lwa kibheleku chaka Abiya. Nhwanu waki alowakika Elizabeti, najombi akahumiki mu lukolu lwaka mpenganyambiku Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Zakalia na nhwanu waki Elizabeti bhakabhi bhandu bhambone palongi jaka Chapanga, koni bhakakamulakya wichu amuli na malaghalakilu ghokapi ghaka Bambo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Nambu bhombi bhakabhi panga na bhana, maghambu Elizabeti akabhi ngulumba, na bhokapi bhakabhi bhaseja nakanopi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Lichobha limu, Zakalia jakabhi zamu jaki ja kuhenga lihengu la upenganyambiku mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Zakalia akahaghuliki kwa gudugudu ngati mowabheli ntetu wa upenganyambiku. Henu akajingi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo nahuli kuhuwa ubane. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Chikahi cha kuhuwa ubane pachaheghalili, bhandu bhokapi bhakabhi kunja bhakundobha Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Bhela mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo akumpitalili, akabya ajemi upambala wa kumalelelu wa meza ja kuhuwi ubane. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakalia paakambweni mtumika wa kunani waka Chapanga jola, akakangichi namaa na akatwelili choghohi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Nambu, mtumika wa kunani akumpwaghili, “Zakalia, ngawijoghopa! Chapanga ajowini kulobha kwaku. Elizabeti nhwanu waku anaakubhelakya mwana wa chikambaku, na wenga wandoha lihina laki Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Wenga anauhekalya nakanopi na kululuta, na bhandu bhamaheli anabhahekalya kwa kubhelakeka kwaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Maghambu Yohana anaabya mtumika nkolongwa palongi jaka Bambo. Ngaikunywi divai wala uwembi. Na jombi anaatwelakika Roho Mhuhu hata mangane ja kubhelakeka kwaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Jombi anabhakelabhua bhandu bhamaheli bha ku Izilaeli bhakelabhuka kwaka Bambo Chapanga wabhu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Anaalongulya palongi jaka Bambo, anaakubha na makili na roho ngati jaka mlota Eliya. Anabhakelabhua akatati bhajongana na bhana bhabhu, anabhakelabhua bhandu bhangakutii bhabya bhandu bhabhuntii Chapanga, na kubhabheka bhandu bhaliandiya kunjopale Bambo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakalia akundaluki mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga, “Bho, anamanya bhole ngati chindu hechi anachibya bhenibhela? Nepani nuncheya, na nhwanu wangu bhelabhela akongapile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga jola akayangiki, “Nepani nde Gabilieli. Nenyema palongi jaka Chapanga, ndumakiki nongila na wehapa na nukupwaghila malobhi manyahi ghani. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Jowanya, anaubya umpuli maghambu ngacheuhobhali malobhi ghangu ghaghihengakika kwa chikahi chaki, ngawiwezi kulongela mbaka ghangani ghanukupwaghili paghipitilaje chakaka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Chikahi hechi bhandu bhakabhi bhundendale Zakalia kunja koni bhakakangacha kwa kukabhakila kwaki mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga mola. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Panihapa papitiki kunja, ngacheaweziki kulonge nabhu, bhela bhombi bhakamanyi kubha aweni mabhono mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga mola. Akajendali kulonge nabhu kwa nginyulila ya mabhoku ghaki, maghambu akabhi mpuli.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Machobha ghaki gha kuhenga lihengu mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga paghajomwiki, Zakalia akabujiki kunyumba jake. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Paghapetiki machobha machokope nhwanu wake Elizabeti akapatiki chitumbu. Akalihiiki munyumba kwa chikahi cha myehi nhwanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Elizabeti akapwaghike, “Lendenu nde leandendi Bambo, aningalili na kumokela hiyoni pamihu ja bhandu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Yesu kulotakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Pamwehi wa sita Chapanga akantumiki mtumika waki Gabilieli kujenda mbaka ku muchi wa Nazaleti, ku inchi ja Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Akuntumiki kwaka mwali jumu bikila joalowakika Malia, joakabhowakiki hweku na nkambaku joalowakika Yusufu, joakahumi mu lukolu lwaka Nkolongwa Daude. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akunhiki mwali jola na kumpwaghila, “Monile! Bambo abhi papamu na wehapa, najombi atehi kukupengalela!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Malia paakajowini malobhi ghanighala, akaholali nakanopi muntima waki, panihapa akakangichi, akapwaghaje, “Ulamukilu hoghu ndandi jaki kike?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga jola akumpwaghile, “Malia, ngawijoghopa! Maghambu upatiki chihomu palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Lingalyaje, anaupata chitumbu na anaumbelaka mwana nkambaku, na wandoha lihina laki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Jombi anaabya nkolongwa analowakika Mwana waka Chapanga Nkolongwa joabhi Kunani Nakanopi. Na Bambo Chapanga anaampekya chiteu cha ukolongwa chaka hokolu waki Daude. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Jombi anaabya nkolongwa wa lubheleku lwaka Yakobo mileli, na ukolongwa waki ngawijomoke!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Malia akamuyangiki mtumika waka Chapanga jola, “Nepani nde mwali bikila. Henu, bho, lijambu heli analiwezikana bhole?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Mtumika waka Chapanga akamuyangiki, “Roho Mhuhu anaakuhelalya panani jaku, na makili ghaka Chapanga anaghakuyekaje. Henu mwana Mhuhu anaabhelakikaje, analowakika Mwana waka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ukombuka kabheti ndongu waku Elizabeti, apatiki chitumbu koni akabya ncheya, na sajenu abhi na chitumbu cha myehi sita, jombi joalowakika ngulumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Maghambu nga chindu chechilepa kuhengakeka kwaka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Malia akapwaghike, “Nepani mtumika waka Bambo, ibya kwangu ngati moupwaghile.” Panihapa mtumika wa kunani jola akabhokike.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malia anjende Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Machobha gha palongi, Malia akajombatiki kujenda ku muchi ghumu ghoukabhi ku inchi ja itombi ja ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Konihoku akajingi mu nyumba jaka Zakalia na kundamuki Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabeti paajowana Malia andamukila, mwana joakabhi mulutumbu jaki akatehi kuhomba. Elizabeti akatwelakiki Roho Mhuhu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>akajamalili kwa kupwagha, “Upengaliki wehapa pachilanda ja akambomba, na mwana jowambelakaje apengalike! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Bho, maghambu kiki lijambu likolongwa heli limbitali nepane, mbaka mabhu waka Bambo wangu anihiki nepane? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Panyowana ulamukilu waku, mwana joabhi mulutumbu lwangu akahombiki kwa chiheku. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Upengaliki wehapa maghambu uhobhalili kubha analipitalya lijambu leakupwaghi Bambo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyembu jaka Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Malia akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mtima wangu undumbali Bambo,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>roho jangu junhekalela Chapanga Mkengalela wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>maghambu angombwiki nepani nuntumika waki nenilihelea!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kutumbu sajenu na kujendalela ibheleku yokapi anabhanoa mpengaleka.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Maghambu Chapanga Mweni Makili andendi mambu makolongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Na lihina laki nde lihuhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Chiha chaki chabhajendela bhandu bhabhunjojabhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">kutumbu chibheleku mbaka chibheleku chenge.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Atendiki mambu makolongu kwa chiwoku chaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Abhalekanishi bhandu bhabhabhi na ing'omu, mu maholalelu gha mintima jabhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Abhaheli bhakolongwa kuhuma pa hiteu yabhu ya ukolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">abhakwehiki akakahochu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Abhatupalishi bhabhabhi na injala kwa hindu yambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">na bhanamali abhatopwi mabhoku matopu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Anjangati mtumika waki Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">na ngacheajewiki kundangi chiha chaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Ngati mobhalaghali akatati bhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Ibulahimu na lubheleku lwaki, mbaka mileli!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Malia akatemi na Elizabeti kwa chikahi cha myehi jitatu, na akakelawiki kunyumba jake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Chikahi cha kulibhopola kwaki Elizabeti ukahikiki, akalibhopwi mwana wa chikambaku. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Bhandu bha pambipi jaki na bhalongu bhaki bhakajowini Bambo amboni chiha nakanopi, bhokapi bhakahekali papamu naku.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Mwana paahiki machobha nane bhakahiki kunheketa jando. Bhakapaliki kumpeke lihina Zakalia, lihina la atati waki. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Nambu mabhu waki akapwaghiki, “Ngabhela! Lihina laki analowakika Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Bhandu bhakumpwaghile, “Bho, mbona njeta mundu jokapi mu lukolu lwaki joabhi na lihina lenihele?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Bhela bhakalongi naku kwa nginyulila ya mabhoku atati waki nahuli bhapata kumanya apalika mwana waki andoha lihina bhole.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakalia akalobhiki chibau cha kulembela, akalembiki ana, “Lihina laki Yohana.” Bhandu bhokapi bhakakangiche! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Palapala Zakalia akaweziki kulonge kabhete, akatumbwili kulonge kabete, na kundumbalila Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Bhandu bha pambipi jaki bhakajowipi, na malobhi hagha ghakajaghani ku inchi jokapi ja hitombi ja ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Kila mundu joakajowini malobhi hagha akaholalili na kulilalukila, “Bho, mwana jonjo anaabya wa ntundu bhole?” Maghambu makili ghaka Bambo ghabhi papamu naku.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota waka Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakalia, atati waka Yohana akatwelakiki Roho Mhuhu, na kupwagha ulota agho,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Leka tundumbalya Bambo, Chapanga wa Izilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Maghambu abhahikili bhandu bhaki na kubhakombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Atupeki tepani Mkengalela mwana makile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">nchokolu waka mtumika waki Daude.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Ngati moakalongali kutumbu pamwandi kupete bhalota bhaki bhahuhu,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>kubha anaatukengalya kuhuma mu mabhoku gha maadui bhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kuhuma mu makili gha bhokapi bhabhatuhakalila.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Akapwaghiki anaabhonila chiha bhazee bhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na kulukomboka Lulaghilu lwaki luhuhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Akundapi Ibulahimu atati witu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>kubha anaatukengalyaje kuhuma kwa maadui bhitu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Na kunjojabhe Chapanga panga choghohi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>henu tupalika tubya twabhahuhu na tubya bhandu tetujetakalewa palongi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">machobha ghokapi gha womi witu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Wenga wa mwanangu, anaulowakika mlota waka Chapanga joabhi Kunani Nakanope.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Anaundongulya Bambo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kundenganakela indela jaki,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>kubhatangazi bhandu bhaki anabhakengaliwaje</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kulekakewa mahoku ghabhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Chapanga witu abhi na chiha na mtima wambone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Anaatumulakya unang'anu kuhuma kunani,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>nahuli kubhamulakila bhokapi bhabhabhi mu lubhendu na mu chihilu cha kupotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kutulongo magholu ghitu mwindela ja lukwale.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwana akakoliki na kujonjukeka makili mu roho, akatami kuchingwenji mbaka lichobha lela paalilangia palanga kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Machobha ghala Kaisali Agusto, akalaghalaki bhandu bhokapi bha pundema bhabhalangikaje. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Akoku kukabhi kubhalangika kwa kutumbula, Kilenio paakabhi chiongozi wa ku inchi ja ku Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Kila mundu akapiti ku muchi waki ghoabhelakike kulemba lihina laki.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yusufu akabhokiki kuhuma ku muchi wa Nazaleti ghoubhi ku inchi ja ku Galilaya, akapiti ku Beselehemu ghoukabhi ku muchi wa Yudea, pandu paakabhelakiki Nkolongwa Daude. Yusufu akapiti konihoku ndandi akahumi mu lubheleku lwaka Daude. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Akapiti kulembakeka konihoku papamu na Malia, joakumboki hweku na akabhi na chitumbu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Bhakabya ku Beselehemu, lichobha laki Malia la kulibhopola lakahikike. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Akalibhopwi mwana waki wa kutumbula wa chikambaku, akamuwatiki indenga. Na kungoneka mu libheghi la kulekeha hinyama, maghambu ngachebhapatiki mbekenyu ja kutama mu nyumba ja kuhiki bhaghene.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhadima na bhatumika bha kunani bhaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Pa inchi jela bhakabhi bhadima bhabhakabhi bhatami mu mighonda, bhakalenda mapogha gha hinyama yabhu ikilu.<figure style="fig" alt="Shepherds watching over their flocks" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Bhadima bhakalenda hinyama yabhu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Bhela mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo akabhapitalili, na ulumbalilu waka Bambo ukabhamulakile. Na bhombi bhakajowipi namaa, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>nambu mtumika waka Chapanga jola akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwijoghopa! Maghambu nhiki kundete malobhi manyahi gha chiheku chekibya kwa bhandu bhokape. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Lalenu ku muchi waka Nkolongwa Daude abhelakiki Mkengalela winu, jombi nde Kristo, Bambo! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Jenje nde anajibya nginyulila kwinu, anamunhimanya mwana nchoku bhunhwatiki indenga, na bhungoniki mu libheghi la kulekeha hinyama.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Palapala bhatumika bhaka Chapanga bhamaheli bhakahikiki na kuhimangana na mtumika njabhu, bhakunjembili Chapanga bhakapwaghaje:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Ulumbalilu kwaka Chapanga Kunani Nakanope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na lukwali kwa bhandu bhabhabhi pundema pokapi bhabhapalakiki naku!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Bhatumika bhaka Chapanga bhala pabhakelawiki kunani kumahunde, bhadima bhakapwaghanile, “Tumbokanyaje ku Beselehemu tukalolaje chenihechi chechipitalile, ghaatupwaghi Bambo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Henu bhakakembili ku Beselehemu, bhakabhahimani Malia na Yusufu na mwana nkeki jola akabya aghoni pandu pa kulekeha hinyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bhadima bhala pabhakumbweni mwana jola, bhakabhapwaghi malobhi kubhokana na mwana ghaakalongili mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhabhajowini malobhi ghanihagha, bhakakangichi kubhokana na malobhi hagha gha bhadima. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Nambu Malia akaghabhehi malobhi ghokapi hagha muntima jaki na kughaholalela nakanopi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Bhadima bhala bhakakelawiki kabheti kuchingwenji, koni bhakunjembila na kundumbali Chapanga kwa ghokapi ghabhajowini na kughabhona, ghokapi ghakahengakiki ngati mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga moakapwaghile.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana apekewa lihina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Mu lichobha la nane, lichobha la kuncheku mwana jando palahikaji, akalowakiki lihina laki Yesu. Lihina leniheli akapatiki kuhuma kwaka mtumika wa kunani waka Chapanga pala mabhu waki paakabhi akona ngakutogho chitumbu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhumpeleka mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Machobha ghakahikite ghaka Malia na Yusufu kutenda ntetu wa kugholuleka nahuli kujetakalewa na Chapanga ngati Shelia jaka Musa mojilaghalakila. Bhela bhakuntoliki mwana, bhakapiti naku ku muchi wa ku Yelusalemu na kumbeka palongi jaka Bambo. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Ngati moilembakike mu Shelia jaka Bambo: “Kila mbelakeka wa kutumbula wa chikambaku abhohakika kwaka Bambo.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Kabheti bhakapiti nahuli kubhoha nyambiku kwaka Chapanga, na bhakapalakiki kubhoha injebha ibheli au ibhana ibheli ya ngunda, ngati mojilongale Shelia jaka Bambo.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ku Yelusalemu kola kukabhi na mundu jumu joalowakika Simeoni. Mundu jonihoju akabhi wambone na joanjojabhe Chapanga. Jombi alendalya kuhika kwa ukombola wa Izilaeli, na Roho Mhuhu akabhi papamu naku. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Roho Mhuhu akunhekuli kubha ngayipoteli mangane ja kumbona Kristo, jombi nde Bambo. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Bhela Roho Mhuhu akundongwi Simeoni na kujenda mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga. Pala bhabheleka pabhakundetiki mwana Yesu mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga nahuli kunhenge ngati moipalakya na ntetu wa Shelia, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeoni akanjopali mwana Yesu mu mabhoku ghaki koni akunchengula Chapanga, akapwagha,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Henu Bambo, utimizi chilanga chaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">undekakya mtumika waku apotilaje kwa lukwale, ngati mowapwaghile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Maghambu kwa mihu ghangu ghauweni ukengalelu waku,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ghoutendiki ubhonikana kwa bhandu bhokape.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Unang'anu ghowamulakya bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na kuleta ulumbalilu kwa bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yusufu na mabhu waka Yesu bhakabhi bhakangacha malobhi ghokapi ghaakalongi Simeoni panani jaka mwana jola. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Panihapa Simeoni akabhapengalili, na kumpwaghi Malia, mabhu waka Yesu, “Mwana jonjoni ahaghuliki na Chapanga kwa ndandi ja kuhabhuka na kujema kwa bhandu bhamaheli bha ku inchi ja ku Izilaeli. Kabheti anaabya nginyulila kuhuma kwaka Chapanga, jejikanakika na bhandu bhamahele, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>nahuli maholalelu gha bhandu bhamaheli ghiyekulikaje palanga. Na kwaku wamweti, lipanga analijingala muntima waku, nahuli ghayekuliwa maholalelu gha mtima waku.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kabheti mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga mola kukabhi na mlota waka Chapanga jumu mbujamundu, lihina laki Ana, mwali waka Fanueli, wa likabila laka Asheli. Mbomba hoju akatami na ndomi waki kwa hyaka saba kutumbu paatoghulike. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Bhela akabhi mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi waki mbaka machobha ghala paakabhi na hyaka semanini na nne. Na machobha ghokapi hagha atamika mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga, ikilu na muhi akunjojabya Chapanga kwa kukonga na kulobha. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Chikahi chechechi, Ana akabhajendili koni akunchengula Chapanga, na kupwagha malobhi panani jaka mwana jola kwa bhandu bhokapi bhabhalendalya ukombola wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukelabhuka ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Henu Malia na Yusufu pabhajomwi kuhenga ghokapi ghaghapalika na Shelia jaka Bambo, bhakakelabwiki kunyumba jabhu ku Nazaleti ku muchi wa ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwana akakoliki, akajonjukiki makili akabya atweli malangu, na chihomu chaka Chapanga chakabhi papamu naku.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkombu Yesu pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kila chaka mu Uwangalalu wa Pasaka bhabheleka bhaki bhakabhi na ntetu wa kujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesu paakabhi na hyaka komi na ibheli, bhakapiti naku ku Uwangalalu ngati mowabheli ntetu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Pawajomwiki Uwangalalu ghola, na bhabheleka pabhabhila bhabhuja kunyumba jabhu, Yesu akahighali kunyuma ku Yelusalemu, koni bhabheleka bhaki ngachebhamanye. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Bhahambukya kubha akabhi papamu nabhu mulipogha la bhandu bhabhakabhi mu mwanja ghola, bhakajendiki muhi jokapi. Bhela bhakatumbwi kundonda mwalongu bhaki na mwakochi bhaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Kwa kubha ngachebhumbweni, bhakakelawiki kabhete ku Yelusalemu nahuli kundonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Pa lichobha la katatu, bhakunhimani pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga, akabya atami pachilanda ja bhabhola bha Kiyahude, koni abhajowanela na kubhalaluki malalukilu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Bhokapi bhabhajowini malobhi ghaki bhakakangichi kwa malangu na kuyanga kwaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Malia mabhu waki na Yusufu pabhumbweni bhakakangichi nakanopi, na mabhu waki akundalukili, “Mwanango, bho, maghambu ki utuhengi bhenibhela? Lingalya, nepani na atati waku tukabhi tukulonda kwa kubhina mtima.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Bho, mnonde kyane? Ngachemmanyi kubha imbalika kubha mu Nyumba ja Atati wangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Nambu bhombi ngachebhamanyi ndandi ja lilobhi leakapwaghile.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Henu Yesu akakelawiki ku Nazaleti papamu nabhu, akajendalya kubhatii. Amabhu waki akabhekiki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi muntima. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu akajendali kukola mu mbulau na ulacho, na kujendalela kunyambiha Chapanga na bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji abhatangazi bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Chaka cha komi na unhwanu cha utawala waka Kaisali Tibelio, Pontio Pilato akabhi chiongozi wa ku Yudea. Helode akabhi nkolongwa wa ku Galilaya, na Filipo ndongu waki akabhi chiongozi wa Itulea na inchi ja Tilakoniti. Lisania akabhi nkolongwa wa ku Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Anasi na Kayafa bhakabhi bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa, chikahi hechi Lilobhi laka Chapanga lakunhiki Yohana mwana waka Zakalia kuchingwenji kola. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Henu Yohana akapiti ku inchi yokapi yeilindakanila na nkoka Yoludani. Akabhatangazi bhandu, “Mng'anambukaje na kughaleka mahoku ghinu na mbatizwaje nahuli Chapanga andekakya mahoku ghinu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ngati moilembakike mu chitabhu chaka mlota Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mundu ajamali kuchilipololu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mundenganakya Bambo indela jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">ndenganakya paanapetaje!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Kila likemba lipalika liyelalikaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">kila chitombi na katombi ipalika ilenganakikaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Papapendiki papalika pahatambuliwaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">indela ihakau ipalika ilenganakikaji na kubha wichu.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Bhandu bhokapi anabhubhona ukengalelu waka Chapanga!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Bhela bhandu bhakunjendi Yohana nahuli abhabatizaje, najombi akabhapwaghile, “Mwehapa kibheleku cha lijoka! Bho, nane joandakali mabhanganya ntila utemulu waka Chapanga ghouhika? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Ndangia kwa matendu kubha mng'anambwiki na kughaleka mahoku ghinu. Kabheti ngamwitumbu kulonge mu mitima jinu, ‘Atati witu nde Ibulahimu!’ Chakaka numpwaghila, Chapanga aweza kughang'anambu maganga aghagha kubha bhana bhaka Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Bhela, libhaghu libhekakiki wichu punhina wa kila nkongu, kila nkongu wangakubheleka mapambiku manyahi anauhekatwaje na kulekaleka pamoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Lipogha la bhandu lakundalukile, “Bho, henu tutenda bhole?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohana akabhayangiki, “Mundu joabhi na ingobhu ibheli angabhila jwangakubha na ingobhu, na joabhi na chilebhi angabhila jwanga na chilebhi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Bhajopa kode bhakahikiki nahuli bhabatizwaje, bhakundalukile, “Mbola, bho, na tepani tuhenga kike?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Jombi akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwijopa kode kupetale mobhundaghalakile.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Manjolinjoli na bhombi bhakundalukile, “Bho, na tepani tuhenga kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Jombi akabhayangiki, “Ngamwanyaghu mundu jokapi jola hindu yaki kwa makili, kabheti ngamwantakila mundu jokapi kwa upuhe. Mtoshikaje na malepu ghinu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Bhandu bhalendalya kuhika kwaka Mkombola. Bhakabhi bhalilalukila mumitima jabhu kubha pangi Yohana nde Kristo. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Panihapa Yohana akabhapwaghi bhokape, “Nepani numbatiza mwanganya kwa machi, nambu ahika joabhi na makili kumbeta nenga, na nepani ngachembalika kumbopo mighoji ja maghubasi ghake. Jombi anaambatiza kwa Roho Mhuhu na kwa moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Jombi abhi na chipalu mumabhoku ghaki, nahuli apeta inganu yaki, abhongana ingano mu chikoku chaki, na mambojwa anaaghajocha kwa moto wangakuchuchuka.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Henu kwa malobhi ghangi ghamaheli Yohana akabhi abhatangazi bhandu Malobhi Manyahi na kubhalakalila bhaileka indela yabhu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Nambu Yohana akundakali Helode Nkolongwa wa ku Galilaya, maghambu akuntowi Helodia, joakabhi nhwanu waka ndongu waki, na mahakau ghangi ghamaheli ghaakabhi aghahengike. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Panihapa Helode akajonjukili uhakau waki, kwa kumbeka Yohana muchifungo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhatizwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Bhandu bhokapi pabhajomula kubatizwa, Yesu najombi akabatizwi. Paakabhi andobha Chapanga, kunani kumahunde kukahowiki, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Roho Mhuhu akanhelali panani jaki kwa ulenganesu ngati wa ngunda. Sauti jakajowaniki kuhuma kunani kumahunde jakapwagha, “Wenga wa Mwanangu wenukupaliki. Nenga nyambakiki na wenga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu paakabhili atumbula lihengu laki akabhi na umuli wa hyaka selasini, na bhandu bhahambukya mwana waka Yusufu, joakabhi mwana waka Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heli akabhi mwana waka Masati, joakabhi mwana waka Lawi, Lawi akabhi mwana waka Meliki, Meliki akabhi mwana waka Yana, Yana akabhi mwana waka Yusufu. <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yusufu akabhi mwana waka Matasia, Matasia akabhi mwana waka Amosi, Amosi akabhi mwana waka Nahumu, Nahumu akabhi mwana waka Esili, Esili akabhi mwana waka Nagai. <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nagai akabhi mwana waka Maati, Maati akabhi mwana waka Matatia, Matatia akabhi mwana waka Semeni, Semeni akabhi mwana waka Yoseki, Yoseki akabhi mwana waka Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yuda akabhi mwana waka Yoanani, Yoanani akabhi mwana waka Lesa, Lesa akabhi mwana waka Zelubabeli, Zelubabeli akabhi mwana waka Shealitieli, Shealitieli akabhi mwana waka Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neli akabhi mwana waka Meliki, Meliki akabhi mwana waka Adi, Adi akabhi mwana waka Kosamu, Kosamu akabhi mwana waka Elimadamu, Elimadamu akabhi mwana waka Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eli akabhi mwana waka Yoshua, Yoshua akabhi mwana waka Eliezeli, Eliezeli akabhi mwana waka Yolimu, Yolimu akabhi mwana waka Masati, Matati akabhi mwana waka Lawi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lawi akabhi mwana waka Simoni, Simoni akabhi mwana waka Yuda, Yuda akabhi mwana waka Yusufu, Yusufu akabhi mwana waka Yonamu, Yonamu akabhi mwana waka Eliakimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakimu akabhi mwana waka Melea, Melea akabhi mwana waka Mena, Mena akabhi mwana waka Matata, Matata akabhi mwana waka Nasani, Nasani akabhi mwana waka Daude. <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Daude akabhi mwana waka Yese, Yese akabhi mwana waka Obedi, Obedi akabhi mwana waka Boazi, Boazi akabhi mwana waka Solomoni, Solomoni akabhi mwana waka Nashoni. <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashoni akabhi mwana waka Aminadabu, Aminadabu akabhi mwana waka Adimini, Adimini akabhi mwana waka Hesiloni, Hesiloni akabhi mwana waka Pelesi, Pelesi akabhi mwana waka Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yuda akabhi mwana waka Yakobo, Yakobo akabhi mwana waka Isaka, Isaka akabhi mwana waka Ibulahimu, Ibulahimu akabhi mwana waka Tela, Tela akabhi mwana waka Naholi. <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Naholi akabhi mwana waka Selugi, Selugi akabhi mwana waka Leu, Leu akabhi mwana waka Pelegi, Pelegi akabhi mwana waka Ebeli, Ebeli akabhi mwana waka Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Sala akabhi mwana waka Kenani, Kenani akabhi mwana waka Alifakisadi, Alifakisadi akabhi mwana waka Shemu, Shemu akabhi mwana waka Nuhu, Noha akabhi mwana waka Lameki. <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameki akabhi mwana waka Metusela, Metusela akabhi mwana waka Enoki, Enoki akabhi mwana waka Yaledi, Yaledi akabhi mwana waka Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli akabhi mwana waka Kenani. <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenani akabhi mwana waka Enoshi, Enoshi akabhi mwana waka Seti, Seti akabhi mwana waka Adamu, Adamu akabhi mwana waka Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alengakeka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu akakelawiki kuhuma ku Nkoka Yoludani koni atweli Roho Mhuhu, na Roho hoju akundongwi mbaka kulipololu. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Konihoku akalengakiki na Shetani kwa machobha alobaini. Mu machobha ghokapi hagha ngacheakakuliki chindu chokapi, na paghapetiki machobha ghanihagha akaweni injala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Shetani akampwaghi Yesu, “Ngati wehapa nde wa Mwana waka Chapanga, lipwaghila lighanga aleli libya libumunda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Nambu Yesu akayangiki, “Ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Mundu ngacheatama kwa kula libumunda pena, nambu kwa kila Lilobhi laka Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Palapala Shetani akundongwi Yesu mbaka panani ja chitombi chilachu, na kwa chikahi chijipi akandangi ukolongwa wokapi wa pundema pokapi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Shetani akumpwaghile, “Ananukupekya ukolongwa wokapi na ulumbalilu waki wokapi, maghambu yokapi heyi mbekiwi nepani, na nepani nhweza kumpeke mundu jonumpala. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Bhela anaunjikamili na kunyojabhela, yokapi ananukupekyaje wehapa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu akayangiki, “Ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Unjojabya Bambo Chapanga waku na untumakya jombi kanjika jaki!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Kabheti Shetani akundongwi Yesu mbaka ku Yelusalemu, akumbei kunani kunhaghala wa Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na kumpwaghila, “Ngati wehapa nde wa Mwana waka Chapanga, ulilekala pahi kuhuma pambane. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Maghambu ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Chapanga anaakulaghalakya bhatumika bhaki bha kunani kumahunde bhakulendaje. <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Bhombi anabhukutola mumabhoku ghabhu nahuli ngawalikobhandola chiwolu chaku paliganga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Nambu Yesu akayangike, “Ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Ngawandenga Bambo Chapanga waku.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Shetani paajomula kundenga Yesu kwa indela yokapi, akundekiki kwa chikahi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atumbu lihengu laki ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Bhela Yesu akakelawiki kujenda ku Galilaya akabya atwelili makili ghaka Roho Mhuhu. Na malobhi ghaki ghakayaghani pandu pokapi pa inchi ya pambipi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Yesu akabhi abhola mu nyumba yabhu ya kuhimangani Bhayahude na bhandu bhokapi bhakundumbalile.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanakika ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Henu Yesu akapiti ku Nazaleti, pandu paakakolile, na Lichobha la Sabato akapiti mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayaude ngati mowabheli ntetu waki. Akajemiki na kusoma Malembu Mahuhu kwa saute. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Bhakumpeki chitabu chaka mlota Isaya, akakibhopwili na kupahimani pandu papalembakiki,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Roho waka Bambo abhi panani jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">maghambu anjawi nabhatangazya bhahochu Malobhi Manyahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Andumiki kubhatangazi bhabhakongakiki kubhopulewa kwabhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na akangalola kulola kabhete</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kubhalekakela bhandu bhabhabhonewa.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Kutangaza kubha machobha ghahikiki ghaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">Bambo kubhakengalela bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Yesu paakajomwi kusoma, akakikongiki chitabu chela, akankelabhuki mtumika na akatami pahi. Bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude bhakundingali nakanopi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Lilembu lendenu lipitali kubha chakaka lalenu pamukabhi njowanela.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakundandili na kukangacha malobhi gha chihomu ghaakalongile. Bhakalaluwine, “Bho, hojo le nga mwana waka Yusufu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Manyi muweza kumbwaghi lilobhi lendenu, ‘Sing'anga, ulilamiha wamwene!’ Na kabheti muweza kumbwaghila, ‘Mambu ghokapi ghatujowini kubha ukaghahengiki ku Kapelenaumu, ughahenga bhelabhela na pani pa muchi waku.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Yesu akajendali kupwagha, “Chakaka numpwaghila, njeta mlota joajetakalewa pa muchi waki mweni.”<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>“Nambu nyowanyaje! Chakaka nupwaghila kukabhi na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhamaheli ku inchi ja Izilaeli chikahi chaka mlota Eliya. Machobha ghanihagha iyula ngachejatonyike kwa hyaka hitatu na myehi sita, kukabhi na injala ngolongwa ku inchi jokape. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Hata bhela, Eliya ngacheatumakiki hata kwaka jumu wabhu ku Izilaeli, nambu akatumakiki ku Salepata kwaka mabhu jumu joaweliwi na ndomi, ku inchi ja ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Kabheti, mu machobha ghaka mlota Elisha, kukabhi na bhandu bhamahele bhabhabhi na chitamu cha malohi ku Izilaeli. Nga mundu joakalamiki, nambu Naamani kanjika mundu wa ku inchi ja ku Silia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude mola pabhajowini malobhi ghanihagha, bhakahakali namaa. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Bhakajemanile, bhakumpihiki Yesu kunja ja muchi kwa makili, na bhakumpeliki ku chitombi kunani pandu pabhachengiki muchi wabhu. Bhakapaliki bhundekala pahi kulikemba lilachu, <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>nambu Yesu akapetiki palapala pachilanda ja lipogha, na kubhoka.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu joabhi na majobhi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mako 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Bhela Yesu akaheli ku Kapelenaumu, muchi wa ku Galilaya. Na Lichobha la Sabato akabhi abhabhola bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Bhakakangichi namaa kwa mabholu ghaki, maghambu mabholu ghaki ghakabhi na makili. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude, kukabhi na mundu joabhi na majobhi, akajamalili, akapwagha, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Bho, upala kututenda kiki, wa Yesu wa ku Nazaleti? Bho, uhikiki kutukoma? Nukumanyi kubha wehapa nde wa Mhuhu waka Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu akandakali lijobhi jola, akapwagha, “Tumbalaje! Umpita mundu hoju!” Palapala lijobhi jola akunhawi mundu jola pahi palongi jabhu bhokapi, na kumpita panga kumpoteka.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakakangichi namaa, bhakabhi bhapwaghanila, “Bho, aghagha henu mabholu bhole? Maghambu mundu joni abhi na uwezu na makili wa kughatopo majobhi, na ghombi ghabhoka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Bhela malobhi ghaka Yesu ghakayaghani pandu pokapi pa muchi wa Galilaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhalamiha bhandu bhamahele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu akapitiki mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude jela na kujenda kunyumba jaka Simoni. Henu konihoku akunhimani nkowanu waka Simoni alwala chitamu chikolongwa namaa, bhakundobhiki Yesu andamiha mabhu jola. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu akapiti kujema pambipi na mabhu jola, akajinimi na kuchikenjuki chitamu chela. Na chitamu chela chakundekakile. Palapala akajemiki, na kutumbu kubhateleke chilebhe.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Lyobha palakabhi lijibhila, bhandu bhakundeti Yesu bhandu bhabhalwalika kila chitamu, najombi akabhabheki mabhoku ghaki panani ja kila mtamwa, na kubhalamiha bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Majobhi ghakabhapitiki bhandu bhamahele, na kujamalila koni ghakapwagha, “Wehapa wa Mwana waka Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Nambu Yesu akaghakenjukili na kughahibhali kupwagha, maghambu ghakummanyi kubha jombi nde Kristo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atangaza mu nyumba ya kuhimanganila Bhayahude</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mako 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Chilabhu jaki lukela, Yesu akapitiki kunja ja muchi pandu panga kubha na bhandu. Bhandu bhakatumbwi kundonda, na pabhakumbweni bhakalengiki kunhibhali nahuli ngaibhoka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Nambu Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Imbalika kabheti kutangaza Malobhi Manyahi gha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ku michi jenge, maghambu chenihechi nde Chapanga cheandumiki kukihenga.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Henu Yesu akajendali kutangaza mu nyumba ya kuhimangani Bhayahude ya ku Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhaloha bhabhulwa bha kutumbula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akajemiki pamaheku ja Nhwanga wa Genesaleti, na panihapa bhandu bhamaheli bhakatwelile na kutumbu kukangana, koni bhakajowanya Malobhi ghaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Akaiweni ngalawa ibheli mumaheku ja nhwanga, yeyalekakiki na bhalohi habha bhakabhi bhajigholo mikwabhu jabho. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu akajingi mu ngalawa jimu jejikabhi jaka Simoni, bhela akandobhiki Simoni akolula ngalawa jela mumachi, patali pachokopi kuhuma pamaheku ja nhwanga. Bhela akatami monimola koni akabya abhabhola lipogha la bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Pajomwi kubhabhola, akampwaghi Simoni, “Uhugha ngalawa mbaka kulochi kokunyoliki na ukapendakya nkwabhu waku nahuli ulobha homba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni akamuyangike, “Bambo, tutyalini kulobha homba ikilu jokapi panga kupata chindu, nambu kwa kubha upwaghiki wehapa, anambendakya nkwabho.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Pabhakapendaki nkwabhu wabhu, bhakalobhiki homba yamahele nakanope mbaka nkwabhu wabhu utumbuka kukachuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Bhela bhakabhalohiki bhajabu bhabhakabhi mu ngalawa najengi bhahika kubhajangatila. Bhakahikiki, bhakatwelaki homba ngalawa yokapi ibheli mbaka ipalika kujibhila. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni Petulu paaweni chela chechipitalile, akanchikimili Yesu na kupwagha, “Bambo, ubhoka palongi jangu, maghambu nepani nde mundu mwana mahoku!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simoni papamu na bhajaki bhakakangichi kwa homba yamahele yebhalobhike. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Bhelabhela Yakobo na Yohana bhana bhaka Zebedayo, bhabhakabhi bhakochi bhaka Simoni na bhombi bhakakangiche. Yesu akumpwaghi Simoni, “Ngawijoghopa kutumbu sajenu na kujendalela anaubya undohi wa bhandu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bhakahughiki ngalawa yela mbaka kumaheku, bhakahilekiki hindu yokapi na kunjengale Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesu paakabhi mu muchi ghumu wa Galilaya, akahikiki mundu joabhi na malohi hyegha jokapi. Ntamwa hoju paakambweni Yesu, akalihawi pahi, akalobhiki, “Bambo, ngati anaupala, uweza kung'olola!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu akahatambwi chiwoku chaki, akankamwi na kumpwaghila, “Mbala! Ugholulikaje!” Palapala malohi ghakumbokike. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu akunkanakili, akumpwaghile, “Ngawampwaghi mundu jokapi lilobhi lenu, nambu ujenda ukalilangiya kwaka mpenganyambiku kubha ulamiki na ukabhoha nyambiku ngati moalaghalaki Musa, nahuli ubya ulandilu kwa bhandu bhokapi kubha wenga ulamike.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Nambu malobhi panani jaka Yesu ghakajaghani manyata pandu pokapi, na bhandu bhamahele bhakahikiki kunjowanela na bhakapaliki abhalamiha hitamwa yabhu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Nambu Yesu mala pamaheli akapiti pandu panga bhandu, na kundobha Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mundu joatengwike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Lichobha limu Yesu paakabhi abhola, Mafalisayo bhakumu na bhabhola bha Shelia kuhuma ku kila chijiji cha ku Galilaya, ku Yudea na ku Yelusalemu, bhakabhi bhatemi panihapa. Makili ghaka Bambo ghakabhi papamu naku kwa kubhalamiha bhatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Panihapa bhandu bhakahikiki, bhuntandaini mundu jumu joatengwiki pa uleli, bhakalengiki kunjingia mkati, nahuli bhumbeka palongi jaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Nambu, ngachebhaweziki kujingi mkati, kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhamaheli. Bhela bhakuntotwili bhakankwehiki panani ja nhwaghala, bhakapekanywi, na bhakunheli pa uleli mpaka pachilanda ja bhandu bhala palongi jaka Yesu.<figure style="fig" alt="Four men lowering a man through a roof" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Bhandu nchechi bhunhele ntamwa punhaghala</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu paakaweni uhobhalelu wabhu, akumpwaghi mundu joatengwiki, “Nkochi wangu, mahoku ghaku ghalekakiwi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Bhabola bha Shelia na Mafalisayo bhakatumbwi kulilaluha, “Bho, hajo mundu bholi joantondo Chapanga? Bho, nane joaweza kulekake mahoku? Chapanga kanjika jaki nde joaweza kulekake mahoku!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesu akaghamanyi maholalelu ghabhu, akabhalalukile, “Bho, muholale kiki mu mitima jinu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Bho, lelipepwiki nakanopi lako, kupwagha, ‘Ulekakiwi mahoku ghaku,’ au kupwagha, ‘Jemaje na ujendaje?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Nambu mbala mmanya kubha Mwana waka Mundu abhi na amule pundema ja kulekakela bhandu mahoku ghabhu.” Bhela akampwaghi mundu jola joatengwiki, “Nukupwaghila, jemaje, utola uleli waku, na ujendaje kunyumba jaku.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Palapala, mundu joatengwiki jola akajemiki palongi jabhu, akatoliki uleli waki na kujenda kunyumba jaki koni akabya andumbali Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakakangichi nakanope. Bhakajowipi na bhakundumbali Chapanga, bhakapwaghaje, “Lalenu tuweni mambu gha ngangachu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andoha Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Paghajomwiki ghanihagha, Yesu akapiti kunja akumbweni mundu njopa kode joalowakika Lawi, atami padowoku mu chindamba cha kulepe kode. Yesu akampwaghile, “Unyengalyaje!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lawi akajemiki, akailekiki hindu yokapi, na akunjengali Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Lawi akantendi Yesu uwangalalu ukolongwa kunyumba jaki, na lipogha likolongwa la bhandu bhajopa kode na bhandu bhangi bhakabhi bhatemi papamu nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Nambu Mafalisayo bhakumu na bhabhola bhangi bha Shelia bhakabhang'ong'ataki bhabhulwa bhaka Yesu, bhakapwaghaje, “Bho, maghambu kiki mkula na kunywa papamu na bhandu bhajopa kode na bhana mahoku?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Bhandu bhangakulwala ngapabhumpala sing'anga, nambu bhatamwa nde bhabhumpala sing'anga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ngachenhikiki kubhaloha bhandu bhamboni, nambu nhikiki kubhaloha bhandu bhana mahoku bhapata kung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhundaluki panani ja kukonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Bhandu bhangi bhakampwaghile, “Bhabulwa bhaka Yohana Mbatizaji bhakonga kula chilebhi chikahi kwa chikahi na kulobha, na bhabhulwa bha Mafalisayo bhatenda bhelabhela. Nambu bhabhulwa bhaku bhakula na kunywa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu akabhayangati, “Bho, bhabhakokakiki kuukwati bhapalika le kukonga koni bambo ukwati abhi papamu nabhu? Ngabhela! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Nambu lichobha analihikaje bambo ukwati anaabhohakika kwabhu, na panihapa nde pabhikonga kula chilebhe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi ulenganesu ghongo, “Nga mundu joakachu chilaka kuhuma mu ingobhu jahenu na kuloke mu ingobhu ja mwande. Ngati anatendiki bhenibhela, anaakachula ingobhu jahenu, na chilaka kuhuma mu ingobhu jahenu ngachilengani na ingobhu ja mwande. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Kabheti nga mundu joaweza kujeghe divai jahenu mu mifuku jejilenganakiki na chingokolu cha mwande, ngati anaatehi bhenibhela, divai anajikachula mifuku ja chingokolu na kujitika, na mifuku ja chingokolu jitenda kukachuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Nambu divai jahenu jijeghaleka mu mifuku ja ingokolu jahenu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Nga mundu joakunywa divai jahenu na kutokule kunywa divai ja mwande, maghambu bhapwagha, ‘Jamwandi nde jinyahi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Lilalukilu panani ja Lichobha la Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Lichobha limu la Sabato Yesu akabhi apeta mu mighonda ja ingano. Bhabhulwa bhaki bhakatumbwi kupanyu mapukutu gha ingano, bhakapulwii mu mabhoku ghabhu na kula. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Mafalisayo bhakumu bhakabhalalukile, “Bho, maghambu ki muhenga lihengu lebhakanakili kuhenga Lichobha la Sabato?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu akabhayangike, “Bho, ngachemsomiki moakatendi Daude, na bhajaki chikahi pabhakabhi na injala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Daude akajingi mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga, akatoliki mabumunda ghaghabhowakiki kwaka Chapanga akakulike. Bhelabhela akabhapeki na bhajake. Shelia junkanaki mundu jokapi jola kula mabumunda ghanihagha nambu bhapenganyambiku pela nde bhabhapalika kula mabumunda ghanihagha.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Henu Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Mwana waka Mundu nde Bambo wa Sabato.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu joatengwiki chiwoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Mu lichobha lengi la Sabato, Yesu akapiti kubhola mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude. Mkati ja nyumba ja kuhingani Bhayahude jela kukabhi na mundu joatengwiki chiwoku cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Bhabhola bhakumu bha Shelia na Mafalisayo bhakumu bhapalika bhapata ndandi ja kuntaki Yesu na bhela bhalendalya bhabhona ngati anaandamiha mundu mu Lichobha la Sabato. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Nambu Yesu akaghamanyiki maholalelu ghabhu, akumpwaghi mundu joatengwiki chiwoku jola, “Ujema, uwika palongi pambane.” Mundu jola akajemiki pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Nundaluki mwanganya, bho, wichu le mu Lichobha la Sabato kuhenga manyahi au kuhenga mahakau? Kukengale womi waka mundu au kuukoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Akabhalingalili bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi panipala, na akumpwaghi mundu jola, “Uhatambula chiwoku chaku.” Akatendiki ngati Yesu moakampwaghile na chiwoku chaki chakalamike.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Nambu bhombi bhakahakali namaa, bhakajetanganili kubha chindu bhole cheanabhuntendila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhahaghu bhabhulwa komi na bhabheli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akapiti kuchitombi kundobha Chapanga, akatemi konihoku ikilu jokapi koni akundobha Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Lukela pakwachile, Yesu akabhalohiki bhabhulwa bhaki. Akabhahawi bhabhulwa komi na bhabheli kuhuma pachilanda jabhu, akabhalohiki mitumi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni, Yesu akumpeki lihina la kabheli Petulu, na Andulea ndongu waki, na Yakobo na Yohana na Filipo na Batolomayo. <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo mwana waka Alufayo na Simoni joalowakika Zelote, ndandi jaki mundu wa kukomanela inchi jaki. <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yuda mwana waka Yakobo na Yuda Isikalioti, joang'anambwiki Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhabhola na kubhalamiha bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu paakaheli kuhuma kuchitombi papamu na mitumi bhaki, akajemiki pandu papakabhili na uwanda. Pandu panihapa pakabhili na lipogha likolongwa la bhabhulwa bhaki na mapogha makolongwa gha bhandu kuhuma ku inchi ja Yudea, ku Yelusalemu na bhabhakahumiki kumaheku ja ipambala yokapi ya michi ja ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Bhandu habha bhakahikiki kunjowane Yesu na kulamishwa itamwa yabhu. Bhelabhela bhandu bhala bhabhang'ahakika na majobhi bhakahikiki na bhakalamiswe. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakapaliki kunkamu Yesu, kwa ndandi makili ghakapitiki mkati jaki na kubhalamiha bhandu bhokapi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiheku na kung'ong'uteka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu akabhang'anambuki bhabhulwa bhaki na kupwagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mpengaliki mwanganya mwabhahochu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">maghambu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga nde winu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mpengaliki mwanganya mwembi na injala sajeno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">maghambu anantupilaje!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mpengaliki mwanganya mwendela sajeno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">maghambu anamuhekaje!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Mpengaliki mwehapa ngati bhandu pabhunhakalila, pabhuntenga, pabhuntondola na kumpwaghi mahakau, kwa ndandi jaka Mwana waka Mundu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Muhekalyaji na kukina kwa chiheku paghipitalya ghanihagha, maghambu chakaka nhupu winu nde ukolongwa kunani kumahunde. Kwa ndandi bhenibhela nde bhazee bhabhu mobhakabhatendi bhalota bhaka Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Nambu anamuchibhonaje mwembi na hindu yamaheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">maghambu njomwi kupata chiheku chinu!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Anamuchibhonaje mwentupi sajenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">maghambu mwibhona injala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Anamuchibhonaje mwemuheka sajenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">maghambu anamuombulizaje na kulela!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Anamuchibhonaje mwenga mwebhundumbali bhandu, maghambu bhazee bhabhu bhakabhahengi bhalota bha icholi bhelabhela.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhapala maadui</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Nambu numpwaghi mwanganya mwenyowanela, mwapala maadui bhinu, mubhahengila manyahi bhabhunhakalila. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Mwapengalya bhala bhabhumpeke masolo, mwalobhila bhandu bhabhunhenge mahakau. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ngati mundu anaakulapwi litukwa lakumu ung'anambulya na la kabheli. Na ngati mundu anakunyawili likoti laku undekila kabheti na lishati laku. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Ngati mundu anakujopiki chindu umpekyaje, na ngati mundu jokapi anaakunyawi hindu yaku, ngawanjopa akukelabhukyaje. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Mwabhahengila bhandu bhangi chela chempala mwehapa bhunhengilaje.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Ngati anamwapaliki pela bhabhumpala, bho, anampata nyonjeka bhole? Njeta! Maghambu hata bhandu bhana mahoku bhelabhela bhabhapala bhandu bhala bhabhapala. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Kabheti ngati anamwahengi manyahi bhala pela bhabhunhenge manyahi mwehapa, bho, anampata nyonjeka bhole? Maghambu hata bhana mahoku bhatenda bhelabhela! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Ngati anamwajahika pela bhala bhamuhobhalela anabhundepaje, bho, anandangiha chiha bhole? Bhelabhela hata bhana mahoku bhabhajahika bhana mahoku bhajabhu, nahuli bhabhakelabhukya nyonjeka jelajela. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Nambu mwanganya mwapala maadui bhino, na mwahengila manyahi, na mwajahika, panga na kuhobhalela kunkelabhukila. Panihapa nhupu winu anaubya ukolongwa, na mwibya mwabhana bhaka Chapanga joabhi Kunani Nakanopi. Maghambu jombi nde wamboni kwa bhokapi bhanga na uchengulu na bhahakau. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Mbya na chiha, ngati Atati winu moabheli na chiha.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhatemu bhandu bhange</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Ngamwatemu bhandu bhange, na Chapanga ngaantemuli mwenga. Ngamwalaumu bhandu bhange, na Chapanga ngaandaumu mwenga. Mwabhalekakya bhandu bhange, na Chapanga anaandekakya mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Mwapekya bhandu bhange hindu, na Chapanga anaampekya mwenga. Nanamu mwijopalya mumabhoku ghinu chipemu chechitweli mbaka kujitika. Maghambu chipemu chentumi kubhapeme bhandu bhange, Chapanga anaatumila chipemu chocho kumpeme mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Kabheti Yesu akabhapwaghi ulenganesu ghongo, “Bho, ngalola aweza le kundongo ngalola njake? Bho, bhokapi bhabheli le ngabhijibhi mulibhomba? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Nga mbulwa joampeta mbola waki, numbu kila mbulwa anajomwi mabholu ghaki, anakubha ngati mbola waki.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Bho, maghambu kiki ulolake likanju lelibhi mu lihu laka ndongu wako, nambu ngacheubhona luboliti lolubhi mu lihu lako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Bho, uweza bholi kumpwaghi ndongu waku, ‘Ndongu wango, lendalya nukubhoa likanju lelibhi mu lihu lako,’ na koni ngacheubhona luboliti lolubhi mu lihu laku wamwene? Wenga wandumila kubhele! Utumbula hoti kubhoha luboliti lolubhi mu lihu laku, na panihapa nde wibhona wichu na wiweza kubhoha likanju lelibhili mlihu laka ndongu wako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongu na mapambiku ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Nkongu unyahi ngacheupambika mapambiku mahakau, bhelabhela njeta nkongu uhakau ghoupambika mapambiku manyahi. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Ndandi kila nkongu umanyikana kwa mapambiku ghaki ghaghapambika. Ndandi bhandu ngachebhatongola mapambiku gha nkongu ghoulowakeka mtini kuhuma mu miha, wala zabibu kuhuma mu mingwando. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mundu mnyahi alongela malobhi manyahi kuhuma mu chikoku cha mtima wake, na mundu muhakau alonge malobhi mahakau kuhuma mu chikoku cha mtima wake. Maghambu mundu ulonge mambu ghala ghaghatweli mkati ja mtima wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhachenga bha ntundu ubhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Bho, maghambu kiki munoha, ‘Bambo, Bambo,’ na koni ngachemughahenga ghala ghanumpwaghi mughahengaje? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Ananundangia ulenganesu waka mundu joanyengalela, joajowanela malobhi ghangu na kughakamula. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Jombi alenganeswa na mundu joachenga nyumba, joakemba luhuli pa liganga, na kuchenga nyumba heji panihapa. Iyula ngolongwa pajakatonyiki mafuliku ghakajilapwi nyumba jela, nambu ngacheghaweziki kujinyuha, maghambu jikachengakiki wichu. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Nambu joajowanela malobhi ghangu panga na kughakamula, alenganeswa na mundu joachengiki nyumba panani ja luhombi na panga na kukemba luhuli. Iyula ngolongwa pajakatonyiki mafuliku ghakajilapwili nyumba jela, na punkamu jakahawiki na kubhombukana nakanopi!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mtumika waka Nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli wa ku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu paakajomwili kulonge mambu ghanihagha kwa bhandu, akapiti ku Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Konihoku kukabhi na nkolongwa jumu wa manjolinjoli mia moja wa ku Loma, joakabhi na mtumika waki joakampaliki namaa. Mtumika hoju atendika kulwala pambipi na kupotela. <figure style="fig" alt="A Roman centurion" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli wa ku Loma</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Nkolongwa hoju paakajowini malobhi panani jaka Yesu, akabhatumiki bhazee bhakumu Bhayahude bhajenda bhakundobha Yesu ahika andamiha mtumika waki. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Pabhahikiki kwaka Yesu, bhakumpembali namaa, bhakapwaghiki, “Unjangatya mundu ajoju, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>maghambu abhapala bhandu bha inchi jitu, na nde joatuchengi nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Bhela, Yesu akapiti papamu nabhu. Paakaheghali kuhika pa nyumba jaka nkolongwa hoju, nkolongwa hoju akabhatumiki bhakochi bhaki bhumpwaghila Yesu, “Bambo, ngawaling'aha kuhika kone. Ndandi nenga ngachembalika kukujopale wenga ujingala mu nyumba jangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Nde ndandi nilibhoniki ngachembalika kuhika kwako. Henu ulongila pe lilobhi, na mtumika wangu anaalamaje. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ndandi nepani nanatu nde na mundu nemi pahi ja ujemelelu wa bhakolongwa, na mi na manjolinjoli pahi jangu. Numpwaghi jumu, ‘Ujendaje!’ Na jombi ajenda, na numpwaghi jongi, ‘Uhika!’ Na jombi ahika. Na ananumpwaghi mtumika wangu, ‘Uhenga anana!’ Na jombi ahenga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akakangichi namaa, na akaling'anambuki lipogha la bhandu lelabhi lunjengalela na kupwagha, “Chakaka numpwaghila ngachenabhali kumbona mundu joabhi na uhobhalelu ngati ghongone, njeta hata ku Izilaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Bhela bhandu bhala pabhahikiki kunyumba jaka Nkolongwa wa ku Loma jola bhakumketanili mtumika jola alamike.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu amuyoha mwana waka mabhu joaweliwi na ndome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Palongi pachokopi, Yesu akapiti ku muchi ghoulowakeka Naini papamu na bhabhulwa bhaki, koni akalongana na lipogha la bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Henu, paakabhi aheghale ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi, bhakapitali bhandu bhabhatowi ntuwi waka nkombu jumu, mwana kanjika waka mabhu joaweliwi na ndomi. Bhandu bhamaheli bha muchi ghola bhakabhi papamu na mabhu jola. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Bambo paakambweni mabhu jola, akamboni chiha, na akampwaghi, “Ngawilela.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Bhela, Yesu akapiti palongi na kukamu chitanda, na bhabhatowi chitanda bhakajemiki. Yesu akapwaghiki, “Nkombo! Nukupwaghi ujumukaje!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Nkombu joakapotili jola akajinwiki na kutumbu kulongela, na Yesu akampeki mabhu waki.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakatweliwi na choghohi na bhakundumbali Chapanga bhakapwaghaje, “Mlota nkolongwa waka Chapanga apitali kwitu, Chapanga ahikiki kubhakengale bhandu bhake.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Malobhi ghanihagha Yesu ghahengiki ghakajaghani ku ndema wokapi wa ku Yudea na inchi yokapi ya pambipi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabholu kuhuma kwaka Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Bhabholu bhaka Yohana Mbatizaji bhakampwaghi Yohana mambu ghala ghokapi ghaghapitalile, bhela Yohana akabhakemiki bhabhulwa bhaki bhabheli. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Na kubhatuma kwaka Bambo kundalukila, “Bho, wehapa le nde jola joakapwaghiki Yohana ahika, au tundendalya jonge?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Bhandu bhala pabhahikiki kwaka Yesu bhakumpwaghile, “Yohana Mbatizaji atutumiki tukulalukyaje, ‘Bho, wehapa le nde jola joahika au tundendalya jonge?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Chikahi chelachela, Yesu akabhalamihi bhandu bhangi bhamaheli namaa, bhabhakabhi na itamwa na bhabhakamuliki na majobhi, na kubhatenda akangalola kuweza kulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Yesu akabhayangiki bhabholu bhaka Yohana akapwagha, “Njenda mkumpwaghila ghokapi ghamughaweni na kughajowana, akangalola bhalola, iwete bhajenda, bhabhabhi na malohi banyambiswa, akangajowa bhajowana, bhakuwa bhayohakeka, na Malobhi Manyahi ghatangwazwa kwa bhahochu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Apengaliki mundu jwangakubha na makangachu na nepani!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Bhabholu bhaka Yohana pabhakabhokiki, Yesu akatumbwi kubhapwaghi mapogha gha bhandu panani jaka Yohana, “Bho, mkapiti kulipololu, kulinga kyane? Bho, mpalika kubhona litete lelinyuhakika na mpongo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ngati ngabhela, bho, henu mkapiti kulinga kyane? Bho mkapiti kumbona mundu joawati ingobhu inyahi? Bhabhawata ingobhu inyahi na kutama matamu gha kulihekeha bheni nakanopi, bhatama mu manyumba gha kikolongwa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Henu mbwaghilaje, bho, mwakapiti kulingali kike? Bho, mkapiti kundinga mlota waka Chapanga? Hena, nambu mumbweni nkolongwa kupeta mlota waka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Hajoju nde Yohana joalongaleka mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Chapanga akapwaghiki, ananuntuma mbolu wangu akulongulyaje nahuli akulenganakya indela.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Pachilanda ja bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhelakiki na mbomba Yohana Mbatizaji nde nkolongwa. Nambu joabhi nchokuchoku nakanopi mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga nde nkolongwa kupeta Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Bhandu bhokapi, papamu na bhajopa kode pabhakajowini ghahihagha bhakajetakili kubha indela jaka Chapanga nde jambone, na bhandu bhanihabha nde bhala bhabhakabatizwi na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Nambu Mafalisayo na bhabhola bha Shelia bhakakaniki indela jaka Chapanga kwabhu, kwa kukana kubatizwa na Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu akajendali kupwagha, “Bho, ananabhalenganisha bhandu bha kibheleku chenjenu na kike? Bho, bhandu abhabha bhalengana na kike? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Bhalengana na bhana bhabhatemi palighulio. Lipogha limu lakabhapwaghila lipogha lengi, ‘Tunhoni filimbe, nambu ngachenkinike! Tujembili nyembu ya maombulezu, nambu ngachendelike!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Kwa ndandi Yohana Mbatizaji akahikiki, akakongiki kula chilebhi na kunywa divai, nanamu mkapwaghiki, ‘Abhi na majobhi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwana waka Mundu akahikike, na akulikaji na kunywa, nanamu mkapwaghiki, ‘Mundingalya mundu ajoju! Ndou na ndobhela, nkochi wa bhajopa kode na bhana mahoku!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Nambu mbulau jaka Chapanga jimanyakini kubha jamboni kwa bhandu bhokapi bhabhajijetakela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu nyumba jaka Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mfalisayo jumu akankokiki Yesu kula chilebhi cha pakamihi kunyumba jaki. Na Yesu akapiti kunyumba jaka Mfalisayo jola akatamiki na kula chilebhi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Mu muchi ghola kukabhi na mbomba jumu joakabhi na mahoku. Paakajowini kubha Yesu akulika chilebhi mu nyumba jaka Mfalisayo hoju, akaletiki libotolu lelalenganakiki kwa liganga la alabhasta na mkati jaki kukabhi na mahuta gha kunungi wichu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Akahiki kujema pambipi ja magholu ghaka Yesu, akaleliki na maholi ghaki ghakahabhuki pa magholu ghaka Yesu. Mbomba jola akaghahungwi magholu ghaka Yesu kwa majunju ghaki, na kughabusu magholu na kughapaka mahuta gha kunungi wichu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mfalisayo joakankokiki Yesu paaghaweni ghanighala, akaliholali muntima waki, “Ngati mundu ajoju akabhi chakaka mlota waka Chapanga, akabya amanyi mbomba joankamu ajo wa ntundu bhole, kubha nde mwana mahoku!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu akampwaghi Mfalisayu jola, “Simoni, mili na lilobhi la kukupwaghila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni akamyangiki, “Ena Mbola, umbwaghilaje.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu akatumbwi kulongela, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu mwana mbija joakabhajahiki bhandu bhabheli mbija, mundu jumu akunjahiki ipandi mia nhwanu ya madini gha feza, na jongi ipandi hamsini ya madini gha feza. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Bhokapi bhabheli njeta joakaweziki kukelabhuha mbija, bhela mwana mbija hoju akabhalekakili bhokapi bhabheli. Bho, jwaku panihapa kwa bhabheli habha joanaampala nakanope mwana mbija?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni akayangike, “Nholake kubha mundu jola joalekakiwi mbija yamaheli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu akumpwaghile, “Uyangiki chakaka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Panihapa Yesu akung'anambuki mbomba jola, na kumpwaghi Simoni, “Bho, umbona mbomba ajojo? Nyingi munyumba jaku, ngacheumbeki machi gha kugholola magholu ghangu, nambu mbomba ajoju ang'olwi magholu ghangu kwa maholi ghaki na kunhungu kwa majunju ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ngacheunamukili kwa kunibusu, nambu mbomba ajoju kutumbu paajingala pambani, ngacheakotwiki kunibusu magholu ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ngacheumbakiki mahuta pamutu jangu, nambu mbomba ajoju ambakiki mahuta gha kunungi wichu mu magholu ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Bhela nukupwaghila, ndandi alekakiwi mahoku ghaki ghamaheli, bhela ambaliki nakanope. Nambu mundu joalekakiwi pachokope, apala pachokope.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Bhela Yesu akumpwaghi mbomba jola, “Ulekakiwi mahoku ghaku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Nambu bhokapi bhabhabhi papamu naku koni bhakakula chilebhe bhakatumbwi kulaluwana, “Bho, ajo nane joaweza kubhalekake bhandu mahoku?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Nambu Yesu akumpwaghi mbomba jola, “Uhobhalelu waku ukukengalili wenga, ujenda kwa lukwale.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Akambomba bhabhakabhi bhalongana na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Paghapetiki ghanighala Yesu akapetiki ku michi na mwijije, koni akatangaza Malobhi Manyahi gha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga. Bhabulwa bhaki komi na bhabheli bhakabhi papamu naku, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>kabhete bhakabhi akambomba bhakumu Yesu bhaakabhohiki majobhi na kubhalamiha itamu. Pachilanda jabhu akabhi Malia Magidalena, joakambohiki majobhi saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>na Yoana nhwanu waka Kuza, mtumika nkolongwa waka Helode, na Susana na akambomba bhangi bhamaheli. Akambomba habha bhakabhohiki hindu yabhu kwa kunjangati Yesu na bhabhulwa bhaki.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu waka mpanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Bhandu bhakunjendi Yesu kuhuma ku michi jengi jamaheli, na lipogha likolongwa la bhandu palakalibhongini papamu, Yesu akabhapwaghi ulenganesu hagho:<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Pakabhi na mpanda jumu joakapiti kukweta imbeju. Paakabhi akweta imbeju mu ngonda waki, yengi ikaawiki mu indela, bhandu bhakahikanyiti na ijuni ikakuliki. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Yengi ikaawiki pa luhombi lolwabhi panani ja maganga, na payameliki, ikanyaliki maghambu ngacheyapatiki machi pa luhombi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Imbeju yengi ikaawiki pa mikongu ja miha, na ikakoliki papamu naku na mikongu ja miha ikajihinyiki mimea heji. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Imbeju yengi ikaawiki pa luhombi lunyahi, na yombi ikameliki na kupambika mapambiku, kila jimu mia moja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Na Yesu paakalongi bhenibhela akajamalili na kupwagha, “Mundu joabhi na makutu na ajowanaje!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndandi ja kubhola kwa malenganesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Bhabulwa bhaki bhakundaluki Yesu, ulenganesu ghongone ndandi jaki kike? <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Mwanganya muyekuliwi kumanya sili ja Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, nambu kwa bhandu bhange, nonge nabhu kwa milenganesu, nahuli bhalingaje nambu ngabhibhona, na bhajowanyaje nambu ngabhimanya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alanda ulenganesu waka mpanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Jenjenu nde ndandi ja ulenganesu hoghu, imbeju nde lilobhi laka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Imbeju yeyaawiki mwindela ilangi bhandu bhala bhabhajowana lilobhi, nambu Shetani ahika na kulibhoha lilobhi lela mu mitima jabhu nahuli ngabhihika kuhobhalela na kukengaleka. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Imbeju yeyaawiki pa luhombi lolwabhi pa maganga ilangi bhandu bhala bhabhalijowana lilobhi na kulijopale kwa chiheku, nambu ngachelibhi na mikegha na ngachelajingile mkati nakanopi mu mitima jabhu. Bhalihobhale kwa chikahi chijipi pela, na pabhalengakeka bhuuleka uhobhalelu wabho. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Imbeju yeyaawiki pa mikongu ja miha ilangi bhandu bhala bhabhajowana lilobhi laka Chapanga, nambu pabhajendalela bhahinyakika na mang'ahiku, kupala hindu yamaheli na mahakau gha pani pundema, na bhombi ngachebhapambika mapambiku. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Imbeju yeyaawiki pa luhombi lunyahi ilangi bhandu bhala bhabhalijowana lilobhi laka Chapanga, na kulijopalela kwa mtima unyahi na kulijengalela, bhanganya habha nde bhandu bhala bhabhalikamulaki lilobhi na kuhinakalila kwamaheli na kuhenga ngati moapali Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa taa jejikupakiki na chihulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mako 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Nga mundu joapambaki taa na kukupaki chihulu au kujibheka kwihi ku chitanda. Nambu bhajibheka panani ja chinala, nahuli bhandu pabhajingila munyumba bhaubhona unang'anu.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Ndandi chindu chokapi chechihiyakiki chitenda kuyekulika, na chokapi chechikupakiki chimanyikana na kubhekakeka palanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Bhela mlilendaje monjowane malobhi, ndandi joabhi na chindu anajonjukiwa nakanope, nambu jwanga na chindu, hata chela chichoku cheaholake abhi nachu anachitolakikaje.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amabhu waka Yesu na bhalongu bhaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Amabhu waka Yesu na bhalongu bhaka Yesu bhakahikiki kumbona, nambu ngachebhaweziki kunhikila pambipi kwa ndandi ja lipogha la bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Mundu jumu akumpwaghi Yesu, “Amabhu waku na bhalongu bhaku bhajemiki kunja na bhapala kukubhona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu akabhayangiki bhokapi, “Amabhu wangu na bhalongu bhangu nde bhala bhokapi bhabhalijowana Lilobhi laka Chapanga na kulitii.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atumbalisha mbelu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akajingi mu ngalawa papamu na bhabhulwa bhaki, na akabhapwaghile, “Tumboka tulombuka mbaka kwihi ja nhwanga.” Panihapa bhakatumbwi mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Pabhakabhi bhalomboka kwa ngalawa, Yesu akaghochi lughono. Palapala mbelu ukolongwa ukatumbwi kupogha mu nhwanga, na machi ghakatumbwi kutwelela mu ngalawa, bhokapi bhakabhi pambipi kujibhila. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Bhabhulwa bhakunjendi Yesu na kunjumuwa, bhakapwaghaje, “Bambo, Bambo! Tupotela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu akajumwiki na kuulakalila mpongu na majegha makolongwa, na kukatondiki na kubha wichu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Panihapa Yesu akabhalaluki bhabhulwa bhaki, “Bho, uhobhalelu winu ubhi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nambu bhombi bhakakangichi, na kujoghopa koni bhakapwaghanya, “Bho, hajo mundu bhole? Aulakali mpongu na majegha nayombi yuntii!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mundu joabhi na majobhi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu na bhabhulwa bhaki bhakajendali na mwanja mbaka ku inchi ja Bhagelasi, jejibhi kwihi ja nhwanga Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesu paakabhi ahuluka mungalawa, akahimangini na mundu jumu joakabhi na majobhi kuhuma kumbwane akunhikile. Kwa chikahi chilachu mundu hoju ajendika panga kuwata ingobhu na ngacheatamika panyumba, nambu atamika kumatengele. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Paambweni Yesu, akaleliki na kulilekela pamagholu ghaki, na kujamalila akapwagha, “Yesu, Mwana waka Chapanga Joabhi Kunani Nakanopi! Bho, upala kundenda kyane? Nukulobha, ngawing'aha!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Mundu ajoju akapwaghiki bhenibhela maghambu Yesu akalipwaghi lijobhi lela limbokaje. Lijobhi lela likankamwili mundu jola pamaheli, na hata ngati bhandu bhunkongika mabhoku na magholu kwa minyololu na pengu, nambu ahekata minyololu na pengu na majobhi ghundonguwa kujenda kulipololo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu akundalukile, “Bho, lihina laku wa nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Na jombi akamuyangiki, “Lihina langu ‘Lipogha,’ ” maghambu akabhi na majobhi ghamahele. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Majobhi ghala ghakumpembali Yesu ngabhapeleka kuwawa.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Pandu pala pakabhi na lipogha likolongwa la magholobhi, bhakalimila mwitombi. Bhela majobhi ghakunjopiki Yesu abhajetakalya bhakajingala mu magholobhi, najombi akaghalekiki ghajendaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Majobhi ghakumpitiki mundu jola na kujingi mu magholobhi. Lipogha lokapi la magholobhi lakaheli pa likemba na kujibhi mu nhwanga, na ghokapi ghakapotile mumachi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Bhadima bhala pabhaliweni lijambu lelapitalili, bhakakembili na kujenda kupwagha mambu ghanihagha kumbwane na kwijije. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Bhandu bhakahiki kulinga lelipitalile, na pabhahiki kwaka Yesu, bhakunhimani mundu joghumpitiki majobhi atami pambipi na Yesu, awati ingobhu na malangu ghaki ghunkelabhukile, na bhandu bhokapi bhakajowipe. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Bhala bhabhaghaweni ghaghahengakiki bhakabhapwaghi bhandu ntundu mundu jola moakalamile. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha inchi ja Bhagelasi bhakunjopiki Yesu abhoka kwabhu, maghambu bhakabhi na choghohi namaa. Panihapa Yesu akajingi mu ngalawa na kubhoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mundu joghumpitiki majobhi akunjopiki Yesu, “Unyetakya nyenda na wenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Nambu Yesu ngacheajetakili kujenda naku, na akumpwaghile, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Ubhuja kunyumba ukabhalandila bhandu mambu ghokapi makolongwa ghaakutendi Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Bhela mundu jola akapetiki ku muchi wokapi, akatangaza mambu ghokapi Yesu ghaakantendile.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali waka Yairo na mbomba jumu bhalamiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu paakakelawiki upambala ghongi wa nhwanga, lipogha la bhandu bhakunjopali kwa chiheku, maghambu bhokapi bhundendalya jombi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Panihapa akahikiki mundu jumu joalowakika Yailo, joakabhi nkolongwa wa nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude, akahikiki na kulihabhu pambipi ja magholu ghaka Yesu, akundobha ajenda kunyumba jaki, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>ndandi mwali waki wa kanjika, joakabhi na hyaka komi na ibheli, akabhi pambipi kupotela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu paajendikaje, lipogha la bhandu lakunhinyiki ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Pa chilanda jabhu kukabhi na mbomba jumu joakang'ahakiki na chitamu cha kupita mwahi kwa hyaka komi na ibheli, papamu na kutumi hindu yaki yokapi kwa akasing'anga, nambu nga jumu joaweziki kundamiha. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Mbomba hoju akanjengali Yesu cha kunyuma na kukamu nkungilu wa ingobhu jaki. Palapala chitamu chaki cha kupita mwahi chakalamike. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu akalalukile, “Bho, nde nane joangamwile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Bhandu bhokapi bhakakaniki, Petulu akapwaghike, “Bambo, lipogha la bhandu likuyongalwiti na kukuhinya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Nambu Yesu akapwaghike, “Kubhi mundu joangamwile, ndandi niliweni makili ghamokite.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mbomba jola paamanyiti kubha ngaawezi kulihiya, akahikiki koni abhaghaja kwa choghohi na kulileke palongi jaka Yesu. Panihapa akundandi Yesu palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi panipala ndandi ja kunkamu Yesu na ntundu moawezi kulamishwa palapala. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu akumpwaghi mwali jola, “Kamwali, uhobhalelu waku ukulamihe. Ujenda kwa lukwale.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu paakabhi ajendale kupwagha, mbolu akahikiki kuhuma kunyumba jaka Yairo. Na kumpwaghi Yairo, “Mwali waku apotile. Ngawijendale kung'aha Mbola.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Nambu Yesu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akumpwaghi Yairo, “Ngawijoghopa, uhobhalya pela, na mwali waku analamiswaje.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Yesu paakahikiki kunyumba jaka Yairo, ngacheanjetakali mundu jokapi kujingi naku munyumba, nambu Petulu na Yohana na Yakobo na mabhu na atati bhaka mwali joapotili jola. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakabhi bhundelela na kuombuleza kwa ndandi ja kupotela kwaka mwana. Nambu Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwilela, maghambu mwana ngacheapotile, nambu aghochili lughonu pela!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Bhokapi bhakundongimi Yesu, maghambu bhakamanyiki kubha mwali apotile. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Nambu Yesu akamkamwi chibhoku na kundoha, “Kamwali, jumukaje!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Mwali joakapotili jola womi waki ukankelabhukile, na palapala akajemiki. Na Yesu akabhalaghalakili bhumpekya mwali chilebhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Bhabheleka bhaki bhakakangichi namaa, nambu Yesu akabhalaghalaki ngabhumpwaghi mundu ghaghahengakike.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhatuma bhabhulwa bhaki komi na bhabheli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu akabhalohiki bhabhulwa bhaki komi na bhabheli, akabhapeki makili na uwezu wa kughatopo majobhi na kulamiha bhatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Bhela akabhatumiki bhajenda kubhatangazi bhandu ubholu wa Ukolongwa waka Chapanga na kubhalamiha bhatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Akapwagha, “Ngamwitogho chindu chokapi chela pa mwanja winu, ngamwitogho nkongochu, wala nkoba, wala chilebhi, wala mbija, wala ingobhu ibhele. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Nyumba jokapi jemwijingalaji na kujopalewa, mtamaje monihomu mbaka pamwibhoka mu muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Ana ngati bhandu bhikana kunjopalela, mboka muchi ghonihoghu na nkung'undaje luhombi mu magholu ghinu ngati ulandilu kubha bhombi bhakaniki kunjowanela.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Panihapa bhabhulwa bhakabhokiki na kujenda kwijiji, koni bhakatangaza Malobhi Manyahi na kubhalamiha bhandu pandu pokapi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Choghohi chaka Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Helode mtawala wa ku Galilaya, akajowini malobhi ghokapi ghaghatendakiki na Yesu. Na jombi akabhi na choghohi, maghambu bhandu bhapwaghika kubha Yohana Mbatizaji ayokiki kuhuma kwa bhakuwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Bhangi bhapwaghika Eliya atehi kupitalila, na bhangi bhapwaghika kubha jumu wa bhalota bhaka Chapanga bha mwandi atehi kuyoka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Helode akapwaghike, “Yohana nukunhekiti mmutu, bho, henu ajoju nde nane ambaju nyowana malobhi ghaki?” Na jombi akatokuli kumbona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhaleha bhandu elfu nhwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Mitumi bhaka Yesu pabhakelawiki bhakumpwaghi Yesu ghokapi ghabhahengiki. Na jombi akabhatoliki bhabhulwa bhaki na kujenda nabhu kanjika jabhu ku muchi wa ku Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Nambu lipogha la bhandu palamanyiki koajenda, bhakunjengalile. Yesu akabhajopalili, na kubhapwaghila panani ja Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, na kubhalamiha bhandu bhabhakabhi bhapala kulamishwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Pakwahiki pakamihi, bhabhulwa komi na bhabheli bhala bhakunjendi Yesu na kumpwaghila, “Wapwaghila bhandu bhajenda kwijiji na mu manyumba yeibhi pambipi na mighonda nahuli bhakalinga chilebhi na pandu pa kughonela, maghambu pandu pani pachingwenje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Nambu Yesu akabhayangiki, “Mwanganya mwabhete mwapekya chilebhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bhombi bhakapwaghike, “Tubhinaghu pela mabumunda nhwanu na homba ibheli. Bho, upala le tujenda kuheme chilebhi cha kubhaleha bhandu bhokapi abhabha?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Pandu panipala pakabhi na akanalomi ngati elfu nhwano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Mwatamika bhandu mu mapogha na kila lipogha likubhaje na bhandu hamsini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Bhabhulwa bhaki bhakatei bhenibhela, na kubhatamika pahi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesu akatohi mabumunda nhwanu ghala na homba ibheli, akalingali kunani kumahunde, akaipengalile. Bhela akahekiti mabumunda na homba, na kubhapeke bhabhulwa bhaki bhaghabhila bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakakuliki na bhakatupile. Na bhabhulwa bhakabhongini mahighalilu gha mabumunda na homba itonga komi na ibheli.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu anjetakela Yesu kubha nde Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mako 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Lichobha limu Yesu paakabhi andobha Chapanga pandu pa kanjika. Bhabhulwa bhaki bhakunjendile, najombi akabhalalukili, “Bho, bhandu bhapwagha kubha nepani nde nane?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Bhakanjangiki, “Bhandu bhangi bhapwagha wehapa wa Yohana Mbatizaji, na bhangi bhapwagha wehapa wa Eliya, na bhangi bhapwagha, wehapa nde jumu wa bhalota bhaka Chapanga bhamwande weuyokike.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Na jombi akabhalalukile, “Bho, mwanganya mpwagha nepani na nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulu akayangaki, “Wehapa nde wa Kristo waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongalela kupotela kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mako 8:30-9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Bhela Yesu akabhakanaki ngabhampwaghi mundu lijambu leniheli. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Yesu akapwaghiki kabheti, “Impalika Mwana waka Mundu kupata mang'ahiku na kukanakika na bhazee, bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa, na bhabhola bha Shelia. Na jombi anabhunkomaje, nambu lichobha la katatu anayokaje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Kabheti akabhapwaghi bhokapi, “Mundu jokapi jopala kubha mbulwa wangu, impalika alikana mweni, autola msalaba waki machobha ghokapi, na anyengalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Ndandi mundu jokapi joapala kukengalela womi waki anauhoaje, nambu joahoa womi waki kwa ndandi jangu, anaukengalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Bho, anakunjangatya kiki mundu kupata kila chindu chekibhi pani pundema koni auhoa womi waki au kuliyonanga mweni? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Anangati mundu amonela iyoni nepani na mabholu ghangu, Mwana waka Mundu anambonila iyoni mundu hoju paanahika mu ulumbalilu waki, na ulumbalilu wa Atati waki, na ulumbalilu wa bhatumika bhahuhu bha kunani bhaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Numpwaghi chakaka, bhabhi bhangi bhabhajemiki pambani ngabhapoteli mbaka pabhaubhona Ukolongwa waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ang'anambuka pamihu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mako 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Paghapetiki machobha nane kutumbu palongila ghanihagha, Yesu akuntoi Petulu, na Yohana, na Yakobo papamu nabhu na kukwela nabhu kuchitombi kundobha Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Yesu paakabhi andobha Chapanga, pamihu jaki pakang'anambwiki, na ingobhu yaki ikang'anyiki ng'aing'ai. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Palapala bhakapitali bhandu bhabheli na kulonge naku. Bhandu habha bhakabhi Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>bhakabhonakini bhakabya mu ulumbalilu wa kunani kumahunde na bhakalongi na Yesu panani ja kutimiza lengu laka Chapanga kwa kupotela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petulu na bhajaki bhakabhi bhaghochi lughonu nakanopi, na bhakakikanwiki na kuubhona ulumbalilu waka Yesu na bhandu bhabhheli bhabhajemiki papamu naku. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Musa na Eliya pabhabhokiki, Petulu akumpwaghi Yesu, “Bambo, mbanga tepani tutama pambane! Tuchenga indamba itatu, chimu chaku, chengi chaka Musa na chengi chaka Eliya.” Petulu ngacheakamanyi chealongilaje.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Petulu paakabhi alonge ghanihagha, lihundi lakapitalili na kubhayeka kwa nhwili waki, na bhabhulwa bhakajowipi ntundu lihundi molakabhayekile. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Sauti jakajowaniki kuhuma mu lihundi, jakapwagha, “Hajoju nde Mwana wangu jonunhawile, munjowanya jombi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Sauti pajakotwiki kujowaneka, Yesu akabhonakini abhi kanjika. Bhabhulwa bhakatami chinunu, na kwa chikahi chenihechi ngachebhumpwaghi mundu chindu chokapi chebhachiwene.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha nkombu joakamuliki na majobhi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mako 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Chilabhu jaki Yesu na bhabhulwa bhatatu bhala bhakaheli kuhuma kuchitombi, na lipogha likolongwa la bhandu lakaimangini na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Mundu jumu kuhuma mu lipogha akajamalili, akapwaghaje, “Mbola! Nukujopa undingalya mwana wangu, kwa ndandi jombi nde mwana wangu wa kanjika! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Chikahi chamaheli majobhi ghunkamula, najombi palapala ajamalila, kabheti ghunjeghe chihinduhindu, koni akapita mahuluhulu mundomu, ghunkojo muhyegha, na anaghunkamwi ghundekake kwa kung'ahika! <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Nakabhajopiki bhabhulwa bhaku bhumboha lijobhi, nambu ngachebhawezike.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Mwenga chibheleku changa uhobhalelu na chechihobhike! Bho, anandama na mwenga mbaka lile? Bho, ananunhinakalya mbaka line?” Bhela akumpwaghi mundu jola, “Undeta mwana waku pambane.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Nkombu jola paakabhi anjende Yesu, lijobhi lela lakunjeghi chihinduhindu na kunhabhu pahi. Yesu akandakali lijobhi, akundamihi nkombu hoju na kunkelabhua kwa atati waki. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakakangichi kwa kubhona uwezu ukolongwa waka Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu alonge kabheti panani ja kupotela kwaki</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bhandu bhokapi pabhabhi bhakona kukangacha mambu ghahengika Yesu, jombi akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Njowanakya ghanga ghanumpwaghila! Mwana waka Mundu anaajeghalika mu mabhoku gha bhandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Nambu bhabhulwa bhaki ngachebhamanyiki ndandi ja malobhi ghanihagha, na ghakahiyakiki kwabhu nahuli ngabhimanya, na bhombi bhakajowipi kundalukila Yesu ndandi ja malobhi ghanihagha.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Joabhi nkolongwa nane?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Bhabulwa bhaka Yesu bhakatumbwi kulochana kubha nde nane joaibya nkolongwa kwa lujiniku pachilanda jitu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu akaghamanyi maholalelu gha mitima jabhu, bhela akuntoliki mwana na kunjemeka pambipi jaki. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Na kubhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Mundu jokapi joanjopale mwana jonjoni kwa lihina langu, anyopale nepani. Na mundu jokapi joanyopale nepani, anjopale jola joandumike. Ndandi joabhi nchoku pachilanda jinu, jonihoju nde nkolongwa kwa lujiniku kupeta bhokapi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jokapi jwangakupengana na mwenga abhi chipambala chimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mako 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohana akumpwaghi Yesu, “Bambo, tumbweni mundu akabhoha majobhi kwa lihina laku, na tepani tukalengiki kundakalila, maghambu jombi ngachealongana na tepani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu akumpwaghi Yohana papamu na bhabhulwa bhajaki, “Ngamwandakalila, ndandi mundu jokapi jwangakupengana na mwenga abhi upambala chinu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhakumu bha ku Samalia bhakana kunjopale Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Chikahi pachaheghali chaka Yesu kutolakeka kujenda kunani kumahunde, Yesu akaamwili kujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Akabhatumiki bhabholu bhundongulyaje, na bhombi bhakapiti ku chijiji cha ku Samalia nahuli bhundenganakya kila chindu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Nambu bhandu bha chijiji cha ku Samalia ngachebhunjopalile, ndandi ikamanyakini apita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Bhabhulwa bhaka Yesu, bhabhakabhi Yakobo na Yohana pabhaghhaweni ghanighala, bhakundaluki Yesu, “Bambo, bho, upala le tulaghalakya moto kuhuma kunani ubhajochaje ngati Eliya moakahengile?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu akang'anambwiki na kubhakenjukila, akapwagha, “Ngachemmanyi nde roho ja ntundu bhole jembi naju.” <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Kwa ndandi Mwana waka Mundu ngacheahikiki kuiyonanga roho ya bhandu, nambu kuikengalela. Panihapa Yesu na bhabhulwa bhaki bhakapiti ku chijiji nachengi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ghaghapalika kwa kubha mbulwa waka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Pabhakabhi mwindela bhakajendaje, mundu jumu akumpwaghi Yesu, “Ananukujengalya kwokapi kowijendaje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu akumpwaghile, “Mabweha ghabhi na makolu, na ijuni ibhi na mihuwi, nambu Mwana waka Mundu ngacheabhi na pandu pa kulighoneka na kupomulela.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu akumpwaghi mundu jongi, “Unyengalyaje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Nambu mundu jola akayangaki, “Bambo, uneka hoti nyenda nakuntagha atati wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu akampwaghile, “Waleka bhakuwa bhabhataghaje bhakuwa bhabhu. Nambu wehapa ujenda ukatangaza Ukolongwa waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Mundu jongi akumpwaghile, “Bambo, ananukujengalyaje, nambu uneka hoti nyendaje nakabhalaghila bhalongu bhangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesu akumpwaghile, “Mundu jokapi joatumbu kulema na papa kutumbu kabheti kulingali kunyuma ngacheapalika mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhatuma bhabhulwa sabini na bhabheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Paghapetiki ghanighala Yesu akahawi bhandu bhangi sabini na bhabheli, akabhatumiki bhabheli bhabheli, bhundongulya mu kila muchi na pandu papalika jombi kujenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Akabhapwaghile, “Mahunu nde ghamaheli, nambu bhahuna nde bhachoko. Mundobha Bambo wa mahuno abhatuma bhatumika mu ngonda waki. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Henu njendanyaje! Nuntuma ngati mambeleli pachilanda ja mabweha gha muchitengu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Ngamwitogho mbija, nkoba, na magubasi, na ngamwijema mwindela kundamuki mundu jokapi jola. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Ananjingi munyumba jokapi, kutumbula mpwagha, ‘Lukwale lubya munyumba jenu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Ngati monimola anakubhi na mundu joapala kutama kwa lukwali abhi panihapa, lukwali lwinu lwa kulamukila analuhighalya kwaki. Ngati njeta, lukwali lola analunkelebhukyaje. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Ntama munyumba jeniheji, koni mkakula na kunywa chokapi chebhampekyaje, maghambu mtumika apalika kujopalela malepu ghaki. Ngamwibhoka kujenda kutama nyumba najengi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Anampiti ku muchi na bhandu bhaki anabhunjopalili, nkula chela chebhampekyaje. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Mwalamiha bhatamwa bhabhabhi monihomu, na mwapwaghila, ‘Ukolongwa waka Chapanga uheghali kwinu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Nambu ananjingi mu muchi wokapi, na bhandu anabhakaniki kunjopalela, mboka, njenda mu indela yabhu na kupwagha, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Hata luhombi lwa muchi winu lolukamulini mu magholu ghitu, tukung'unda palongi jinu, ngati ulakalilu kwinu, nambu nkombuka kubha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga unheghalile!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Numpwaghi chakaka, mu Lichobha la Utemulu Chapanga analangiha chiha kwa muchi wa Sodoma kuliku muchi ghonihoghu!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha michi jangakung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Anamuchibhonaje bhandu bha muchi wa Kolazini! Anauchibhonaje bhandu bha muchi wa Betisaida! Ndandi ngangachu yeitendakiki kwaku ikatendiki ku Tilo na ku Sidoni, bhandu bha konihoku bhakabya bhajomwi kutama pahi, na kuwata ingobhu ya magunila, na kulipaka ilihu, na kulangi kubha bhang'anambwiki na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Nambu Chapanga analangiha chiha nakanopi mu Lichobha la Utemulu kwa bhandu bha muchi wa Tilo na Sidoni kupeta kwinu mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Nanau muchi wa Kapelenaumu! Bho, upala le kulikweha mbaka kunani kumahunde? Anauhelalika mpaka kuwawa!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yesu akabhapwaghi bhhabulwa bhaki, “Mundu jola joanjowane mwehapa, anyowane nepani, na mundu joankana mwehapa, angana nepani, na mundu joangana nepani ankana jola joandumike.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu sabini na bhabheli bhakelabhuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Bhandu sabini na bhabheli bhala bhakakelawiki kwa chiheku na kupwagha, “Bambo, kwa lihina laku hata majobhi ghatutii!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Nakumbweni Shetani akahabhuka kuhuma kunani kumahunde ngati chitobhi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Njowanya! Numpeki uwezu wa kukanyata majoka na hipeleli, na uwezu panani ja makili ghokapi ghaka Adui, na nga chindu chechampotikaje. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Nambu ngamwikubha na chiheku ndandi majobhi ghuntii mwehapa, nambu muhekalya maghambu mahina ghinu ghalembakiki kunani kumahunde.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahekalela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Chikahi chelachela, Yesu akatwelakiki na chiheku kwa uwezu waka Roho Mhuhu, na kupwagha, “Atati, Bambo wa kunani kumahunde na pundema! Nukuchengu maghambu wahiiki mambu ghani bhabhabhi na mbulau na malango, na ughahyekwi kwa bhana. Ena, Atati, ndandi ghanihagha nde moghabheli mapalu ghaku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Akajendali kubhapwaghi bhandu, “Atati wangu ambeki hindu yokapi. Nga jumu joammanyi Mwana nambu Atati, kabheti nga joammanyi Atati nambu Mwana, na jokapi Mwana joapala kumuhyekulila.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Bhela Yesu akabhang'anambuki bhabhulwa bhaki, na kulonge nabhu bhombi kanjika jabhu, na kubhapwaghila, “Mbanga bhandu bhabhaghabhona mambu ghamughabhona mwenga! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Numpwaghi chakaka, bhalota bhamaheli bhaka Chapanga na bhakolongwa bha pundema bhakatokuli kughabhona ghamughabhona, nambu ngachebhaghawene, na kujowana malobhi ghamughajowana, nambu ngachebhajowine.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu waka Msamalia wamboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mundu jumu joaimanyi Shelia akajemiki, na kundaluki Yesu kwa kundenga, “Mbola, bho, ndenda bhole nahuli mbata kupwelela womi wa mileli?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu akundalukile, “Bho, Shelia jipwagha bhole? Bho, ujimanya bhole paujiasoma?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Mundu jola akamyangiki, “ ‘Umpala Bambo Chapanga waku kwa mtima waku wokapi, kwa roho jaku jokapi, kwa makili ghaku ghokapi, na kwa malangu ghaku ghokapi, na umpala njaku ngati moulipali wamweti.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu akampwaghile, “Uyangiki wichu! Utenda bhenibhela, nanaghu anautamaje.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Nambu jombi kwa kupala kulilinga ngati jombi wamboni akundaluki Yesu, “Bho, njangu nde nane?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu akamyangiki, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu joahelala kuhuma ku Yelusalemu na kujenda ku Yeliko. Paakabhi mwindela, akalapuliki na bhihe, na bhakunyawili hindu yaki, na bhakundekiki aghoni panipala akabya pambipi kupotela. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Panihapa akapitali mpenganyambiku jumu akahelala indela jelajela, paakambweni mundu joakalapuliki jola, akapetiki kunkeghi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Bhelabhela Mlawi jumu akahikiki pandu pala, najombi paakambweni mundu joalapuliki jola, najombi akapetiki kunkeghi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Nambu Msamalia jumu joakabhi apeta indela jelajela, akunketani mundu joalapuliki jola. Na jombi paakambweni mundu jola, mtima waki ukamboni chiha. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Akanjendili, akangolwi ilonda yaki kwa mahuta na divai na kuikonga kwa itambala. Bhela akamkwehiki paliponda laki, akampeliki munyumba ja kuhiki bhagheni na kundwaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Chilabhu jaki Msamalia jola akabhohiki ipandi ibhele ya madini gha feza na kumpeke mweni nyumba, na kumpwaghila, ‘Undwaa mundu ajoju. Na mbija yengi yeipetalya yenjenu kwa kunjangatila, ananepa nepani panikelabhukaje.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Yesu akalalukile, “Ubhona bhole, bho, jwaku pachilanda ja bhatatu habha, nde njake mundu joalapuliki na bhihi jola?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Mbola wa Shelia jola akamyangiki, “Nde jola joakamboni chiha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu akampwaghile, “Jendaje na ukatenda bhelabhela.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kunyumba jaka Masa na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesu na bhabhulwa bhaki pabhakabhi mu mwanja, bhakajingi mu chijiji chimu. Na mbomba jumu joalowakika Masa, akanjopali kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Masa akabhi na ndombu waki joalowakika Malia, joakatemi pambipi na Yesu akajowanya mabholu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Masa akabhi ahangajika na mahengu ghingi gha munyumba, bhela akanjendi Yesu na kumpwaghila, “Bambo, bho, ngacheubhona le kubha ndombu wangu anekiki nhenga mahengu kanjika jango? Umpwaghila ahika anyangatyaje!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Bambo akamyangiki, “Masa, Masa! Ung'ahika na kulyungalyunga kwa mambu ghamaheli, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>nambu chipalika pe chindu chimu. Malia ahawili chindu chamboni nakanopi chechu nga mundu joanyaghulaje.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhabhola bhabhulwa bhaki kundobha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akabhi pandu pamu akundobha Chapanga. Paakajomwi kulobha, mbulwa waki jumu akumpwaghile, “Bambo, utubhola kulobha, ngati Yohana moakabhabholi bhabhulwa bhaki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Pamundobha Chapanga, mpwagha ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Atati witu weubhi kunani kumahunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Lihina laku lilumbalikaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ukolongwa waku uhikaje, mapalu ghaku ghapitalyaje, pani pundema, ngati kunani kumahunde.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Utupekya chilebhi chitu cha kila lichobha.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Utulekakya mahoku ghitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Ngati tepani motubhalekalela bhokapi bhabhatuhokiye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Na ngawatuleka kujingila mu malengakeku, nambu utukengalya na Muhakau jola.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Tupwagha jumu winu ajenda pamahiku kunyumba jaka nkochi waki na kupwagha, ‘Nkochi wangu, unyahika mabumunda ghatatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Ndandi nkochi wangu ahikiki kwangu kuhuma mu mwanja, nanatu ngachemi na chilebhi cha kumpekeha!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Na tupwagha nkochi joabhi munyumba akayanga, ‘Ngawing'aha! Ndyangu ujighalike, nepani na bhana bhangu tughonile. Ngachenhweza kujumuka na kukupeke chokapi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Chakaka numpwaghila, hata ngati ngaayijumuki na kukupeke chilebhi hata koni wehapa unkochi waki, nambu kwa ndandi ja kujendale kunjopa, ayijumukaji na kumpeke kila chindu cheapala maghambu ngacheakabhi na iyoni kujendale kunjopa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Bhela numpwaghila, “Ndobhaje nanamu anampataje, mlondaye nanamu mwipataje, muhodimaje nanamu mwihoghuliwa ndyangu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Ndandi mundu jokapi joalobha ayijopalyaje, na mundu jokapi joalonda ayipataje, na mundu jokapi joahodima anahoghuliwa ndyangu. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Bho, Atati bholi pachilanda jinu joaweza kumpeke mwana waki liganga ngati anajopiki libumunda au anaanjopiki homba, na badala ja homba anaampekya lijoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Au mwana anajopiki lihombi, anampekya chipelele? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Ngati mwehapa mwembi mwahakau, mmanyi kubhapekeha hindu inayahi bhana bhinu, bho, Atati winu wa kunani kumahunde ngaapeke Roho Mhuhu bhokapi bhabhunjopa?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Beelizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mako 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akabhi amboha lijobhi lelakuntendiki mundu jumu abya mpuli. Lijobhi lela palumbokiki mundu jola, akatumbwi kulongela, na lipogha la bhandu lakakangichi namaa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Nambu bhandu bhangi bhakapwaghike, “Aghabhoha majobhi kwa makili ghaka Beelizebuli, nkolongwa wa majobhi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Bhandu bhangi kwa kundenga Yesu, bhakapaliki atenda nginyulila kuhuma kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Nambu Yesu akaghamanyi maholalelu ghabhu, akabhapwaghile, “Ukolongwa wokapi woulekangini mapogha ghaghapengana ngauwezi kutamakila, bhelabhela bhandu bha nyumba jimu anabhapengana bheni kwa bheni, bhandu bha nyumba heji anabhalekanaje. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ngati ukolongwa waka Shetani ulekangini mapogha ghaghapengana, bho, ukolongwa waki wijema bhole? Numpwaghi aghagha ndandi mwanganya mpwagha nepani moha majobhi kwa makili ghaka Beelizebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ngati nepani moha majobhi kwa makili ghaka Beelizebuli, bho, bhahemba bhinu bhaghatopola kwa uwezu waka nane? Bhahemba bhinu anabhuntemula kubha mwanganya muhokihe! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Nambu ngati anamoha majobhi kwa uwezu waka Chapanga, bhela Ukolongwa waka Chapanga unhikile.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Mundu joabhi na makili, paalenda nyumba jaki kwa silaha, hindu yaki yokapi ikubha lukwale. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Nambu anahiki mundu joabhi na makili kumpeta jombhi anakomini naku na kundapula, jonihoju anaanyaghula silaha jeahobhalyaje na kuighabha hindu yeanyawile.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Mundu jokapi jwangakulilomba na nepani, atenda kumbenga, na mundu jokapi jwangakubhongana papamu na nepani, atenda kupechangana.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukelebhuka kwa lijobhi kwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Lijobhi palumpita mundu, liyongolota yongolota pandu pajomu likalola pandu pa kupomulela. Nambu nangakupabhona pandu pa kupomulela, ajipwaghi, ‘Anangelebhuka kabhete kunyumba jangu konhumiki.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Paakelabhuka na kujiketane nyumba jipyaghaliki na kupambakika wichu, <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>bhela ajenda na kughaloha majobhi ghangi saba mahakau kupeta jombi, na ghombi ghajingila na kutama mkati jaka mundu hoju. Henu hali jaka mundu jola anajikubha jihakau nakanopi kupeta pakutumbula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiheku cha chakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesu palongila ghanihagha, mbomba jumu joakabhi pa lipogha la bhandu pala akajamali na kupwagha, “Mbanga mbomba joakubheliki, na kukujongea!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Nambu Yesu akamuyangiki, “Mbanga nakanopi bhabhalijowana Lilobhi laka Chapanga na kulitii.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nginyulila jaka Yona</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Lipogha la bhandu palajonjukiki, Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Chibheleku chenjenu nde chibheleku cha bhandu bhahakau. Chipala nginyulila, nambu ngachipati nginyuli jokapi jela, nambu nginyuli jaka Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Ndandi ngati mlota Yona moakabheli nginyulila kwa bhandu bha Ninawi, bhelabhela Mwana waka Mundu nde moayibhelila nginyulila kwa chibheleku chenjenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Lichobha la Utemulu, malikia wa ku Sheba anaajemaje na kubhatakila bhandu bha chibheleku chenjenu, maghambu jombi akahikiki kuhuma kutali nakanopi kuhika kujowane malobhi gha mbulau ghaka Nkolongwa Solomoni, henu numpwaghila, pambani abhi nkolongwa kupeta Solomoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mu Lichobha la Utemulu, bhandu bha ku Ninawi bhijema papamu na kubhatakila bhandu bha kibheleku chenjenu, maghambu bhombi bhakang'anambwiki na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu pabhajowini kutangaza kwaka Yona. Chakaka numpwaghila pambani abhi nkolongwa kupeta Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Unang'anu wa hyegha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Nga mundu joapambaki taa na kujihiya au kujiyekale na chihulu. Nambu bhajibheka panani ja kinala, nahuli bhandu bhokapi bhabhajingila bhabhona unang'anu waki. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Lihu laku nde taa ja hyegha jaku. Ngati lihu laku analibhi linyahi, hyegha jaku jokapi jitweli unang'anu. Nambu ngati lihu laku ngalinyahi, hyegha jaku jitweli lwihe. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Bhela ulilingalya wichu unang'anu waku ghoubhi naku mkati ja hyegha jaku ngawikubha lwihe. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Bhela anakubhi hyegha jaku jokapi jibhi na unang'anu, panga kubha na pandu papabhi na lwihi, hyegha jaku jokapi anajibya na unang'anu, ngati taa mojikumulakila kwa unang'anu waki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhalaumu Mafalisayo na bhabhola bha Shelia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu paajomula kupwagha, Mfalisayo jumu akundohiki ajenda kunyumba jaki akakula chilebhe. Bhela Yesu akajingili na kutama kula chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mfalisayo jola akakangichi kumbona Yesu akula chilebhe mangane ja kuchamba machi mabhoku ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Bhela Bambo akampwaghile, “Mwanganya Mwafalisayo, mwengolola chikombi na mbali kwa kunja, nambu mkati ntweli unyaghula na uhakau. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Mwanganya mwang'ang'a! Bho, nga Chapanga le joalenganaki kunja, na nde joalenganaki mkati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Nambu mwajangatya bhahochu kwa hindu hinu, na yengi yokapi anaibya wichu kwinu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Nambu anamuchibhonaje Mafalisayo! Maghambu mumboke Chapanga zaka ya nchicha na imbogha yokapi ya mahamba, ngati nabwaka na makolu ghangi ghokapi, nambu nkotoka kubhahenge bhandu mambu ghaaghapala Chapanga, na nkotoka kumpala Chapanga. Ikampaliki kuhenga mambu ghamboni palongi jaka Chapanga na kumpala Chapanga, panga kughaleka ghangi hagha.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Anamuchibhonaje Mwafalisayo! Ndandi mpala kutama itehu ya kutopela mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude, na kulamukiwa kwa utopelu palighulio. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Anamuchibhonaje! Maghambu mbi ngati matengeli ghangakubhonikana, ghaghu bhandu bhajenda panani jaki panga kumanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mbola jumu wa Shelia akupwaghile, “Mbola, paupwagha malobhi ghanihagha, bhelabhela ututondola na tepani.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu akamuyangiki, “Na mwanganya bhabhola bha Shelia, anamuchibhonaje, maghambu mwatweka bhandu ibwahila yeitopike yanga kunyamulika, koni mwabheti ngachenhwatambu hata lukonji kubhajangati kunyamula. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Anamuchibhonaje! Maghambu nchengalela matengeli gha bhalota bhaka Chapanga bhala bhabhakomakiki na akahoko bhinu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Bhela mwanganya mabheti njetakela ghala ghabhakahengiki akahoko bhinu, bhombi bhakabhakomiki bhalota bhaka Chapanga, na mwanganya nchengale matengeli ghabhu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Bhela Chapanga kwa malangu ghaki akapwaghiki, ‘Ananatuma kwabhu bhalota na bhatenga bhangu, nambu bhombi anabhakoma bhakumu bhabhu na bhangi kubhang'aha.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Bhela bhandu bha kibheleku chenjenu bhitemulikaje kwa kupotela kwa bhalota bhokapi bhaka Chapanga bhabhakakomakiki kutumbu kubhombakeka kwa ndema, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>kutumbu kukomakeka kwaka Abeli mbaka kukomakeka kwaka Zakalia, joakomakiki pa chilanda ja chihanja cha nyambiku na Pandu Pahuhu. Ena, chakaka numpwaghila, bhandu bha kibheleku chenjenu bhitemulika kwa kubhakoma bhokapi habha.”<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Anamuchibhonaje mwanganya bhabhola bha Shelia! Maghambu muhiiki ufunguu wa kuhoghule ndyangu wa umanyi, mabhanganya mabheti ngachenjingi na mwahibhali bhandu bhabhajingi ngabhijingila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesu paakabhi abhoka munyumba jaka Mfalifayu jola, bhabhola bha Shelia na Mafalisayo bhakatumbwi kuntumbula kwa kundalukila malobhi ghamahele, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>nahuli bhapata kunkamula kwa chindu chokapi cheayilongilaje.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Lilakalilu panani ja undumila kubheli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Chikahi bhandu bhamaheli pabhakabhi bhalibhongini mbaka kukanyatana, Yesu akatumbwi hoti kupwagha na bhabhulwa bhaki, “Mlilingalya na amila ja undumila kubheli ja Mafalisayo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Njeta lilobhi lelihiyakiki ambalu ngaliyekuliwi, wala lelihiyakiki ambalu ngalimanyikane. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Henu, kila chendongila kulubhendu bhandu anabhaghajowana paunang'anu, na kila chenjojalanya koni njighi milyangu kuchumba, ghitangazwa panani ja unhaghala wa nyumba.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Joapalika kujoghupeka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Numpwaghi, mwanganya mwabhakochi bhangu, ngamwajoghopa bhala bhabhakoma hyegha nambu anabhajomwile ngachebhaweza kuhenga kabheti chindu chokapi kupetalela. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ananundangia jola joapalika kujoghupeka. Munjoghupa jola, ambaju anaakomiki, abhi na uwezu wa kundekela ku motu wa jehanamu. Chakaka numpwaghila, jonihoju nde jumu joapalika kujoghupeka!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Bho, iwebha nhwanu ngacheilombaseka kwa sendi ibhele? Nambu njeta chiwebha hata chimu chechijewakeka palongi jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Kabheti hata majunju gha mimutu jinu ghabhalangiki ghokapi. Ngamwijoghopa, maghambu mabhanganya mpalika nakanopi kupeta iwebha yamahele!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunjetakela na kunkana Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Chakaka numpwaghila, mundu jokapi joanyetakela nepani palongi ja bhandu, Mwana waka Mundu najombi anaanjetakalya palongi ja bhatumika bha kunani bhaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Nambu mundu jokapi joangana palongi ja bhandu, Mwana waka Mundu najombi anaankana palongi ja bhatumika bha kunani bhaka Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Mundu jokapi joandongale lilobhi lihakau Mwana waka Mundu analekakiwaje, nambu mundu jokapi joantondo Roho Mhuhu ngailekakewi ng'o.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Pabhampelaka mwanganya palongi ja nyumba ya kuhimangani Bhayahude, na palongi ja ihongozi, na bhatawala, ngamwijoghopa ntundu momwalikengalyaje panani ja malobhi ghamwilongilaje. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ndandi chikahi chenihechi Roho Mhuhu anaambola chela chempalika kulongela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu waka mwanahindu yamaheli ng'ang'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mundu jumu pa lipogha la bhandu lela akumpwaghi Yesu, “Mbola, umpwaghila ndongu wangu tughabhana upwelelu ghoatuleki atati witu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu akamuyangiki, “Nkoche, bho, nde nane joamekiki nepani kubha mtemula au kubha mundu wa kubhaghabhanaki bhandu hindu yabho?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Yesu akajendali kubhapwaghi bhokapi, “Mulijepa na ntundu wokapi wa kubha na wime! Ndandi hindu ngacheiweza kukengalela womi waka mundu, hata ngati anabhi na hindu yamahele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi ulenganesu ghongo, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu mwanahindu yamaheli joakabhi na ngonda ghoubholalanile ghoupiika mahunu ghamaheli. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Jombi akatumbwi kuholalela mumtima waki, ‘Ngachemi na pandu pa kubheka mahunu ghangu ghokapi. Bho, ndenda bhole?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Akalipwaghi, ‘Anandenda ana, anamombula ugholu wangu na kuchenga ugholu ukolongwa nakanopi. Nanatu anameka monihomu mahunu ghangu ghokapi na hindu yangu yengi.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Bhela ananilipwaghila namwete, ‘Wenga mtima wangu! Sajenu ubhi na hindu yamaheli yambone ya kujaghanila kwa hyaka yamaheli. Upomulyaje, ukulaji, ukunywaji na kuhekalela!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Nambu Chapanga akampwaghile, ‘Ung'ang'a wenga! Lalenu ikilu roho jaku anajitolakikaje, henu bho, hindu yokapi yeulilundakile anaikubha yaka nane?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yesu akajomuli kwa kupwagha, “Ana nde mokubhelile kwaka mundu joalilundaki hindu kwa ndandi jaka mwene, nambu palongi jaka Chapanga ngacheabhalangika kubha na chindu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhobhalya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Kwa ndandi jeniheji numpwaghila, ngamwikubha na choghohi kubhokana na chilebhi chemchipala nahuli mpata kubha bhomi, wala ingobhu yemuipala kwa ndandi ja hyegha yinu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Ndandi womi nde wambone nakanopi kupeta chilebhi, na hyegha nde jambone nakanopi kupeta ingobhu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Mughalingalya makongolu, ngacheghapanda, wala ngacheghahuna, wala ngacheghabhi na ugholu, nambu Chapanga aghaleha! Mwabhanganya mpalika nakanopi kupeta ijuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Bho, nde nane pachilanda jinu, kwa kuhangajika kwaki, aweza kulijonjuke hata lisaa limu nakanopi ja chikahi cha womi wake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ngati ngachemuweza kutenda lijambu lichokopi ngati leniheli, bho, maghambu kiki mng'ahikila mambu ghange? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Ndingalya malobha moghakolela, ngacheghahenga lihengu wala ngacheghaloka. Nambu numpwaghila, hata Nkolongwa Solomoni na hindu yaki yokapi ngacheakawatikwi ingobhu jejiweza kulengana na unyahi wa lilobha limu. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Bhela ngati Chapanga aghawatika mahamba gha mungonda ngati bhenibhela ghaghabhonikana pambani lalenu na chilabhu kutaghakika pamotu. Bho, ngaiwezi kunhwatika mwanganya nakanope? Mwenga mabhandu mwembi na uhobhalelu uchoko!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Bhela ngamwing'ahika mumitima jinu kubha anankula kiki au anankunywa kiki. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ndandi ghanihagha ghokapi bhaghahangajaki bhandu bhokapi bhangakummanya Chapanga. Nambu Atati winu wa kunani kumahunde amanya kubha muipala hindu yeniheyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Nambu mwanganya ndonda hoti Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, najombi anaampekya hindu yeniheyi yokapi.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulibheke hindu yamaheli kunani kumahunde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Ngamwijoghopa, mwenga lipogha lichoku, maghambu Atati winu apaliki kumpeke mwehapa Ukolongwa waki. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Ndombisa hindu yinu na mukabhaghabhila bhahochu mbija yene. Mulibhekila nkoba wanga kulala na mulibhekila chikoku kunani kumahunde, changakuweza kujomoka. Maghambu konihoku bhihi ngachebhaweza kujibha, wala mangeki ngacheghayonanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Maghambu pandu pachibhi chikoku chaku, nde pala pawibya mtima waku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhatumika bhamboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Mulikonga ulamba mwibhunu hinu, na taa yinu ikayakaje. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Mbya ngati bhatumika bhabhundendalela bambo wabhu ahika kuhuma ku ndowa. Nahuli anahikiki na kuhodima bhunhoghulya ndyango. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Mbanga bhatumika bhala, ambabhu bambo wabhu paikelabhukaje anaabhaketanyaje bhabhi mihu! Numpwaghi chakaka, bambo hoju anaalikongaje ulamba muchibhuno, na kubhapwaghila bhatama pahi pachilebhi, na kubhatumakila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Mbanga bhatumika bhala, ambabhu bombo wabhu anaabhahimanyaje bhabhi mihu hata ngati anahiki ikilu pa mahiku au pachibhombu! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Nambu mmanya kubha, ngati mweni nyumba akamanyiki lisaa la kuhika mwihi, akabya atemi mihu, ngaakajilekiki nyumba jaki jibhombuliwaje na mwihi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Nanamu mkubhaje tayali, maghambu Mwana waka Mundu anahika lisaa langakumanyikana.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumika ndongwana na jwangakubha ndongwana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petulu akundaluki Yesu, “Bambo, bho, ulenganesu aghoghu utulongale tepani au bhandu bhokape?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Bambo akamuyangiki, “Bho, henu nde nane joabhi mtumika ndongwana na joabhi na malango? Nde jola ambaju bambo waki ambei kubhajemalela bhatumika bhaki bhangi na kubhapeke chilebhi chabhu kwa chikahi chechipalika. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Apengaliki mtumika jola, ambaju anangati bambo waki akelabhuka anhimani akahenga bhenibhela. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Chakaka numpwaghila, bambo waki anaambeka mtumika jola kubha njemalela wa hindu yaki yokapi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Nambu anangati mtumika jola alipwaghi mweni muntima waki, ‘Bambo wangu anaakabhakya kukelabhuka,’ na bhela kutumbu kubhalapu bhatumika bhajaki, akambomba na akanalomi, najombi akula na kunywa na kulobhela. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Bhela bambo waka mtumika jola anahika lichobha langa kumanyikana na lisaa langa kumanyikana. Na bambo hoju anaanhekata ipandi ibheli na kumbeka papamu na bhandu bhangakuhobhalela.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Mtumika joamanya mambu ghaapala bambo waki ahengaji, nambu alepale kulibheka wichu na kukotoka kuhenga mambu ghaapala bambo jola, mtumika hoju ayilapulika nakanopi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Nambu mtumika jola jwangakumanya mambu ghaapala bambo waki ahengaje, najombi ahenga mambu ghaghapalika kutemulika, mtumika hoju ayipulika pachokopi. Kwa ndandi mundu jokapi joajopali yamaheli ayijopakika yamahele. Na mundu jokapi joajopali yamahele nakanopi, ayijopakika yamahele nakanopi kuhuma kwaki.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nde ndandi ja kulekangana kwa bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Nhikiki kupambaki motu pani pundema, nenga mbala nakanopi kubhona ukabya ujomwi kubhelela! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Nambu mi na ubatizu ghombalika kubatizwa, nanatu anang'ahakika namaa mbaka ubatizu hoghu ujomukaje. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Bho, muhambuki nhikiki kuleta lukwale kwa bhandu pani pundema? Ngabhela! Ngachenhikiki kubhatenda bhandu bhatama kwa lukwale, nambu nhikiki kubhalekanisha bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Maghambu kutumbu sajenu bhandu nhwanu bha nyumba jimu anabhakomanaje, bhatatu kwa bhabheli na bhabheli kwa bhatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Atati anakomana na mwana waki, na mwana anakomana na atati waki. Amabhu anakomana na mwali waki, na mwali anakomana na mabhu waki. Nkowanu anakomana na nhwanu waka mwana waki, na jonihoju anakomana na akowanu waki.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumanya chikahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu akabhapwaghi kabheti bhandu, “Pamughabhona mahundi ghapitalila kuhuma kolijibhi lyobha, panihapa mpwagha, iyula anajitonyaje, na chakaka iyula jitonya. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Chikahi pambona mpongu upogha kuhuma upambala wa kunkachi, panihapa mpwagha kubha anakupyopaje, na kukubha bhenibhela. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Mwanganya mwaka ndumi kubhele! Muweza kulingalila kunani kumahunde na pundema na kupwagha kubha iyula anajitonyaje na lyobha analibhalaje. Bho, ndepale bhole kumanya chikahi chenjenu cha sajenu?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujongana na adui waku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Bho, maghambu kiki mwanganya ngachemuweza kumanya lijambu lambone la kutenda? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ndandi paulongana na mtakila waku kukupeleka pachengu, ukangamala ujongana naku ukabya wakona mwindela. Nanga bhela mtemula anaakupelaka kwa manjolinjoli, na manjolinjoli anabhukubheka muchifungo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nukupwaghila, ngawipiti monihomu mbaka pawijomulya kulepa sendi ja mwisho.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mughalekaje mahoku ghinu au anampotilaje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Chikahi hechi bhandu bhakumu bhakahikite, bhakundandi Yesu panani ja bhandu bha ku Galilaya ambabhu Pilato akabhi abhakomiti chikahi pabhakabhi bhachinja hinyama yabhu kwa ndandi ja nyambiku kwaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Bho muhambuki kubha Bhagalilaya habha bhakakomakiki bhenibhela, maghambu bhombi bhakabhi na mahakau kupeta Bhagalilaya bhangi bhokape? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Chakaka ngabhela! Nambu nanamu nangakung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghinu, bhelabhela nanamu mwiyonangikaje ngati mobhayonangakaki bhombe. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Au bhandu komi na nane bhala bhabhapotili pawahabhukili mnala wa ku Siloamu, bho, muhambuki bhandu bhala bhakabhi bhahakau kupeta bhandu bhokapi bhabhatamika ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Chakaka ngabhela! Nupwaghila nanamu nangakung'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghinu, mabhokapi mwiyonangikaje ngati bhombi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa mkoju wanga kupambika mapambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Yesu akabhapwaghi kabheti ulenganesu agho, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu joakabhi na nkongu wa mtini ghoakaupandiki mungonda waki wa mizabibu. Akahikiki kulonda mapambiku mu nani jaki nambu ngacheapatiki chindu. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Bhela akampwaghi mtumika wa ngonda hoghu, ‘Lingalyaje! Kwa hyaka itatu mili nakahikaje kutongo mapambiku gha nkongu wa mtini aghoghu, panga kupata chokapi chela. Uhekataje! Bho, ndandi ki ujendale kutumi luhombi waka?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Nambu mtumika wa ngonda jola akayangiki, ‘Bambo, uleka kabheti chaka chimu chenu ananukulaghalya munkeghi jaki na kujeghale mbolea. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Ngati anaupambiki mapambiku chaka chechihika, chamboni, nambu nangakupambika, wauhekataje.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mbomba jumu Lichobha Ia Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Mu Lichobha limu la Sabato Yesu akabhi abhola mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Mkati mola kukabhi na mbomba joakakamuliki na lijobhi kwa chikahi cha hyaka komi na nane. Akabhi na chipendi na ngacheawezika kuhatambuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu paakambweni mbomba jola, akandohiki, na kumpwaghila, “We mabhu, chitamu chaku ulamike.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Akabhei mabhoku panani jaki na kundamiha, na palapala akahatambwiki na kundumbali Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Nambu nkolongwa wa nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude, akahakali ndandi Yesu akandamihi mbomba hoju mu Lichobha la Sabato. Bhela akabhapwaghi bhandu bhabhabhi panipala, “Mbi na machobha sita gha kuhenga lihengu, muhika kulamishwa kwa machobha ghanihagha, nambu ngamwihika kulamishwa mu Lichobha la Sabato!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Nambu Bambo akamuyangiki, “Mwanganya mwaka ndumi kubhele! Bho, kubhi na mundu pachilanda jinu joakalepa kubhopo ng'ombi au liponda laki kuhuma mu chindamba kulipeleka kunywa machi, hata ngati lichobha heli nde Lichobha la Sabato? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Mbomba ajoju nde wa lubhelakeku lwaka Ibulahimu, joju akongakiki na Shetani kwa hyaka komi na nane. Bho, nga wichu le kumbopulela mu Lichobha la Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Yesu paakalongi ghanihagha, maadui bhaki bhakaweni hiyoni, nambu bhandu bhangi bhokapi bhakatweli chiheku kwa ndandi ja mambu ghokapi gha kukangacha ghaakahengike.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa imbeju ja haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Bhela Yesu akabhalalukile, “Bho, Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ulengana na kyane? Bho, tulandila kwa indela bhole? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Ulengana na imbeju njoku jejilowakeka haladali jeakatoliki mundu na kupanda mungonda waki. Imbeju jakameliki na kubha nkongu ukolongwa, na ijuni ihika kuchenga mihuwi mu mambandi ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesu akabhalaluki kabheti, “Bho, ananulenganisha na kyane Ukolongwa waka Chapanga? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Ulengana na amila jeatotwi mabhu jumu na kuhangangana papamu na uhembi madebi ghabheli na uwembi wokapi ukatutumwike.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndyangu upepandahu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayo 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu paakabhi ajendale na mwanja waki kujenda ku Yelusalemu, akapeti mu michi na mwijiji koni akabhabhola bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Mundu jumu akundaluki Yesu, “Bambo, bho, bhandu bhachokopi le pe nde bhabhikengalikaje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu akabhayangiki, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Mkangamala mkajingala mkati kupetela ndyangu upepandahu, ndandi chakaka bhandu bhamaheli bhilenga kujingila mkati, nambu ngabhiweze. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Mweni nyumba paijema na kujighila ndyangu, mwanganya mwitama kunja na kutumbu kukong'onda ndyangu mkapwagha, ‘Bambo, utuhogulyaje!’ Na jombi anaampwaghila, ‘Ngachenumanyi muhumiki kwako.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Bhela mwitumbula kumpwaghila, ‘Tepani nde bhala tetukulika na kunywa papamu na wenga, na wenga utubholika mu michi jitu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nambu anaampwaghila kabheti, ‘Ngachemanyi muhuma kwako. Mboka pambane, mabhanganya mwenhwenga mahakau!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Konihoku mwilela na kuyagha mino pamwambona Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo na bhalota bhokapi bhaka Chapanga mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, nambu mwanganya mwibya ndekaliki kunja! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Bhandu bhihika kuhuma kolipita lyobha na kolijibhi lyobha, kungondi na kunkache, na bhombi bhitama pangokelu na kula chilebhi mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Bhela bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi sajenu bha kujomukela bhibya bha kutumbula, na bhabhabhi sajenu bha kutumbula bhibya bha kujomukela.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhalelela bhandu bha muchi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Chikahi chelachela, Mafalisayo bhakumu bhukunjendi Yesu na kumpwaghila, “Ubhoka pandu pambani ujenda pandu pangi, maghambu Helode apala kukukoma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Njenda mukumpwaghila mwanabweha hoju ana, ‘Laleno na chilabhu anandopula majobhi na kalamiha bhatamwa, na pamalabhu ananyomulya lihengu langu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Hata bhela imbalika kujendale na mwanja wangu laleno, chilabhu na pamalabu, ndandi ngacheimpalika mlota waka Chapanga kukomakeka kunja na muchi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Yelusalemu! Mwenga bhandu bha Yelusalemu! Mwenga mwemwakoma bhalota bhaka Chapanga na kubhalapu maganga bhabholu bhaka Chapanga bhabhakatumakiki kwinu! Mala palenga nakapaliki kubhabhongana bhandu bhaku, ngati ingoku mojibhongane ibhana yaki pahi ja mapapanila ghaki, nambu mwanganya ngachemwapalike! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Ndingalya, matamu ghinu anaghahighalya mahame. Numpwaghila, kutumbu sajenu ngamwimoni kabheti mbaka pamwipwagha, ‘Apengalika hoju joahika kwa lihina laka Bambo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha mtamwa mu Lichobha la Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Mu Lichobha limu la Sabato, Yesu akapiti kula chilebhe kunyumba jaka mundu jumu nkolongwa wa Mafalisayo, na bhandu bhabhakabhi panipala bhakabhi bhundingalakila. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Mundu jumu joakabhi na chitamu cha kuhimba hyegha akabhi palongi jaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu akabhalalukili bhabhola bha Shelia na Mafalisayo, “Bho, Shelia jitu le jilaghalaki kundamiha mundu mu Lichobha la Sabato au nga wichu?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Nambu bhombi bhakatemi chinunu. Yesu akamkamwi mtamwa jola, akandamihi na kundeka ajendaje. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Bhela Yesu akabhalaluki bhandu bhala, “Bho, mundu bhole pachilanda jinu anangati mwana waki au ng'ombi jaki anayijibhi muchilibha mu Lichobha la Sabato joayilepa kujenda kwipiya?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Nambu bhombi ngachebhaweziki kumuyanga lilobhi lokapi lela.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulihelea na kubhajangati bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu paabhaweni bhagheni bhabhakokakiki bhala bhahaghu itehu ya kutopela, akabhapwaghi ulenganesu aghoghu, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Chikahi mundu paakukoka pa ukwati, ngawitama pandu pa kutopela. Maghambu pangi pachilanda ja bhabhakokiki kubhi na mundu wa kutopela kukupeta wehapa, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>na anahiki mwenei winu joankokiki mwanganya mabhokapi nhwikaje ayihika na kukupwaghila, ‘Undekila mundu ajoju chitehu hechi.’ Panihapa wipowakika lihamu palongi ja bhandu bhokapi na wijenda kutama kwitehu yanga kutopela. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Nambu anabhukukokiki paukwati, utama kwitehu yanga kutopela, nahuli joankokiki paahikaje akupwaghila ‘Nkochi wangu, uhika utama pani palongi, pandu panyahi nakanopi.’ Panihapa wibya utopile palongi ja bhandu bhokapi bhawitama naku kula chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Maghambu mundu jokapi joalikweha mweni anahelakikaje, na mundu jokapi joaliheleha, anakwehakikaje.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Bhela Yesu akampwaghi mundu joakankokiki jola, “Chikahi pauwandaa uwangalalu wa chilebhe cha muhi au cha pakamihi, ngawakoka bhakochi bhaku au bhalongu bhaku au bhandu bha pambipi au bhana hindu yamahele. Anauhengiki bhenibhela, na bhombi anabhukukoka kumanyumba ghabhu, na wehapa wibya bhakulepiki ngati chewahengile. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Nambu pauhenga uwangalalu wa kula chilebhe, wabhakoka bhahochu, ilema, bhabhatengwiki na akangalola, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>nanaghu wibya upengaliki, maghambu bhandu habha ngachebhabhi na chakukulepa. Chapanga anaakulepa mu lichobha la kuyohakeka kwa bhandu bhambone.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa uwangalalu ukolongwa wa kula chilebhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Jumu wa bhala bhabhakabhi bhakula chilebhe papamu na Yesu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akumpwaghile, “Bhapengaliki bhandu bhokapi bhabhitama kula chilebhe cha uwangalalu mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu akamuyangiki, “Mundu jumu akatendiki uwangalalu ukolongwa wa kula chilebhe na kubhakoka bhandu bhamahele. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Chikahi cha kula chilebhe cha uwangalalu pachahikike, mundu jola akuntumiki mtumika waki akabhalohaje bhabhakokakiki, ‘Muhikaje, kila chindu chibhi wichu!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Nambu bhokapi bhakatumbwi kubhoha ndandi ya kulepa kuhika. Mundu wa kutumbula akumpwaghi mtumika jola, ‘Nhemi ngonda na mbalika nyenda nakulingaje, chondi nganhike.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Mundu jongi akapwaghiki, ‘Nhemi ng'ombi mapongu komi gha kulemela, henu nyenda kwilengesha, chondi nganhike.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Bhelabhela mundu jongi akapwaghiki, ‘Ndotwi mbomba, na bhela nganhike.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Mtumika jola akakelawiki, na kundandi bambo waki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi. Panihapa bambo jola akahakalile na kumpwagii mtumika waki, ‘Ujenda kanyata mwijiji, na mwindela ya muchi, na ukabhaleta bhahochu, ilema, akangalola, na bhabhatengwike na kubhapwaghi bhahikaje.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Palongi pachokope mtumika jola akakelawiki na kupwagha, ‘Bambo, kila chindu kihenghakiki wichu ngati mowalaghalakile, nambu mbekenyu ja kutama bhandu jikale.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Bhela bambo jola akampwaghi mtumika waki, ‘Ujenda mwindela ya muchi na mwijiji na ukabhalazimisha bhandu bhahikaje, nahuli nyumba jangu jitwelalaje. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Maghambu numpwaghila nga mundu nga jumu pachilanda ja bhanakokiki joanahonja chilebhi cha uwangalalu wangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ghaghapalika kwa kubha mbulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Bhela mapogha ghamaheli gha bhandu bhakabhi bhunjengale Yesu, jombi akang'anambwiki na kubhapwaghila bhandu, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Mundu jokapi joanyengale nepani anaabya chakaka mbulwa wangu ngati anaambai nepani kupeta atati na mabhu waki, nhwanu waki na bhana bhaki, bhabheli bhaki na bhalombu bhaki, na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Mundu jokapi jwanga kunyamula msalaba waki na kunyengalela nepani, ngaawezi kubha mbulwa wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>“Bho, mundu bholi pachilanda jinu joapala kuchenga mnala, joailepa kutumbu kutama pahi na kubhalanga mbija yeabhi nayu kwa kuchenga, nahuli amanya ngati abhi na mbija yeilenganela kwa kujomulela? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Kwa kubha ngati anaatumbwi kuchenga luhuli, na kulepale kujomule kuchenga, bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhona cheakihengike bhitenda kunheka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Bhela bhipwagha, ‘Mundu ajoju akatumbwi kuchenga nambu ngacheaweziki kujomulela lihengu laki!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>“Au nkolongwa bholi joajenda kukomana na nkolongwa jongi, jwanga kutumbu kutama pahi, na kuholalela ngati anaweza kwa manjolinjoli bhaki elufu komi kukomana na jola joabhi na manjolinjoli elufu ishiline? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Jombi ngati ngaayiwezi, anaantumila nkolongwa njaki jola ubholu wa kujopa kujongana kwa lukwale koni jongi hoju akabya akali kutali.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yesu akajomuli kwa kupwagha, “Kwa ntundu ghonihoghu, njeta pachilanda jinu joayiweza kubha mbulwa wangu ngati nangakuileka yokapi yeabhi naku.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyu wangakupalika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Mwinyu nde wamboni, nambu mwinyu anauhoiki kunogha kwaki, bho, anaaujeghalika kiki nahuli ukelabhuha kunogha kwaki? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Ngacheupalika kabheti hata kwa kujeghela mungonda wala kuhangaghana na mbolea, nambu bhandu bhaulekela pela. Joabhi na makutu na ajowanaje!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa limbeleli lelihobhiki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Lichobha limu bhajopa kode na bhana mahoku bhamaheli bhakapiti kunjowane Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Nambu Mafalisayo na bhabhola bha Shelia bhakatumbwi kung'ong'uteka bhakapwaghaje, “Mundu ajoju abhakoka bhana mahoku na kula papamu nabhu!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi ulenganesu aghoghu:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Bho, ngati jumu winu anabhi na mambeleli mia moja, anaamanyi limu laki litehi kuhobha aitenda bhole, bho, ngaaghaleki tisini na tisa ghala pandu pa kudimila na kujenda kulilonda lelihobhiki lela mbaka alipataje? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Anaalipatiki, ayihekalya na kulitotola pachilembela chaki, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>na kubhuja nalu kunyumba. Panihapa anaabhalohaje bhakochi bhaki na bhandu bha pambipi jaki, na kubhapwaghila, ‘Muhekalyaje papamu na nepani, maghambu nilipatiki limbeleli langu lelahobhike!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Bhelabhela numpwaghila, kwibya na chiheku kunani kumahunde kwa ndandi jaka mwana mahoku jumu joang'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghaki, kupeta bhandu tisini na tisa bhabhalibhona kubha bhamboni na bhangakupala kughaleka mahoku ghabhu.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa lingengelema lelihobhiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Au tupwagha mbomba jumu abhi na mangengelema kome gha mbija, bho, anahoiki lingengelema limu, aitenda bhole? Anapambakya taa na kupyaghi munyumba na kujilonda wichu mbaka ajipataje. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Jombi anaalipatiki lingengelema heli, anaabhalohaje bhakochi bhaki na bhandu bha pambipi jaki, na kubhapwaghila, ‘Muhekalyaje papamu na nepani, maghambu nilipatiki lingengalema langu limu lelahobhike!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Bhelebhela numpwaghila, bhenibhela nde mobhahekalela nakanopi bhatumika bha kunani kumahunde bhaka Chapanga kwa ndandi jaka muhakau jumu joang'anambuka na kughaleka mahoku ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulengenesu waka mwana joahobhiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu akajendali kubhapwaghila, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu joakabhi na bhana bhabheli bha chikambaku. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Nchoku jola akampwaghi atati waki, ‘Atati, umbekya upwelelu wangu.’ ” Bhela atati akabhaghabhi hindu yaki. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Paghapetiki machobha machokope, nchoku jola akalombisi hindu yaki. Akapiti na mbija yeakapatiki ku inchi ja kutali, konihoku akajitangini mbija yaki kwa matamu gha chijaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Paakajomwi kutumi mbija yaki, kukapitali injala ngolongwa ku inchi jenijela jokape, najombi akahighali panga chindu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Bhela akapiti kujopa lihengu kwaka mundu jumu mwenei wa inchi jenijela, najombi akundaghalaki ajenda kungonda waki kulekeya magholobhi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Jombi akatokuli namaha kula makambati ghala ghaghakulika magholobhi, nambu nga mundu joakampeki chindu cha kula. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Paakatumbwili kupata malangu, akaholali mumtima waki na kupwagha, “Atati wangu abhi na bhatumika bhamahele bhakula na kukileka chilebhe, na nepani mbotela kwa injala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Bhela anamoka kongo na kujenda kwa atati wangu na kampwaghila, ‘Atati, nuntendi mahoku Chapanga na nukutendi mahoku wehapa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Ngachembalika kabheti kulowakeka mwana waku, undenda mya ngati jumu wa bhatumika bhaku.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Bhela akatumbwi mwanja wa kukelabhuka kwa atati waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Nambu paakabhi akali patali pachokopi, atati waki akumbweni, koni mtima waki utweli chiha, akunkembalili mwana waki, akunjobhatili na kumbusu. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwana jola akumpwaghi atati waki, ‘Atati wangu, nuntendi mahoku Chapanga na nukutendi mahoku wehapa. Ngachembalika kabheti kulowakeka mwana waku.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Nambu atati waki akabhapwaghi bhatumika bhaki, “ ‘Kanyata! Ndeta ingobhu jinyahi munhwatikaje. Munhwatika pete mulukonji lwa mumabhoku na magubasi mumagholu ghake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Bhela ndeta litoli lelinenipi na kulichinja, tukulaji na kuhekalela! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ndandi mwana wangu ajoju akabhi apotile, nambu sajenu abhi mwome, akabhi ahobhiki, nambu sajenu abhonakini.’ ” Bhela na bhombi bhakatumbwi kuhekalela papamu.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Uwangalalu pawabhi ujendalela mwana waki nkolongwa akabhi akali kungonda. Paakabhi akelabhuka na kuheghale panyumba, akajowini sauti ja nyembu na bhandu bhakina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Bhela akandohiki mtumika jumu na kundalukila, ‘Bho, kubhi na kyane pambane?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Mtumika jola akamuyangiki, ‘Nnung'una waku akelawiki panyumba, na atati waku achinjiki litole lelinenipi, maghambu mwana waki akelawiki wichu na mwome.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Mbeli waki jola akahakalili na kukana kujingi munyumba. Bhela atati waki akapitiki kunja na kumpembalela ajingala munyumba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Nambu jombi akamuyangiki atati waki, ‘Lingalya! Hyaka yokapi nukutumaki ngati nuntumwa, ngachenhoki amuli yaku hata punkamu. Bho, umbeki kyane? Ngacheumbeki hata likenda la imbuhi jimu nahuli nhekalya na bhakochi bhangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Nambu mwana waku ajoju joapechangini hindu yaku papamu na bhakemi chikahi pe pahikiki unchinjili litoli lelinenipi lela!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Atati waki akamuyangiki, ‘Mwanango, wehapa ubhi na nepani machobha ghokapi, na hindu yokapi yemi nayu nde yako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Nambu itupaliki kutenda uwangalalu na kuhekalela, maghambu nnung'una waku ajoju akabhi apotile, nambu sajenu abhi mwomi, akabhi ahobhike, nambu sajenu abhonakine.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu waka mlonda wanga wambone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki ulenganesu agho, “Pakabhi na mwanahindu yamaheli jumu joakabhi na mlonda wa hindu yaki. Bhandu bhakunchochaki mwanahindu hoju kubha mlonda waki apechangana hindu yaki liyaha. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Bhela mwana hindu jola akunkemiki na kumpwaghila, ‘Bho, hagha malobhi bholi ghanyowana panani jako? Nukujopa ubhalanga hindu yangu yokapi yeujopiki na yeubhohiki, maghambu ngacheupalika kabheti kujendalela kubha wa mlonda wa hindu yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Mlonda jola akaliholalili, ‘Nkolongwa wangu anandopula lihengu la kujemalela. Henu anandenda kike? Ngachemili na makili gha kulemela, na kujenda kujopajopa mona hiyoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Henu nikimanyi chembalika kuchihenga, nahuli anandopuliki lihengu langu, bhandu bhaweza kunyopalela kunyumba jabhu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>“Bhela akabhakemiti bhokapi bhabhadaiwa na bambo waki. Akundaluki wa kutumbula, ‘Bho, bambo wangu akudai mbija ilenga?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Jombi akamuyangiki, ‘Mapipa mia moja gha mahuta gha mizeituni.’ Mlonda jola akumpwaghile, ‘Utola cheti chaku cha lideni, utama pahi na ulemba mapipa hamsini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Bhela akundaluki na jongi, ‘Wenga akudai kike?’ Na jombi akamuyangiki, ‘Magunila mia moja gha ingano.’ Mlonda jola akumpwaghile, ‘Utola cheti chaku cha lideni, na ulemba magunila semanini.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>“Bhela bambo waka mlonda jola akundumbali mlonda muhakau ndandi akahengiki kila chindu kwa kuchenjela. Maghambu bhandu bha pundema pani bhachenjili nakanopi mukuhenga mambu ghabhu kupeta bhandu bha unang'anu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yesu akajendali kupwagha, “Nanatu numpwaghila, ntumila hindu ya pundema pani kwa kulonda bhakochi, nahuli payanjomukya, muweza kujopalewa munyumba ja womi wa mileli. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Jokapi joakubha ndongwana kwa mambu machoku, akubha ndongwana bhelabhela kwa mambu makolongwa, na jokapi jwangakubha ndongwana kwa mambu machoku, bhelabhela ngacheaweza kubha ndongwana kwa mambu makolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Bhela anangati mwanganya ngachemwabhi mwalongwana kwa kujemalela hindu ya pundema pani, bho, nane joaweza kukupekeha yela hindu ya chakaka? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Ngati ngachemwabhi bhalongwana kwa hindu yaka mundu jongi, bho, nane joampekya hindu hinu mabhete?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Njeta mtumika joaweza kubhatumakila mabambo bhabheli, maghambu ananhwakalya jumu na kumpala jongi, au anaakamulana na jumu na kumpoha lihamu jongi. Ngamuwezi kuntumaki Chapanga na kwitumiki mbija kwa papamu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganesu ghangi ghaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Bhela Mafalisayo pabhajowini malobhi ghanihagha, bhakundongimi Yesu, maghambu bhakabhi bhapala mbija. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Mwanganya mulibhona mabhamdu bhamboni palongi ja bhandu, nambu Chapanga ajimanyi mitima jinu. Maghambu chechibhonikana kubha chamboni palongi ja mihu gha bhandu, Chapanga akibhona kubha chihakau.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Shelia na Malembu gha bhalota bhaka Chapanga ghakatangaziki mbaka chikahi chaka Yohana Mbatizaji. Kutumbu panihapa Malobhi Manyahi gha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ghatangizwi, na kila mundu aujingi kwa makili. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Nambu kupepwiki namaa kwa kunani kumahunde na pundema kupeta, kuliku hata chindu chimu kichokope mu Shelia kubhowakeka.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Mwanalomi jokapi joandeka nhwanu waki na kuntogho mbomba jongi, atenda ugone, na jokapi joantogho mbomba joalekini na ndomi waki, atenda ugone.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanahindu yamaheli na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kukabhi na mundu jumu mwanahindu, jonihoju akabhi awata ingobhu ya mbija yamaheli, na kutenda uwangalalu machobha ghokapi. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Bhelabhela kukabhi na mundu jumu kahochu joalowakika Lazalo, joakabhi na hilonda hyegha jokapi, bhakabhi bhundeta palongi ja pundyangu wa nyumba jaka mwanahindu jola. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Jombi akabhi akatokulya kula imbala yeihabhuka kuhuma panani ja meza jaka mwanahindu jola. Hata nakawa ikaikiki kundambalamba mwilonda yaki.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>“Lichobha limu kahochu jola akapotile, na bhatumika bha kunani kwaka Chapanga bhakampeliki mbaka pambipi na Ibulahimu. Na mwanahindu jola akapotile, na kuntagha. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Paakabhi kuwawa, akabhi ang'ahika namaa, akalingiki kunani na kumbona Ibulahimu cha kutali, na Lazalo akabya pambipi jaki. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Bhela akandohiki kwa kujamalila akapwagha, ‘Atati Ibulahimu! Umonila chiha! Untuma Lazalo akajwiha lukonji lwaki mumachi, ahika ahimiya lulimi lwangu, ndandi ning'ahika namaa mu motu ghone!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Nambu Ibulahimu akamuyangiki, ‘Mwanango, ukombuka kubha ujomwi kupata mambu manyahi ghaku chikahi cha womi waku, na Lazalo akapatiki mambu mahakau. Na sajenu Lazalo abhi pambani ahekalela, nambu wenga ung'ahakika. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Papamu na bhela kubhi na libhomba likolongwa pachilanda jitu na mwenga, nahuli bhabhabhi kongone anabhapai kulomboka konihoku ngabhiweza, kabheti bhabhabhi konihoku anabhapai kulomboka na kuhika kongone ngabhiweza.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Bhela mwanahindu akapwaghike, ‘Bhela, atati wangu nukujopa, untuma Lazalo kunyumba ja bhalongu bhangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>kwa ndandi monihomu mi na bhalongu nhwano. Undeka ajenda akabhalakalya nahuli ngabhihika pandu pani pamang'ahiku.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>“Ibulahimu akamuyangike, ‘Bhalongu bhaku bhabhi na Musa na bhalota bhaka Chapanga, waleka bhajowanya bhombe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Mwanahindu akayangike, ‘Ngabhela atati Ibulahimu, nambu ngati mundu anayokiki na kubhajendela, anabhang'anambukaje na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Nambu Ibulahimu akumpwaghile, ‘Ngati ngachebhunjowane Musa na bhalota bhaka Chapanga, ngabhijetakeli hata ngati mundu anahyokike.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Mabholu panani ja mahakau na kulekakela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mako 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Anaipitalya hindu yamaheli yeyampelakya mundu kuhenga mahoku, nambu anaachibhonaje mundu jola joaghatenda ghapitalyaje! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ikabya mbanga mundu hoju akongakika liganga la kuyaghila pahingu na kundeke mu bahali kuliku kuntenda jumu wa bhachoku abhabha atenda mahoku. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Kwa ndandi ajeji mulilendaje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ngati ndongu waku anaakuhokihi, undakalya, na anaang'anambwiki na kukotoka lihoku laki, undekakyaje. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ngati anaakuhoki mala saba pa lichobha limu, na anaakelawiki mala saba na kupwagha, ‘Ng'anambwiki na kughaleka mahoku ghangu,’ upalika undekakyaje.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uhobhalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Mitumi bhaki bhakumpwaghi Bambo, “Utujonjukya uhobhalelu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Bambo akapwaghike, “Ngati uhobhalelu winu ukabhi uchoku hata ngati imbeju njoku ja haladali, mukabya muweziki kuupwaghi nkongu wa mtini aghoghu, ‘Utupukaje, na ukalipanda mubahali,’ nawombi ukabya unjetakile.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ghaka mtumika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Tupwagha jumu winu abhi na mundu joandemela mungonda au kundimila mambeleli ghaki. Muhenga lihengu jola paahika kuhuma kungonda, bho, aweza le kumpwaghi, ‘Uhika kinyata, utama pahi, na ukula chilebhe?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Ngabhela! Jombi anampwaghila, ‘Kutumbula ndelakya chilebhi na undumakya mbaka panijomula kula na kunywa, na panihapa nde uweza kula na kunywa!’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Bho, ngaanchenguli mtumika hoju kwa ndandi ahengiki ghala ghaandaghalakile? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Bhelabhela nanamu ananjomwi kuhenga kila chindu chechumpalika kuhenga, mpwagha, ‘Tepani twa bhatumika pela twanga na nyonjeka, tuhengiki pe ghaghapalika tuhengaje.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamiha bhandu komi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu paakabhi mumwanja wa kujenda ku Yelusalemu, akapetiki mukulindakani mwa muchi wa Samalia na wa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Paakabhi ajingi mu chijiji chimu, akahimangini na bhandu komi bhana malohi. Bhakajemi cha kutali, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>bhakajamalili, bhakapwaghaje, “Yesu! Bambo utubhonila chiha!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu paakabhaweni, akabhapwaghile, “Njenda mkalilangia kwa bhapenganyambiku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Pabhakabhi mwindela bhakajendaje, bhakalamike. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Jumu wabhu paaliweni kubha alamike, akakelawiki kwaka Yesu koni akundumbalya Chapanga kwa kujamalila. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Akalileki pahi palongi ja magholu ghaka Yesu koni akunchengulaje. Mundu jonihoju akabhi Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesu akalalukile, “Bho, nga bhandu komi le bhabhalamike? Bho, tisa bhala bhabhi kwako? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Bho, ngacheabhonakini mundu jongi joakelawiki kundumbali Chapanga nambu ngeni ajoju pela?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Bhela Yesu akumpwaghi mundu jola, “Ujemaje, ujendaje, uhobhalelu waku ukulamihe.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Ukolongwa waka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Chikahi chimu Mafalisayo bhakundaluki Yesu, “Bho, Ukolongwa waka Chapanga anauhika lile?” Yesu akabhayangike, “Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ngacheuhika kwa kubhonikana kwa mihu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Nga jumu joanawezaje kupwagha, ‘Lingalyaje, ubhi pambane, au ubhi pala.’ Chakaka Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ubhi mkati jinu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, “Machobha ghahika pamwitokulya kubhona lichobha limu pa machobha ghaka Mwana waka Mundu, nambu ngamwalibhone. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Bhandu bhampwaghila, ‘Ndingalya abhi kola!’ Au ‘Ndingalya abhi pambane!’ Nambu ngamwibhoka pambile na kubhajengalela. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kwa ndandi ngati unang'anu wa chitobhi moubhonakela kunani na kumulika kutumbula upambala ghumu mbaka upambala ghongi, bhenibhela nde Mwana waka Mundu moayibhonakanya mu lichobha leanahikaje. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Nambu mangani ja mambu ghanihagha ghokapi anaang'ahakika namaa na kukanakika na bhandu bha kibheleku chenu. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Ngati mokwabheli pa machobha ghaka Nuhu, nde mokwibhelila pa machobha gha kuhika kwaka Mwana waka Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Machobha ghanighala bhandu bhakabhi bhakula na kunywa, bhakatoghula na kutoghuleka, mbaka lichobha lela Nuhu paajingala mu sitima ngolongwa jejilowakeka safina. Na panihapa iyula ngolongwa jakatonyiki na kubhakoma bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Kwibya bhenibhela ngati mokwabheli pa machobha ghaka Lutu. Bhandu bhakabhi bhakula na kunywa, bhakalomba na kulombesa, bhakapanda imbeju na kuchenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Nambu lichobha Lutu paakabhokiki ku Sodoma, motu na maganga ghaghabhelela motu ghakahawiki pahi kuhuma kunani kumahunde na kubhakoma bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Bhenibhela nde mokwibhelila lichobha lela Mwana waka Mundu paanahikaje.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Mu Lichobha heli, mundu jokapi joayibya kunani ja nhwaghala ngaayihuluka kujingi munyumba na kutola hindu yaki. Bhelabhela mundu joayibya kungonda ngaikelabhuka kunyumba kutola chindu. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Mkombuka ghala ghaghumpatiki nhwanu waka Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Mundu jokapi joapala kuukengale womi waki, anauhoaje, nambu mundu jola joapala kuuhoa womi waki, anaukengalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Numpwaghila, ikilu heji, bhandu bhabheli bhibya bhaghoni pachitanda chimu, jumu ayitolakikaje na jongi kuhighalila. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Akambomba bhabheli bhibya bhapola mahunu papamu, jumu ayitolakikaje na jongi kuhighalila. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Bhandu bhabheli bhibya kungonda, jumu ayitolakikaje na jongi kuhighalila.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Panihapa bhabhulwa bhaki bhakundalukile, “Bambo, bho, mambu ghanihagha ghitendakika kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu akabhayangiki, “Pandu papibya na ntuhi, panihapa nde payalibhongana ngwahe.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu waka mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi na mtemula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Bhela Yesu akabhalandi bhabhulwa bhaki ulenganesu ghongo kwa kubhabhola kubha bhapalika kundobha Chapanga kila lichobha panga na kutonda. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Akapwaghike, “Ku muchi ghumu kukabhi na mtemula jumu jwangakunjoghopa Chapanga wala ngacheapalika bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Pa muchi ghonighola, kukabhi na mbomba jumu joaweliwi na ndomi joakabhi anjende mtemula jola panga kutonda na kumpwaghila, ‘Chondi, unyemalya mbata chechibhi changu kuhuma kwaka adui wangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Kwa chikahi chilachu mtemula jola akakaniki kunjangatila mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi jola. Nambu palongi akalilaluki mweni, ‘Hata ngati nepani ngachenunjoghopa Chapanga wala ngachenabhapala bhandu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>nambu maghambu mbomba ajoju joaweliwi na ndomi apetali kung'aha ananunjangatya apata chekibhi chaki, nanga bhela anaajendalya kunhikila na kundenda ndondaje!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Bhela Bambo akabhapwaghile, “Njowanya ntundu mtemula muhakau ajo moapwaghile. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Bho, Chapanga le ngaabhakengaleli bhahaghulika bhaki, bhabhundelela ikilu na muhi? Bho, anaakabhakya le kwajangatila? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Numpwaghi mabhanganya, anabhajangatya manyata. Nambu Mwana waka Mundu paanahikaje, bho, anakubya le na uhobhalelu pani pundema?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulengenesu waka Mfalisayo na njopa kode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yesu akalongi kabheti ulenganesu aghoghu kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhala bhabhabhi na makoma na kubhalongale mahakau bhajabhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Lichobha limu bhandu bhabheli bhakapiti kulobha mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga. Jumu akabhi Mfalisayo na jongi akabhi njopa kode.<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>“Mufalisayo jola akajemiki, koni akalobha mumtima waki ana, ‘Nukuchengu wa Chapanga, maghambu nepani ngachemi ngati bhandu bhangi bhokapi bhabhabhi bhanyaghula, bhabhatenda mahakau, na bhabhatenda ugone. Nukuchengu bhelabhela maghambu nepani ngachemi ngati njopa kode ajoju. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Nepani ngonga kula chilebhe machobha ghabheli kwa juma, na moha pandu pa komi pa hindu yangu yokapi yembata.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Nambu njopa kode jola akajemiki cha kutali, najombi ngachealengiki hata kulingali kunani kumahunde, nambu akalilapwilapwi pachihimba kwa kumbina mtima na kupwagha, ‘Wenga wa Chapanga, umonila chiha nepani mwana mahoku!’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Yesu akajendali kupwagha, “Numpwaghila, mundu ajoju njopa kode akabhujiki kunyumba jaki koni akabya ajetakaliwi palongi jaka Chapanga, nambu nga Mfalisayo jola. Maghambu kila mundu joalikweha, anahelalikaje, nambu kila mundu joaliheleha, anakwehakikaje.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhapengale bhana bhachoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Bhandu bhakundeti Yesu bhana bhachoku nahuli abhabhekila mabhoku na kubhapengalela. Bhabhulwa pabhaweni bhenibhela, bhakabhalakali bhandu bhanibhala. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Nambu Yesu akabhakemiki bhana bhahikaje na kupwagha, “Mwaleka bhana bhachoku bhahika kwangu, wala ngamwahibhalila, maghambu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga nde wa bhandu bhabhalengana na bhana. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Chakaka numpwaghila, mundu jokapi jwangakujopalela Ukolongwa waka Chapanga ngati mwana nchoku, ngawezi kujingila mu Ukolongwa hoghu ng'o.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkombu mwanahindu yamaheli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Chiongozi jumu wa Bhayahude akundaluki Yesu, “Mbola Wambone, bho, ndenda bhole nahuli mbata womi wa mileli?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu akandalukile, “Bho maghambu ki unoha nepani wambone? Nga mundu joabhi wambone nambu Chapanga kanjika jaki. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Wimanyi amule: ‘Ngawitenda ugone, ngawikoma, ngawijibha, ngawilonge ichole, wajinika atati waku na mabhu waku.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Jombi akamuyangiki, “Amuli yokapi ayeyi nikamwi kutumbu uchoku wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu paakajowini ghanihagha, akampwaghile, “Ukepakiwi na chindu chimo. Ujenda ukalombisa hindu yokapi yeubhi nayo, na ukabhaghabhila bhahochu mbija heyi, nanaghu wibya ulibheki chikoku kunani kumahunde. Panihapa nde uhika unyengalyaje.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Nambu mundu jola paakajowini malobhi ghanighala, akayomiki namaa kwa ndandi akabhi na hindu yamaheli.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu paakambweni ahakalili nakanopi akapwaghike, “Ntundu bhole mokunonupile kwaka mwanahindu yamaheli kujingi mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kwa ndandi kupepwiki namaa kwa chinyama chekilowakeka ngamia kuholota mulimboghi la sindano kuliku mwanahindu yamaheli kujingi mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Bhandu bhabhajowini malobhi ghanighala bhakalalukile, “Bho, henu nde nane joaweza kukengaleka?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu akayangike, “Mambu ghangakuwezikana kwa bhandu, ghawezikana kwaka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Bhela Petulu akapwaghike, “Lingalya! Tepani tuilekiki hindu yitu yokapi na kukujengale wehapa!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu akamuyangiki, “Chakaka numpwaghila, ngati mundu anaajilekiki nyumba jaki, na nhwanu waki, na bhalongu bhaki, na bhabheleka bhaki, na bhana bhaki kwa ndandi ja Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>anaajopalya ghamaheli nakanopi kwa chikahi cha sajenu, na mu ndema ghouhika ayijopalya womi wa mileli.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela pakatatu panani ja kupotela na kuyoka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu akabhatoliki bhabhulwa bhaki komi na bhabheli punkeghi na kubhapwaghila, “Njowanyaje! Tukwela kujenda ku Yelusalemu, na malembu ghokapi ghaghalembakiki na bhalota bhaka Chapanga panani jaka Mwana waka Mundu anaghapitalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Maghambu anabhunkamula na kumpeleka kwa bhandu bha Mataifa, anabhunhekaje, anabhuntondulaje na kunhuni imata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Anabhundapulaje na kunkoma, nambu lichobha la katatu anaayokaje.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Nambu bhabhulwa bhaki ngachebhamanyi ndandi ja malobhi ghanihagha, maghambu malobhi ghanihagha ghakahiyakiki kwabho, na bhombi ngachebhamanyi ngati Yesu alongalya panani ja kike.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamiha ngalola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesu paakabhi aheghali muchi wa Yeliko, kukabhi na mundu jumu ngalola akatemi punkeghi ja indela akajopaje. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Paakajowini lipogha la bhandu bhakapetaje, akalalukile, “Bho, kubhi na kyane?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Bhakumpwaghile, “Yesu wa ku Nazaleti apeta.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Jombi akajamalili akapwagha, “Yesu! Mwana waka Daude! Umonila chiha!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Bhandu bhabhalonguli bhala bhakundakalili na kumpwaghila atumbalaje. Nambu jombi akajendali kujamalila, akapwagha, “Mwana waka Daude! Umonila chiha!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu akajemiki na kubhalaghalaki bhundeta ngalola jola kwaki. Ngalola jola paakaheghalili pambipi, Yesu akundalukile, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Bho, upala nukuhengila kyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Akayangiki, “Bambo, mbala kubhona kabhate.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu akumpwaghile, “Ubhonaje! Uhobhalelu waku ukulamihe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Palapala ngalola jola akaweziki kulola, na kunjengale Yesu koni akundumbalya Chapanga. Na bhandu bhokapi bhabhaliweni lijambu leniheli, na bhombi bhakundumbali Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu akajingi mu muchi wa Yeliko na kupeta pachilanda ja muchi hoghu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Konikola kukabhi na mundu jumu lihina laki Zakayo, joakabhi nkolongwa wa bhajopa kode, na mwanahindu yamaheli. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Jonihoju akapaliki kumbona Yesu kubha mundu wa ntundu bhole, nambu kwa ndandi akabhi mundu njipi, ngacheaweziki kumbona maghambu bhandu bhakabhi bhamaheli. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Bhela akakembili kubhalongulela bhandu, na kukwela mnani ja nkongu wa mtini nahuli ambona Yesu, maghambu Yesu anahika kwa kupete indela jenijela. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu paakahikiki pandu panipala, akalingali mnani na kumpwaghila, “Zakayo, uhuluka manyata, ndandi laleno imbalika kupilakila munyumba jako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Bhela Zakayo akahulwiki manyata, akahelili na kunjopale kwa chiheku chikolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhabhaghaweni ghanihagha bhakatumbwi kung'ong'uteka bhakapwaghaje, “Apiti kutama kwaka mundu mwana mahoku!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Nambu Zakayo akajemi na kumpwaghi Bambo, “Lingalyaje, Bambo! Ananabhapekya bhahochu nusu ja hindu yangu, na ngati nakatoliki chindu chaka mundu kwa kukolowa, ananunkelabhukya mala pachechi pa chindu chaki.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu akumpwaghile, “Lalenu ukengaleku ujingi mu nyumba moni, kwa ndandi mundu ajoju najombi nde mwana waka Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Kwa ndandi Mwana waka Mundu ahikiki kulonda na kukengalela bhandu bhala bhabhahobhiki.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa bhatumika kome</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Bhandu pabhajowini malobhi ghanihagha, Yesu akajonjuki kupwagha kwa ulenganesu, maghambu akabhi pambipi na muchi wa Yelusalemu, na bhandu bhala bhahambukya kubha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga uhika chikahi chelachela. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Bhela akabhapwaghile, “Kukabhi na mundu jumu wa lukolu lwa kikolongwa joakapiti ku inchi ja kutali nahuli akajopalya ukolongwa na kukelabhuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Bhela paakabhi akona ngakubhoka, akabhalohiki bhatumika bhaki komi na kubhapeke mbija kila jumu wabhu na kubhapwaghila, ‘Muhemala hindu na kulombesa mbaka panikelebhukaje.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Nambu bhandu bha muchi waki bhakatehi kunhakalila, na bhela bhakabhatumiki bhabholu bhajenda bhakapwaghaje, ‘Ngachetumpala mundu ajoju atutawalaje.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Nambu mundu jola akaupatiki ukolongwa na kukelabhuka. Akabhalohiki bhatumika bhala bhaakabhapeki mbija nahuli apata kumanya kila mundu apatiki nyonjeka bhole. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Mtumika wa kutumbula akahikiki na kupwagha, ‘Bambo, mbatiki nyonjeka komi yengi ya mbija yewambekie.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Jombi akumpwaghile, ‘Uhengiki wichu, wenga wantumika wambone! Maghambu ukabhi undongwana kwa chindu kichoku, nukubheka ubya unkolongwa wa michi komi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Mtumika wa kabheli akahikiki na kupwagha, ‘Bambo, mbatiki nyonjeka nhwanu nakanopi kwa mbija jewambekie.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Jombi akampwaghile, ‘Na wenga bhelabhela nukubheka ubya unkolongwa wa michi nhwano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>“Mtumika wa katatu akahikiki na kupwagha, ‘Bambo, jenje nde mbija jaku, jenakajihiiki wichu mu chitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Nukujoghupa wehapa, maghambu wa mundu unkale. Wenga wa mundu we utola yangakubha yaku na kuhuna yangakupanda.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Bambo waki akampwaghile, ‘Wehapa wa mtumika muhakao! Nukutemula kubhokana na malobhi ghaku! Wamanyiki kubha nepani na mundu nunkali, nendola hindu yangu na kuhuna yangakupanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Bho, maghambu ja kyane ngachewabhei mbija jangu kubenki, nahuli lichobha la kukelebhuka kwangu nakapata mbija jangu papamu na nyonjeka jake?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>“Bhela akabhapwaghi bhabhajemi pambipi, ‘Munyaghula mbija heji kuhuma kwaki na mukumpekya jola joapatiki nyonjokela komi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Bhombi bhakumpwaghile, ‘Nambu Bambo, jonihoju abhi nayu tayale nyonjeka komi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Jombi akayangiki, ‘Kila mundu joabhi na chindu anajonjukiwa chengi, nambu mundu jwangakubha na chindu ananyaghulika hata kichokopi cheabhi naku. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Henu kwa bhala maadui bhangu, bhangakupala nepani mya nunkolongwa wabhu, mwabhaleta pambani, na mwakoma palongi jangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajingila ku Yelusalemu kwa chiheku chikolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu paakajomwi kulonge malobhi ghanihagha, akabhalonguli palongi jabhu na kujenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Paakaheghali kuhika ku Besifage na ku Besania pambipi na Chitombi cha Mizeituni, Yesu akabhatumiki bhabheli pachilanda ja bhabhulwa bhaki, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>na kubhapwaghila, “Njendanya ku chijiji chela chemukibhona, pamkahika konikola mkalihimanya liponda likongakiki na njeta mundu joalabhali kujendela. Mukalibhopula na kulileta pambane.<figure style="fig" alt="The child of a donkey" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwana wa liponda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ngati mundu anaandalukile, ‘Maghambu ki mulibhopo liponda heli?’ Mumpwaghila, ‘Bambo alipala.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Bhela bhala bhabhatumakiki kujenda bhakahimani kila chindu kibhi ngati Yesu moakapwaghile. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Pabhakabhi bhalibhopo liponda lela, bheni labhu bhakabhalalukile, “Ndandi ki mulibhopo liponda heli?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bhakayangiki, “Bambo alipala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Bhela bhakalipeliki kwaka Yesu liponda lela, na bhandu bhakatandiki ingobhu yabhu pangongu wa liponda na kunkwea Yesu panani jaki. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Paakabhi ajendalela na mwanja, bhandu bhakatandiki ingobhu yabhu mwindela.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Paakabhi pambipi na muchi wa Yelusalemu, punhelelu wa Chitombi cha Mizeituni, lipogha lokapi la bhabhulwa bhakahekalili na kundumbali Chapanga kwa kujamalila, kwa ndandi ja ngangachu yokapi yebhiwene. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Bhakapwaghaje, “Apengalikaje Nkolongwa joahika kwa lihina laka Bambo! Lukwali kunani kumahunde na ulumbalilu kunani nakanope!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Bhela Mafalisayo bhangi bhabhakabhi panipala papamu na lipogha la bhandu lela bhakumpwaghi Yesu, “Mbola, ubhalakalyaje bhabhulwa bhaku bhatumbalaje!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu akabhayangike, “Numpwaghi mabhanganya, anangati bhandu abhabha anabhatumbile, maganga aghagha anaghajamalyaje.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aulelela muchi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesu paakaheghali ku Yelusalemu na kuubhona muchi, akaulelile, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>akapwaghaje, “Ngati wenga ukamanyiki lalenu mambu ghaghaleta lukwali! Nambu sajenu mambu hagha ghahiyakika pamihu jaku. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Maghambu machobha ghahika maadui bhaku pabhichenga lumatu, anabhukuyongalutaje, na kukuhinya ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Pabhakuyagha wenga papamu na bhana bhaku mu lumatu lwaku. Ngabhakulekeli hata lighanga limu panani ja lengi, maghambu ngachewamanyi chikahi Chapanga paakahiki kukukengalela!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajenda pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Bhela Yesu akapiti pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga na kutumbu kubhapiha kunja bhabhahemela na kulombesa. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Jombi akabhapwaghile, “Ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Nyumba jangu anajibya nyumba ja malobhu.’ Nambu mwanganya mujibhei kubha likolu la bhanyaghula!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yesu akabhi abhola kila lichobha pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga. Nambu bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa, bhabhola bha Shelia papamu na bhakolongwa bha bhandu bhakalondiki indela ja kunkoma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>nambu ngachebhapatiki indela ja kunkoma, maghambu bhandu bhokapi bhakabhi bhunjowanela kwa wichu nakanopi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Lilalukilu panani ja lujiniku lwaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Lichobha limu Yesu akabhi pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga, akabhatangazya bhandu Malobhi Manyahi. Bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhabhola bha Shelia papamu na bhakolongwa bha bhandu bhakunhikile, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>na kundalukila, “Utupwaghilaje! Bho, uhenga mambu ghanihagha kwa lujiniku lwaka nane? Na bho, nane joakupeki lujiniku loniholo?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Na nenga ananundalukya lilaluki limu. Mbwaghilaje, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>bho, ubatizu waka Yohana ukahumiki kwaka Chapanga au kwa bhandu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Nambu bhombi bhakapwaghani ana, “Anatupwaghiki ukahumiki kwaka Chapanga, anaatulalukya, ‘Bho, mbona ngachemunhobhalile Yohana?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Nambu anatupwaghiki, ‘Ukahumiki kwa bhandu,’ bhandu bhokapi anabhutulapula maganga, maghambu bhokapi bhahobhalela kubha Yohana akabhi nde mlota waka Chapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Bhela bhakumpwaghile, “Ngachetumanyi ukahumiki kwako.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Hata nenga nganumpwaghi kubha ndenda mambu ghangane kwa lujiniku lwaka nane.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa ngonda wa mizabibu na bhalemi bhahakau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yesu akajendali kubhapwaghi bhandu ulenganesu agho, “Mundu jumu akapandiki ngonda wa mizabibu. Akabhajahiki bhalemi ngonda ghola, na kutumbu mwanja wa kujenda ku inchi jengi na kutama konihoku kwa chikahi chilachu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Chikahi cha mahunu pachahikili, akuntumiki mtumwa waki kwa bhalemi bhala, nahuli akatola pandu pa mahunu gha mizabibu. Nambu bhalemi bhakundapwi mtumwa jola na kunkelebhu mabhoku matopu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Mweni ngonda jola akuntumiki mtumwa jongi, nambu jonihoju najombi bhelabhela bhakundapwili na kuntende mambu gha iyoni, na kunkelabhu mabhoku matopu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Akumtumiki kabheti mtumika wa katatu, jonihoju najombi, bhakumpotiki na kuntopola. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Bhela mweni ngonda jola akapwaghike, ‘Bho, anandenda bhole? Ananuntuma mwana wangu jonumpalike, pangi anabhuntopilaje jombi.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Nambu bhalemi bhala pabhumbweni akahikaje, bhakapwaghanile, ‘Ajoju nde mpwelelu wa ngonda. Bhela tunkomaje nahuli upwelelu waki ubya witu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Bhela bhakunkamwili na kumpiha kunja ja ngonda wa mizabibu na kunkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu akalalukile, “Bho, mweni ngonda anaabhatenda kyani bhalemi bhanihabha? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Anahika na kubhakoma bhalemi habha, na kubhapeke bhalemi bhangi ngonda wa mizabibu hoghu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Bhandu pabhajowini ulenganesu hoghu, bhakapwaghike, “Ngabhela! Chapanga ajepisha kutali mambu ghanihagha ngaghipitalila.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Nambu Yesu akabhalingalakili na kubhalalukila, “Bho, Malembu hagha ndandi jaki kike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Lighanga lebhalikaniki bhachenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">sajenu libhi lighanga likolongwa lelipalika nakanopi.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Mundu jokapi joanahabhuka panani ja lighanga heli, anatunyukana ipandi ipandi, na mundu jolanhwabhukya lighanga heli, analunhyagha nakanope.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kode kwaka Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Bhabhola bha Shelia na bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa bhakapaliki kunkamu Yesu palapala, maghambu bhakamanyi kubha ulenganesu hoghu walongale bhombe, nambu bhabhajoghupa bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Bhela bhakatumbwi kunjobhale Yesu, bhakabhatumiki bhandu bhakopunganya kubha bhamboni nahuli bhunkamula Yesu kwa malobhi ghaki, nahuli bhumpeleka kwaka nkolongwa wa inchi ja ku Loma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Bhandu bhala bhakundaluki Yesu, “Mbola, tumanyi kubha ulongela na kubhola malobhi gha chakaka. Bhelabhela wehapa ngacheulingali lujiniku lwaka mundu, nambu ubhola indela ja chakaka ngati Chapanga moapali bhandu tutamaje. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tupwaghilaje, bho, wichu le kwitu tepani kulepa kode kwaka Kaisali au ngatwilepa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Nambu Yesu akaumanyi uhakau wabhu, akabhapwaghile, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Mnangiya lingengelema la mbija. Bho, jibhi na sula na lihina laka nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Na bhombi bhakayangiki, “Jaka Kaisali.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Bhela mumpekya Kaisali, yeibhi yaki Kaisali, na mumpekya Chapanga yeibhi yaki Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Bhela bhandu bhala ngachebhaweziki kunkamula kwa chela cheakalongi palongi ja bhandu, nambu bhakakangichi na liyangu laki, na bhombi bhakatumbile.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilalukilu panani ja kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Masadukayo bhakumu, bhabhapwagha kubha bhakuwa ngabhiyoki, bhakunjendi Yesu na kundalukila, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Mbola, Musa akatulaghalaki ana, ‘Ngati ndongu waka mundu anapotili na kundeka nhwanu waki panga mwana, ndongu waki apalika antoghula mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi jola nahuli ambelakya bhana ndongu waki joapoti jola.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Bhela kukabhi na bhalongu saba, wa kutumbula akatowili na kupotela panga kupata bhana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Ndongu wa kabhele akuntowi joaweliwi na ndomi jola, najombi akapotoli panga kupata bhana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>na ndongu wa katatu najombi kukabhi bhelabhela. Mambu ghakabhi ghalaghala kwa bhokapi saba na bhokapi bhakapotili panga kubhaleka bhana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Pakujomukela jaki mbomba jola akapotile. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Henu palichobha bhakuwa pabhiyokaje, mbomba jonihoju anabya nhwanu waka nane? Maghambu bhokapi saba bhakabhi bhuntowile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu akabhayangike, “Bhandu bha pundema pani bhatoghola na kutoghuleka. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Nambu kwa bhala ambabhu Chapanga abhabhona kubha bhapalika kuyoka na kubha bhomi pa ndema ghouhika, ngabhitogholi wala kutoghuleka. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Kutumbu panihapa ngabhikuwi kabhete. Maghambu bhibya ngati bhatumika bha kunani kumahunde bhaka Chapanga. Na bhombi nde bhana bhaka Chapanga, maghambu bhatehi kuyohakeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Nambu kupwagha kubha bhakuwa bhiyokaje, hata Musa akalangi hotuhotu mu Malembu Mahuhu panani ja lijambu leniheli, kubhokana na kihole chekibhelala motu. Jombi andongale Bambo kubha ngati nde, ‘Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka Isaka na Chapanga waka Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Jombi nga Chapanga wa bhabhawile, nambu jombi nde Chapanga wa bhabhabhi bhome, maghambu kwaki jombi bhokapi bhakubha bhome.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Bhabhola bhakumu bha Shelia bhakapwaghike, “Mbola, uyangiki wichu!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Nga mundu joakalengiki kabheti kundaluki malobhi ghange.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristo Mwana waka nane?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu akajendali kubhapwaghila, “Bho, kubhi bholi bhandu bhapwagha kubha Kristo nde Mwana waka Daude? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Daude mweni akapwaghiki mu chitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Bambo akumpwaghi Bambo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Utama upambala wangu wa kumalelelu,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>mbaka panabhabheka maadui bhaku pahi ja magholu ghaku.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Ngati Daude akandohiki Kristo ‘Bambo,’ henu ayibya bho mwana wake?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhalakalila bhabhola bha Shelia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Bhandu bhokapi pabhakabhi bhunjowanela, Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Mulijepa na bhabhola bha Shelia bhabhapala kujenda koni bhakabya bhawati ingobhu ilachu na kupala kulamukiwa na bhandu kwa kutopela paligulio, bhelabhela bhapala kutama kwitehu ya kutopela mu nyumba ja kuhimangani Bhayahude na pandu pakutopela pa uwangalalu wa chilebhe. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Bhakula mu nyumba ya bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhu, na kwa undumila kubheli bhalobha malobhu malachu. Bhanganya bhanihabha bhitemuliwa nakanopi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Nhupu jaka mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mako 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu akabhalingali na kubhabhona bhandu bhanahindu yamaheli bhakabheka nhupu yabhu mu chikoku cha pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Bhelabhela akumbweni kabheti mbomba jumu kahochu joaweliwi na ndomi akajeghala sendi ibheli ichoku mu chikoku mola. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Yesu akapwaghike, “Chakaka numpwaghila, mabhu ajoju kahochu joaweliwi na ndomi ajeghi nakanopi kupeta bhandu bhangi bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Kwa ndandi bhandu bhangi bhokapi bhabhekiki nhupu yabhu kubhokana na kujoloka kwa hindu yabhu, nambu mabhu ajoju papamu najombi kubha kahochu, abhohiki kila chindu cheabhi nanchu kwa ndandi ja matamu ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongale kuyonangeka kwa Nyumba jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Bhabhulwa bhakumu bhaka Yesu bhakabhi bhalongelongela panani ja Nyumba jaka Chapanga, bhakapwaghaje panani ja machengu ghaki manyahi gha maganga na kwa hindu yengi inyahi bhandu yebhakabhohiki nhupu kwaka Chapanga. Nambu Yesu akapwaghike, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Mambu aghagha ghamughabona, chikahi anachihikaje ambapu njeta liganga hata limu leanalihighalya panani ja liganga lengi, kila limu analibombuliwaje.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulagha na mang'ahiku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bhandu bhakundaluki Yesu, “Mbola, bho, mambu ghanihagha ghaulongile ghibya lile? Bho, nginyulila bholi yeilangia kubha mambu ghanihagha ghabhi pambipi kupitalila?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Mulilingalya wichu ngamwikoluweka. Bhandu bhamaheli anabhahikaje bhakaliloha kwa lihina langu, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Nepani nde Kristo, na kubha chikahi hechi chiheghalile.’ Nambu mwanganya ngamwajengalela. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Pamwijowana mambu gha ngondu na fujo, ngamwijoghopa, maghambu ipalika ghanihagha kupitalila hoti nambu ujomukelu wibya wakale.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Bhela Yesu akajendali kupwagha, “Bhandu bha inchi jimu anabhakomana na bhandu bha inchi najengi, na ukolongwa ghumu wikomana na ukolongwa ghongi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Anakubya na chinyukunyuku chikolongwa cha ndema pandu patalipatali, injala ngolongwa na hitamu ya kujambukila pandu pokapi. Kubhoke panihapa kwibya na mambu gha kujoghoha na nginyulila ngolongwa kuhuma kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Nambu mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ghakabya ghakona nga kupitalila, bhankamula na kung'aha. Bhampelaka munyumba ya kuhimangani Bhayahude na kunjeghe muchifungo, bhelabhela anabhumpelaka palongi ja bhakolongwa na bhatawala kwa ndandi ja lihina langu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Kupetela ghanihagha mwabhatangazya Malobhi Manyahi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Nambu ngamwijoghopa mu mitima jinu ntundu momwilongalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Maghambu nepani ananumpekya malobhi gha kulongela na mbulau. Hata maadui bhinu ngabhiwezi kughapenga wala kughakana. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Nanamu anankanakika hata na bhabheleka bhinu, na bhalongu bhinu, na bhakochi bhinu na bhandu bha pambipi jinu, na bhangi bhinu mwitenda kukomakeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Bhandu bhokapi anabhunhwakalya kwa ndandi ja lihina langu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Nambu njeta hata lijunju limu la mimutu jinu lelihobhaje. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Kwa kuhinakila kwinu anankengalya roho hinu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongale kuyonangeka kwa muchi wa Yelulusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mako 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Chikahi pamwibhona bhandu bha muchi wa Yelusalemu bhayongalwitwi na manjolinjoli, mmanya kubha kuyonangeka kwabhu kuheghalile. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Panihapa bhandu bhabhabhi ku Yudea bhatilila ku itombi, na bhandu bhala bhabhabhi mu muchi bhatilila kunja ja muchi, na bhandu bhala bhabhabhi kumighonda ngabhikelabhuka kumuchi. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Maghambu machobha hagha ghibya ‘Machobha gha Utemulo,’ nahuli mambu ghokapi ghaghalembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu ghapitalyaje. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Anabhachibhonaje bhana hitumbu na bhabhajongeya mu machobha ghanihagha! Maghambu kwibya na ulale pundema na Chapanga ayilangiya inyela yaki kwa bhandu bha ndema ghoni. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Bhangi bhikomakika kwa lipanga, bhangi bhitolakika kubha bhakongeka ku inchi yokapi, bhelabhela bhandu bhangakubha Bhayahude anabhakanyata muchi wa Yelusalemu mbaka chikahi chabhu pachijomukaje.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwaka Mwana waka Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Bhela kwibya na nginyulila ku lyobha, na mwehi, na ndondwa. Bhandu bha pundema bhibya na mang'ahiku kwa ndandi ja choghohi cha kubuluma kwa bahali na majegha ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Bhandu bhizimiya kwa ndandi ja choghohi, bhakalendalya mambu ghaghihika pundema wokapi, maghambu hindu ya kunani hinyuhakikaje. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Panihapa nde pamwambona Mwana waka Mundu ahika mu mahundi, kwa makili makolongwa na ulumbalilu ukolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Mambu ghanihagha paghitumbula kupitalila, nchenjalaje. Njinula mimutu jinu kunani, maghambu kukombulewa kwinu kuheghalile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulenganesu wa nkongu wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi bhabhulwa bhaki ulenganesu aghoghu, “Ndingalya nkongu wa mtini na mikongu jengi jokapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Pambona kubha mahamba ghaki ghatumbu kutundulila, mmanya kubha chikahi cha mahunu chiheghalile. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Bhelabhela, pamwibhona mambu ghanumpwaghi hagha ghapitalila, mmanya kubha Ukolongwa waka Chapanga uheghalile.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Chakaka numpwaghila, bhandu bha kibheleku chenjenu ngachipeti panga mambu ghanihagha kupitalila. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Kunani na pundema anaipetaje, nambu malobhi ghangu ngaghipeti ng'o.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ipalika kubha mihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Mulilenda wichu, mu mitima jinu ngajihika kulepale na kula liyaha, kulobhela na kung'ahika kwa ndandi ja matamu ghani, ngati nga bhela lichobha heli lanhikila ngati chitabha. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Kwa ndandi lichobha heli analibhahikila ghafula bhandu bhokapi bhabhatama pani pundema wokapi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Bhela mbya mihu chikahi chokapi, mkalobhaje, nahuli mpata makili gha kujepangana na mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ghaghipitalyaje, nanamu mpata kuweza kujema palongi jaka Mwana waka Mundu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Machobha ghokapi hagha muhi, Yesu akabhi abhola pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na ikilu akabhi ajenda ku Chitombi cha Mizeituni na kutama konihoku. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhakabhi bhajumuka palukela na kujenda kunjowanela Yesu pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Mpangu wa kunkamu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Chikahi cha uwangalalu wa kula mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, jejilowakeka Uwangalalu wa Pasaka, ukabhi uheghalile. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhabhola bha Shelia bhakabhi bhalonda indela ja kunkoma Yesu, nambu bhakabhajowipi bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ajetakela kung'anambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Bhela Shetani akunjingi Yuda, joalowakika Isikalioti, joakabhi jumu wa bhabhulwa komi na bhabheli. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Bhela Yuda akapiti kulongela nabhu bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhalonda bha Nyumba jaka Chapanga ntundu moang'anambukya Yesu kwabhu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bhakahekalili namaa na bhakajongini na Yuda kubha anabhumpekya mbija. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda akajetakili na kutumbu kulonda mbekenyu jinyahi ja kung'anambuka Yesu kwabho, pandu ambapu njeta lipogha la bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aliandaa kula chilebhi cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Bhela lichobha la uwangalalu wa Mabumunda Ghangakujeghaleka Amila lakahikike, leniheli nde lichobha lelipalika mwanambeleli wa Pasaka kuchinjakika. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Bhela Yesu akabhatumiki Petulu na Yohana na kubhapwaghila, “Njendanya mkatuandalya chilebhi nahuli tukula Pasaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bhombi bhakundalukile, “Bho, upala tukakuandalya kwako?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yesu akabhayangiki, “Pamkajingala ku muchi, mkahimangana na mwanalomi joanyamwi chihulu cha machi. Mukunjengalyaje mbaka mu nyumba jeakajingalaje. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Mukumpwaghila mweni nyumba, ‘Mbola akulalukila, bho, kibhi kwa chumba cha bhagheni chenikula chilebhi cha Pasaka papamu na bhabhulwa bhango?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Jombi anandangiya chumba chikolongwa cha kugholofa chekijomwi kubhekakeka wichu. Monihomu nde mkatuandalya chilebhe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Bhakapiti na kukihimani kila chindu kibhi wichu ngati Yesu moakapwaghile, na bhombi bhakaandi chilebhi cha Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chilebhi chaka Bambo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bhakolinso 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Chikahi pachahikaje, Yesu akatemi pahi, na kula chilebhi papamu na mitumi bhaki. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Akabhapwaghile, “Ndokuli namaa kula chilebhi chenu cha Pasaka papamu na mwenga mangane ja kung'ahika kwangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Chakaka numpwaghila, nganikuli kabheti chilebhi chenu cha Pasaka mbaka pajipitalya mu Ukolongwa waka Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Bhela Yesu akachitoi chikombi cha divai, na kuchipengalela akapwagha, “Mtola chenjenu na ngabhana mabhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Maghambu numpwaghila kutumbu sajenu ngangunywi kabheti divai jenu mbaka Ukolongwa waka Chapanga pawihikaje.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Kabheti akatohi libumunda, akunchengwi Chapanga, akalihekiti, na kubhapekeha, akapwaghaje, “Jenjenu nde hyegha jangu, jempatiki mwenga. Ntenda anana kwa kungomboka nepani.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Bhelabhela paakajomwi kula chilebhi cha pakamihi akachitoi chikombi cha divai na kupwagha, “Chikombi chenjenu nde lulaghilu lwahenu lwaka Chapanga lolusibitishwa kwa mwahi wangu, ghoujitika kwa ndandi jinu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Nambu, ndingalyaje! Jola joaying'anambukaje akula chilebhi papamu na nepani. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Maghambu Mwana waka Mundu anaapotilaje ngati moapangi Chapanga, nambu anaachibhonaje mundu jola joang'anambukaje!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Bhela bhakatumbwi kulaluhana bheni kwa bheni kubha nde nane pachilanda jabhu joanahenga lijambu leniheli.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulochana panani ja ukolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Kukapitali kulochana kwa bhabhulwa kubhokana na nde nane joaholaleka kubha anaabya nkolongwa pachilanda jabhu kupeta bhangi bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Bhakolongwa bha bhandu bhanga Bhayahude bhabhajemale bhandu bhabhu kwa makile, na bhala bhabhabhi na lujiniku panani jabhu bhaliloha, ‘Bhakochi bha bhandu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Nambu ngakwikubha bhenibhela kwinu mabhanganya. Nambu jola joabhi nkolongwa pachilanda jinu, impalika abya ngati nchoku wa bhokapi, na joabhi chiongozi impalika abya ngati mtumika. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Bho, nane joabhi nkolongwa? Bho, jola joatama kula chilebhhi, au jola joabhatumakila? Chakaka nde jola joatama kula chilebhi. Nambu nepani mili pambane pachilanda jinu ngati mtumika.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Mwenga nde mwemwahighali na nepani chikahi chokapi cha kulengakeka kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>nepani numpekihi mwehapa ukolongwa, ngati Atati wangu moambeki nepani kubha nunkolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Nahuli mpata kula na kunywa pa meza jangu mu Ukolongwa wangu na kutama mu itehu ya kikolongwa kughatemula makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alota ngati Petulu anaankanaje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yesu akapwaghiki, “Simoni, Simoni! Ujowanyaje! Shetani apala kumpeta mwehapa ngati ingano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Nambu nepani nukulobhi wehapa wa Simoni, nahuli uhobhalelu waku ngawikepa, na wenga pawikelebhuka kwangu kabheti, wajangatya bhalongu bhaku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Petulu akamuyangiki, “Bambo, nepani nyetaki kujenda papamu na wehapa muchifungo, na hata kupotela!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu akamuyangiki, “Nukumpwaghi wehapa wa Petulu, lalenu mangane ja likongobhi kubheka wibya unganiki mala patatu kubha ngacheunimanye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbija, mfuku na lipanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Bhela Yesu akabhalaluki bhabhulwa bhaki, “Panuntumiki panga mbija, wala nkoba, na wala magubasi, bho, mkakepakiwi na chindu bhole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bhakayangiki, “Ngachetwakepakiwi na chindu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Nambu henu, jola joabhi na mfuku wa mbija autolaje, na joabhi na nkoba autola bhelabhela. Na jokapi jwanga lipanga, alombisa ingobhu jaki na ahemala limu. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Maghambu numpwaghila, ipalika malobhi aghagha ghapitalya kwangu ngati moghalembakike mu Malembu Mahuhu, ‘Jombi akabhalangiki papamu na bhahenga mahakau.’ Chakaka ghala ghaghapalika kwangu ghapalika ghapitalyaje.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Bhabhulwa bhakapwaghike, “Bambo! Lingalyaje, pambani ghabhi mapanga ghabhele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Jombi akayangike, “Base iyaghanila.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andobha Chapanga ku Chitombi cha Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu akabhokiki na kujenda ku Chitombi cha Mizeituni ngati mowabheli ntetu waki, na bhabhulwa bhaki bhakapiti papamu naku. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Paakahiki pandu panipala, akabhapwaghile, “Ndobhaje nahuli ngamwijingi mu malengakeku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Bhela mweni akabhokiki na kujenda pandu pa kuweza mundu kuleke liganga. Akachikimi, na kulobha, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>akapwagha, “Atati, ngati anaupaliki, nukujopa umokiya kutali chikombi cha mang'ahiku. Ngakwikubha ngati mombali nepani, nambu kubya ngati moupali wehapa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Panihapa mtumika kuhuma kunani kwaka Chapanga akampitalili na kunjeghe makili. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Yesu akabhi mu mabhinilu makolongwa, akajonjuki kulobha nakanopi, na lihoghatela laki lakabhi ngati mandonyi gha mwahi, lelikaheli mbaka paluhombi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Paakajomwi kulobha akakelawiki kwa bhabhulwa bhaki, akabhahimani bhaghochile, maghambu bhakabhi na huzune. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Akabhapwaghile, “Bho, mbona ngochile? Njumukaje na ndobhaje, nahuli ngamwijingi mu malengakeku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akamulika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesu paakabhi akali kulongela, lipogha la bhandu lakahikiki koni akalilonguwa Yuda, jumu wa bhabhulwa komi na bhabheli. Yuda akunjendi Yesu na kumbusu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Nambu Yesu akundalukile, “Yuda! Bho, ung'anambuka Mwana waka Mundu kwa kumbusu?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Bhabhulwa bhaka Yesu pabhaghaweni mambu ghaghipitalyaje bhakapwaghike, “Bambo, bho, twahekata le kwa mapanga?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Jumu wabhu akundapwi lipanga mtumika waka Mpenganyambiku Nkolongwa, na kunchekula likutu laki la kumalelelu.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Nambu Yesu akapwaghike, “Nkotukaje, ngamwihenga kabhete!” Akalikamwi likutu laka mundu jola na kundamiha.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghi bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa, na bhalonda bhakolongwa bha Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na bhazee bhabhahiki kunkamula, “Bho, muhikiki na mapanga na indonga kungamula ngati nepani nde mnyaghula? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Machobha ghokapi nakabhi na mwehapa pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na ngachemwangamwile. Nambu sajenu nde chikahi chinu, cha makili gha lubhendu kutawala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mako 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Bhela bhakunkamwi Yesu, na kumpeleka kunyumba jaka Mpenganyambiku Nkolongwa. Nambu Petulu akabhi anjengale cha kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Bhandu bhangi bhakapuliki motu pachilanda ja liwangala na kutama, na Petulu akahiki kunyatuki motu papamu nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Mtumika jumu wa chimbomba paambweni Petulu atami pambipi na motu, akundingalaki namaa na kupwagha, “Mundu ajoju najombi akabhi papamu na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Nambu Petulu akakaniki, akapwagha, “Mbomba, nepani ngachenummanyi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Palongi pachokope, mundu jongi akumbweni Petulu na kumpwaghila, “Wehapa nanau wa jumu wabho!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Nambu Petulu akayangike, “We mundu, nepani nga jumu wabho!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Palapetiki lisaa limu, mundu jongi akajomalaki kwa kupwagha, “Chakaka mundu ajoju akabhi papamu naku, maghambu najombi nde mwenei wa ku Galilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Nambu Petulu akapwaghike, “We mundu, ngachemanyi malobhi ghaulongela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Palapala paakabhi akali kulongela, likongobhi lakabhekike. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Bambo akang'anambwiki na kundingali Petulu. Na jombi Petulu akakombwiki malobhi ghala Bambo ghaampwagi, kubha, “Lalenu mangani ja kubheka likongobhe, wingana mala patatu kubha ngacheunimanyi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Petulu akapitiki kunja na kulela kwa kumbina mtima.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhundongama na kulapulika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mako 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Bhandu bhala bhabhabhi bhundenda Yesu, bhakatumbwi kundongama na kundapula. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bhakunhibhiki mihu kwa ingobhu na kundalukila, “Ulotilaje! Bho, akulapwi nane?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Na bhombi bhakundongali malobhi ghangi ghamahele gha kuntondola.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhumpeleka pachengo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Palukela, bhazee, bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhabhola bha Shelia bhakahimangini, na bhakumpeliki Yesu palongi ja pachengu jabhu. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Na bhombi bhakapwaghike, “Tupwaghilaje! Bho, wehapa le wa Kristo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Nambu Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Hata ngati ananumpwaghile, ngamwihobhalele, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>na hata ngati ananundaluki lilalukilu, ngamuniyange. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Nambu kutumbu sajenu, Mwana waka Mundu ayibya atami upambala wa kumalelelu waka Chapanga Mweni Makili.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Bhela bhokapi bhakundalukile, “Bho, nde kupwagha kubha wehapa le wa Mwana waka Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Na jombi akabhayangike, “Mwenga mpwagha chakaka kubha nepani nde jombi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Na bhombi bhakapwaghike, “Bho, tupala le mundu jongi ahikaje na atupwaghila ulandilu wake? Maghambu tepani tabhete tujowini akapwagha kwa ndomu waki mweni!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhumpeleka kwaka Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha pachengo pakolongwa bhakajemiki na kumpeleka Yesu kwaka Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Bhakatumbwi kuntakila, bhakapwaghaje, “Tunketani mundu ajoju akabhakoluwa bhandu bhitu. Apenga kulepa kode kwaka Kaisali, na kulilowa kubha jombi nde Kristo, Nkolongwa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilato akundaluki Yesu, “Bho, wehapa le unkolongwa wa Bhayahude?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu akayangike, “Wehapa upwaghike.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Bhela Pilato akabhapwaghi bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na lipogha la bhandu kubha, “Nepani ngachemona lihakau lokapi lela la kuntaki mundu ajoju.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Nambu bhombi bhakajomalaki nakanopi, bhakapwaghaje, “Kwa mabholu ghaki abhachochake bhandu bhabhabhi ku Yudea jokapi. Akatumbwi ku Galilaya na sajenu abhi pitu pani.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhumpeleka kwaka Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilato paajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akalalukile, “Bho, mundu ajo le mwenei wa ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Paakamanyi kubha Yesu akahumi ku inchi jeatawala Helode, akumpeliki kwaka Helode, maghambu akabhi ku Yelusalemu chikahi chela. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Helode paakambweni Yesu, akahekali namaa maghambu kwa machobha ghamahele akabhi atokule kumbona. Maghambu akajowini malobhi panani jaki, najombi akapaliki kubhona nginyulila kuhuma kwaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Bhela Helode akundaluki Yesu malalukilu ghamahele, nambu Yesu ngacheayangiki lilobhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhabhola bha Shelia bhakajemiki panipala, bhakabhoha matakilu ghabhu kwa makili panani jaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Bhela Helode papamu na manjolinjoli bhaki bhakunhekiki Yesu na kundongama. Bhakunhwatiki ingobhu jinyahi ngati nkolongwa na kunkelabhu kwaka Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Kutumbu lichobha heli Helode akabhi nkochi waka Pilato, maghambu pamwandi bhakabhi maadui.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atemulika kupotela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Bhela Pilato akalohiki uhimanganu wa bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa, ihongozi bha bhandu na bhandu bhabhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>na kubhapwaghila, “Mundetiki mundu ajo kwangu mkapwagha kubha abhachochake bhandu. Henu nepani nundaluki malobhi ghaki palongi jinu, nambu ngachenumbweni na lihakau lokapi lela lemuntaki mabhanganya. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Hata Helode ngacheambweni na lihakau, na kwa ndandi jeniheji ankelawi kwitu. Chakaka kubha mundu ajoju ngacheahengiki lihakau lokapi lela lelumpalika kupotela. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Bhela ananaghalakya alapulika iboku, na kundekakela.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Bhela kila lichobha la Uwangalalu wa Pasaka, Pilato ikampaliki kubhabhopule bhandu nkongeka jumu.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Nambu bhokapi kwa papamu bhakajamali, bhakapwaghaje, “Umboha mundu hoju! Utubhopulya Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balaba bhakunkongiki kwa kutumbuli fujo yeyatendakiki ku muchi na kwa ndandi ja kukoma.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilato akapaliki kundekake Yesu, bhela akalongi nabhu kabhete. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Nambu bhombi bhakajamali kabhete, “Unhwamba punsalaba! Unhwamba punsalaba!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilato akabhapwaghi kabheti mala ja katatu, “Bho, maghambu ja kyane? Bho, ahengiki lihakau bhole? Ngachemweni lihakau lokapi kwaki lelumpalika kukomakeka. Bhela ananundapula iboku ya ndomondo na kundekakela.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Nambu bhombi bhakajendali kujamali nakanopi, bhakajopa Yesu awambakika punsalaba. Na kwa kujamalila kwabhu kukantendiki Pilato ajetakyaje. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Bhela Pilato akaamwi kubhahenge ngati mobhapalilaje. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Akumbopuli mundu jobhumpalika jola, joakongakiki muchifungu kwa kuchokake fujo na kukoma, na kumboha Yesu kwabhu nahuli bhunhengila ngati mobhapalilaje.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambakika punsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Pabhakabhi bhumpeleka, bhakahimangini na mundu jumu joalowakika Simoni, mwenei wa ku Kilene, joakabhi ahuma kungonda kuhika kumuchi. Bhela bhakunkamwili, na kuntweka aunyamula nsalaba punyuma jaka Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Lipogha likolongwa la bhandu lakabhi lunjengalela, pachilanda jabhu bhakabhi akambomba bhakabya bhundelela na kumuombulezela. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu akabhang'anambukili na kubhapwaghila, “Mwenga akambomba bha Yelusalemu, ngamwinele nepani, nambu mulilelila mabhete papamu na bhana bhinu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Kwa ndandi machobha ghahika ambapu bhandu pabhipwagha, ‘Mbanga kwabhu akambomba ngulumba, bhangakubheleka bhana, na bhangakujongeha!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Chikahi hechi bhandu bhitumbula kwipwaghi itombi, ‘Mtuhabhukyaje!’ Na tutombi, ‘Mtuyekalyaje!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Kwa ndandi ngati bhandu bhutende nkongu ubhehi ntundu agho, bho, kwibya bhole kwa nkongu ujomo?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Bhakabhatohi kabheti bhahakau bhangi bhabhele, bhakapelakiki kukomakeka papamu na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Pabhahiki pandu papalowakeka, “Lifuvu la Mmutu,” panihapa nde pabhunhwambiki Yesu punsalaba papamu na bhahenga mahakau bhala kila jumu punsalaba waki, jumu upambala wa kumalelelu na jongi upambala wa kumangeja ja msalaba waka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu akapwaghike, “Atati! Ubhalekakyaje mahoku ghabhu, maghambu ngachebhamanyi lebhalihenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Bhela bhakaghabhini ingobhu yaki kwa kwilapuli kula. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Bhandu bhakajemi panipala bhakalingalyaje. Na bhombi bhakolongwa bha Bhayahude bhakundongimi Yesu, “Akabhakengali bhandu bhangi, henu alikengalya mwene, anangati jombi nde Kristo, joahaghuliki na Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Manjolinjoli na bhombi bhakundongimi, bhakunjendili na kumpeke divai jejibhabha, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>bhakumpwaghile, “Ana ngati chakaka wehapa nde Nkolongwa wa Bhayahude, ulikengalya wamwene!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Na panani ja msalaba waki ghakalembakiki malobhi ghangane, “AJOJU NDE NKOLONGWA WA BHAYAHUDE.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mwihi jumu pachilanda ja bhabhawambakiki punsalaba bhala, akuntondwi Yesu, akapwagha, “Bho, nga chakaka le kubha wehapa nde Kristo? Bhela ulikengalya wamwete na utukengalya na tepani!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Nambu mwihi jongi jola akundakali njaki akapwagha, “Bho, wehapa le ngacheunjoghopa Chapanga hata pachokope? Koni nanau utemuliwi bhelabhela. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Wenga na nepani tutemuliwi ngati mokupalakila, maghambu ghangani nde malepu gha ghala ghatuhengike. Nambu mundu ajoju ngacheahengiki chindu chokapi chihakau.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Bhela akajonjuki kupwagha, “Wenga Yesu, ungombukaje chikahi pawihikaje mu Ukolongwa waku!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu akayangiki, “Chakaka nukupwaghi wehapa lalenu anana, wibya papamu na nepani ku Paladiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apotela punsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Ikabhi ngati saa sita ja muhi, lubhendu lukayekiki inchi jokapi mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>na lipanzia lelakabhi libhekakiki mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga lakakachwiki ipandi ibhele. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Panihapa Yesu akajamali, akapwagha, “Atati! Mu mabhoku ghaku nijibheka roho jangu.” Na paakajomwi kulongela ghanihagha, akahekiti roho.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli mia moja wa ki Loma jola paakaweni mambu ghanihagha ghaghapitalile, akundumbali Chapanga, akapwagha, “Chakaka mundu ajoju akabhi wambone.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhabhalibhongini panipala kwa ndandi ja kulingali mambu ghanihagha, pabhaghaweni ghokapi ghaghapitalile, bhakakelawiki kumanyumba ghabhu koni bhakabya na huzuni ngolongwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Bhakochi bhaka Yesu papamu na akambomba bhabhunjengali kutumbu ku Galilaya, bhakajemiki cha kutali bhakalingalya mambu ghanihagha.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bhuntagha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Kukabhi na mundu jumu, joalowakika Yusufu, ambaju akabhi mundu wa pachengu, akabhi mundu wamboni na wa kutopela. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Akabhi mundu wa ku Alimataya, na akabhi alendale kuhika kwa Ukolongwa waka Chapanga. Papamu na kubha akabhi jumu wabhu wa Pachengo Pakolongwa pa Bhayahude, ngacheakajetangani nabhu kwa ghokapi ghabhahengiki bhajake. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Bhela Yusufu akapiti kwaka Pilato, akajopiki ampekya hyegha jaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Bhela akajiheli hyegha jaka Yesu kuhuma punsalaba, akajiyongalwi sanda, na kujibheka hyegha jaka Yesu mulitengele lelalenganakiki mu liganga, lelakabhi likona nga kutaghakika mundu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Lichobha heli lakabhi Ijumaa, na Lichobha la Sabato lakabhi litumbula.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Akambomba bhala bhabhakunjengali Yesu kutumbu ku Galilaya bhakunjengali Yusufu, bhakaliweni litengeli na ntundu hyegha jaka Yesu mobhakajibhekile. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Bhela bhakakelawiki kunyumba, na kulenganakela manungilu na mahuta gha kujipaka hyegha jaka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Na Lichobha la Sabato bhakapomulili, ngati mojilaghalaki Shelia.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Jumapili lukela pachibhombu, akambomba bhala bhakapiti kulitengeli, koni bhatoghwi manungilu ghabhalenganakile. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Bhakalihimani liganga la kuyekalela litengeli lela likangakiki kutali na litengele.<figure style="fig" alt="A stone rolled away from a tomb" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Liganga lelikangakiki kutali na litengele</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bhela bhakajingi mulitengeli, nambu ngachebhajiweni hyegha jaka Bambo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Pabhakabhi bhaholale panani ja lilobhi leniheli, palapala bhandu bhabhele bhabhaweti ingobhu ihuhu kupukupu bhakajemiki pambipi nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Akambomba bhala bhakajowipi namaa na kujinama mbaka pahi. Nambu bhandu bhala bhakabhapwaghile, “Bho, magambu kiki mundonda joayokiki pachilanda ja bhabhawile? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Yesu ngacheabhi pambane, ahyokike! Nkombuka moakampwaghile chikahi paakabhi ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Akumpwaghi kubha, ‘Mwana waka Mundu anabhumpelaka mu mabhoku gha bhana mahoku, na kuwambakika punsalaba, nambu lichobha la katatu ayiyokaje.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Panihapa akambomba bhala bhakakombwiki malobhi ghaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Bhakakelawiki kuhuma kulitengeli, na bhakabhapwaghi mambu ghanihagha bhabhulwa bhaki komi na jumu bhala, na kwa bhahemba bhangi bhokapi bhaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Akambomba bhabhapwaghika mambu ghanihagha kwa mitumi bhaka Yesu bhakabhi nde, Malia Magidalena, na Yoana, na Malia mabhu waka Yakobo, na akambomba bhangi bhabhakabhi papamu nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Nambu mitumi bhaka Yesu bhakaghatohi mambu ghanihagha kubha ngati gha upuhe, na bhela ngachebhahobhalile. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Nambu Petulu akajemiki, na kukembela imbelu mbaka kulitengeli. Paakahikiki, akajinimi na kulingali mkati, akaiweni pe sanda. Bhela akabhujiki kunyumba koni akangacha kwa ndandi ja mambu ghaghapitalile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujenda ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mako 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Lichobha lelalela, bhabhulwa bhabhele bhaka Yesu bhakabhi bhajenda ku chijiji chimu chekilowakeka Emau, chechikabhi utali wa kilometa komi na moja kuhuma ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Bhakabhi bhalongale panani ja mambu ghokapi ghaghapitalile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Pabhakabhi bhalongale na kulaluwana, Yesu mweni akabhaheghali pambipi na kulongana nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Bhakumbweni nambu ngachebhumanye. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu akabhalalukile, “Bho, ndongale kiki koni njenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Na bhombi bhakajemiki na kutumbala chinunu, koni bhakalangiya pamihu jabhu kubha bhabhi na huzuni. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Jumu wabhu pachilanda ja bhandu bhanihabha, joalowakika Kileopa, akamuyangike, “Bho, wehapa le ungeni kanjika jaku ku Yelusalemu, wangakumanya mambu ghaghapitali konihoku machobha ghane?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Jombi akabhalalukile, “Mambu bhole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Bhombi bhakamuyangiki, “Mambu ghaghumpitali Yesu wa ku Nazaleti. Mundu hoju akabhi mlota waka Chapanga joakabhi na uwezu wa kuhenga na kubhola palongi jaka Chapanga na palongi ja bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Bhapenganyambiku bhakolongwa na bhatawala bhitu bhakumbohiki nahuli atemuliwa kupotela, na bhombi bhakunhwambiki punsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Tepani tukahobhali kubha jombi nde joabhakombulaje bhandu bha Izilaeli. Nambu lalenu nde lichobha la katatu kutumbu mambu ghanihagha paghahengakike. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Bhelabhela akambomba bhangi kuhuma mulipogha litu bhatehi kutukangacha. Bhakapiti kulitengeli lukela pachibhombu, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>nambu ngachebhakajiweni hyegha jaki. Bhela bhakakelawiki na kutupwaghi kubha bhakapitaliwi na bhatumika bha kunani kwaka Chapanga na kubhapwaghi kubha Yesu abhi mwome. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Bhakumu bhitu bhakapiti kulitengeli, na kughahimani mambu ghokapi chakaka ngati mobhapwaghila akambomba bhala, nambu jombi ngachebhumbwene.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Bhela Yesu akabhapwaghile, “Bho, mbona mbi mwang'ang'a bhenibhela, na mitima jinu jinonwopi kuhobhalela malobhi ghokapi ghaghalongaliki na bhalota bhaka Chapanga? <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Bho, ngachekumpaliki Kristo kung'ahakika, na bhela kujingi mu ulumbalilu waki?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Akabhapwaghi mambu ghokapi ghaghumpalika jombi mu Malembu Mahuhu ghokapi, kutumbu itabu yokapi yaka Musa na kujendale mu itabhu yokapi ya bhalota bhokapi bhaka Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Pabhakaheghali pambipi na chijiji chebhapita chela, Yesu akalengiki kubha ngati ajendale na mwanja, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>nambu bhombi bhakumpembali namaa, bhakapwaghaje, “Utama papamu na tepani, maghambu kutenda kupilila, na ikilu kuheghalela.” Bhela akapiti na kutama papamu nabhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Paakatami kula chilebhi papamu nabhu, akatoliki libumunda, akalipengalili, akalihekiti, na kubhapekeha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Palapala mihu ghabhu ghakahoghuliwi, bhakummanye, nambu jombi akahobhiki pamihu jabhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Bhela bhakapwaghanile, “Bho, mitima jitu le ngachejibhelala mkati jitu paakabhi atuyekulila Malembu Mahuhu kwindela kola?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Palapala bhakabhokiki na kukelabhuka ku Yelusalemu. Konikola bhakabhaketani mitumi komi na jumu bhala bhalibhongini papamu, bhakabya na bhandu bhangi bhabhakabhili papamu nabhu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>bhakapwaghaje, “Chakaka Bambo ayokike, na akumpitali Simoni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Bhela bhabhulwa bhabheli bhala bhakabhalandi mambu ghala ghaghapatiki mwindela, na ntundu mobhakummanyi paakabhi aheketa libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abhapitali bhabhulwa bhaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Pabhakabhi bhapwaghanila ghanihagha, palapala Yesu mweni akajemiki pachilanda jabhu, na kubhapwaghila, “Lukwali lukubha na mwehapa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Bhakakenyamwiki na kujoghopa namaa, bhakaholakya pangi bhaweni lihoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Nambu jombi akabhapwaghile, “Bho, mbona mlagha? Bho, mbona nkubha na choghohi mu mitima jinu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Ndingalya mabhoku na magholu ghangu, kubha nde nepani namwete. Mbapiya mbonaje, maghambu lihoka ngachelibhi na hyegha wala ihupa ngati mommone nepane.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Paakajomwi kulonge ghanighala, akabhalangi mabhoku na magholu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bhombi pabhakabhi bhakona ngakuhobhalela, kwa ndandi ja chiheku na kukangacha, Yesu akabhalalukile, “Bho, mbi na chilebhi chokapi chela pambane?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bhakumpeki chipandi cha homba ja kujocha. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Akachitoliki, akalili koni bhokapi bhakabya bhumbona.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Bhela akabhapwaghile, “Aghagha nde mambu ghanakumpwaghili chikahi panakabhi nakona papamu na mwehapa: Kubha ipalika ghapitalya mambu ghokapi ghaghalembakiki panani jangu mu Shelia yaka Musa, na mu Malembu gha bhalota bhaka Chapanga na mu Chitabu cha Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Panihapa akabhayekwi malangu ghabhu nahuli bhapata kumanya Malembu Mahuhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Akabhapwaghile, “Ilembakiki mu Malembu Mahuhu kubha Kristo aying'ahakika na kuyoka lichobha la katatu. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Bhandu bhokapi bhapalika kutangaziwa kwa lihina laki bhang'anambukaje na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu, na Chapanga anaabhalekakya mahoku ghabhu, kutumbula ku Yelusalemu na kwa inchi yokapi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Mabhanganya nde momwapwaghila bhandu kubha mambu ghokapi ghaghapitalili hagha nde gha chakaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Nepani namweti ananundetila jola Atati wangu joapwaghiki anaantumaje. Nambu mwenga ndendalya moni mu Yelusalemu, mbaka pamwijopalya makili ghala ghaghahuma kunani kumahunde.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akelabhuka kujenda kunani kumahunde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mako 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Matendu 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Bhela akabhalongwi kunja ja muchi wa Yelusalemu mbaka ku Besania, akajinwi mabhoku ghaki na kubhapengalela. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Paakabhi abhapengalela, akabhalekiki, na kutolakeka kujenda kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Bhombi bhakunjojabhili, na panihapa bhakakelawiki ku Yelusalemu bhakabya na chiheku nakanopi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Machobha ghokapi bhakajendali kutama pa Nyumba jaka Chapanga koni bhakundumbalya Chapanga. Amina.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
